<node id="&quot;U.S. TERRITORIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"U.S. Territories refer to regions under U.S. jurisdiction, highlighted for their ineligibility for certain mortgage approvals."&lt;SEP&gt;"U.S. Territories refer to specific regions such as Guam, Puerto Rico, American Samoa, and Northern Mariana Islands, where Flagstar Bank does not currently lend."&lt;SEP&gt;"U.S. Territories refers to regions such as Guam and Puerto Rico where specific property eligibility criteria are outlined for financing."</data>
