<node id="&quot;LAVA ZONES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lava Zones 1 and 2 are designated areas that are prohibited for certain financing under Freddie Mac guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lava Zones refer to designated areas that are hazardous due to volcanic activity, with specific references to Freddie Mac prohibiting transactions in these zones."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lava Zones refer to geographic areas identified as at risk for lava flows from volcanic eruptions, influencing property eligibility for mortgage financing."</data>
