<node id="&quot;HOMESTYLE RENOVATION PRODUCT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Homestyle Renovation Product is a financing product that allows homeowners to borrow against the value of their home for renovations, but has specific eligibility restrictions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Homestyle Renovation product is a specific financing option for home renovations that is mentioned as being ineligible for improvements to manufactured home accessory units."</data>
