<node id="&quot;MANUFACTURED HOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Manufactured Home is a type of dwelling that is built in a factory and must comply with safety standards set by HUD. It must be permanently affixed to land for it to qualify as real property."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Manufactured Home is a type of dwelling that must be secured by a perfected lien on real property, including both the home and the land it occupies."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Manufactured Home is a type of prefabricated home that is constructed off-site and transported to the location where it is permanently situated, which is noted as ineligible for Leasehold Mortgages."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Manufactured Home is a type of prefabricated housing that is largely assembled in factories and then transported to sites for use as residences."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Manufactured Home is classified as a one-family dwelling-unit that bears the characteristics of site-built housing and is legally classified as real property."&lt;SEP&gt;"Manufactured Home refers to a type of prefabricated housing discussed in the context of various mortgage eligibility guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Manufactured Homes are factory-built homes that must comply with federal safety standards and can be classified as accessory dwelling units if they meet specific criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Manufactured Homes refer to homes that can be transported and require specific guidelines regarding their eligibility for financing and appraisals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Manufactured homes are prefabricated structures that are transportable and built in a factory, subject to federal regulations and standards for safety and quality."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Manufactured Home is a prefabricated structure used as a residence that may be financed through loans related to real estate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b81be5b6336b17987b5cd27bc0cf519d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00440a55cc64896de959c80a8727fbfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf0031128e81eed5883f39146514f546&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98fca990e6b71624308defbc9fca0285&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31dff4bfbf6291a2db9c4969e0f5cbe0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f55695b58ffd5e2ba42b42a2ed0cdbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-241759937af28f9856986aac2ee15cb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c568dd7273250cbc578b2e15944d1bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f562ac717c24b9fccfb1aab0164fb157&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebee13ef54f5a678a952e514a3a25998</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 128}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 371}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPRAISAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An appraisal is a professional assessment of property value conducted by an appraiser, taking into account various factors to determine market value."&lt;SEP&gt;"An appraisal is an assessment conducted to determine the value of a property, necessary for compliance with lending requirements, especially for accessory units."&lt;SEP&gt;"Appraisal is an evaluation process to determine the value of the property, which factors in the presence and impact of solar panels in the assessment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Appraisal is the assessment process used to determine the market value of a property, considering various factors including environmental conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Appraisal is the process conducted to evaluate a property's value, which is subject to the completion of required repairs and improvements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Appraisal is the process of determining the market value of a property, which should take into account the presence and value of solar panels."&lt;SEP&gt;"Appraisal is the process of determining the value of a property, typically conducted by an appraiser to assess its worth before financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Appraisal is the process of evaluating a property's value, often conducted by a certified appraiser based on market conditions, property characteristics, and comparables."&lt;SEP&gt;"Appraisal refers to the assessment of property value, required to verify compliance with mortgage standards listed in Freddie Mac's guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-00440a55cc64896de959c80a8727fbfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98fca990e6b71624308defbc9fca0285&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-756642bc27ab7956732455451eb4ce71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd684789b748cb20186f7859db539838&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37ec0ad59b15ed4e4c83850695f40593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d77c56c7ef7f25742c687f6ad137c8f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-241759937af28f9856986aac2ee15cb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2c659b65edef4a5e599f9445602b752&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f443d70c1b97ab92c6f9f441ec9ced99</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 141}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 393}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OCCUPANCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Occupancy denotes the status of the primary residence which must be the principal residence of the borrower in eligibility evaluations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Occupancy refers to the act of living in a property, which affects its classification as a primary residence or investment property."&lt;SEP&gt;"Occupancy refers to the borrower's agreement to live in the property for a specified time, which is a condition for owner-occupied transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Occupancy refers to the intended use of the property by the borrower, indicating whether it will be a principal residence or a second home."&lt;SEP&gt;"Occupancy refers to the status of a property regarding whether it is owner-occupied or rented out, impacting the eligibility for rental income use in qualifying income calculations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Occupancy refers to the status of delivering a property as a primary residence or secondary home, impacting loan terms and eligibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Occupancy refers to the use and residence status of a property, significant in determining eligibility for mortgage applications outlined in Flagstar's policies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Occupancy refers to the use of a property, indicating whether it is a principal residence, secondary home, or investment property, which can affect lending terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Occupancy specifies the type of living arrangement the borrower intends for the property, like principal residence or second home."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-00440a55cc64896de959c80a8727fbfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b454650a6e8dde5a93325db30813c30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-446d02f0d6609ee8a932eea7a8d1302e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49e500168a0590aef42a229f4ea93fe3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0ff713c7eebcf293485e860ba8cc6a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-241759937af28f9856986aac2ee15cb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a9a7e59e34af57946c09cfa07672f92</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 129}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 376}]</data>
</node>
