<node id="&quot;AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Agent refers to an individual who acts on behalf of the borrower in transactions, emphasizing the importance of fiduciary interest and eligibility specifications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Agent represents a person who acts on behalf of the borrower in mortgage transactions, including family members or individuals with a fiduciary interest."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Agent in this context is a person who is authorized to act on behalf of another, specifically in regards to a transaction involving a power of attorney."&lt;SEP&gt;"An agent in this context refers to an individual who acts on behalf of another person in legal matters, with certain restrictions applied."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-241759937af28f9856986aac2ee15cb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a0d9684317720eb42eaa206a9f3cc5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e857c204b7048098a278905f60d5302&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1cb7303f4ec7884e602c27628160dc28</data>
