<node id="&quot;TITLE COMMITMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Title Commitment is a document issued by a title company that outlines the conditions under which it will issue a title insurance policy, relevant in real estate transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A title commitment is a document issued by a title company that outlines the terms under which the title company is willing to issue a title insurance policy, vital for mortgage transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title Commitment is a document from a title insurer outlining the terms and conditions under which a title insurance policy will be issued."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title Commitment is a document issued by a title company that indicates the condition of title to a property and the insurability of that title."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title Commitment is a document issued by a title company that outlines the conditions under which the title to a property will be transferred and any existing liens or encumbrances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title Commitment is a document that outlines the terms of the title insurance policy and the property's ownership history, which cannot exceed certain time limits."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title Commitment is a legal document that outlines the details of property ownership and indicates the conditions under which a title insurance policy will be issued."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d864e2754e1d5a70d89033bc8babcdcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46cceddf672b67421d8f87a3665f1ddf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d10b21d56993c3c6bc0aa80dd4168911&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6434821b2faf91ece4b375276017b775&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05020d8707d581b6c2d0c1b184d17f01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35b11a1ced8de5c90f65c0b1344222c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f562ac717c24b9fccfb1aab0164fb157</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 211}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 514}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-PERMANENT RESIDENT ALIENS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Non-Permanent Resident Aliens are individuals who are not U.S. citizens and are legally present in the United States, seeking loans under specific guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Non-Permanent Resident Aliens refers to borrowers who are not U.S. citizens but are legally present in the U.S. and have specific income documentation for mortgage qualifications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-46cceddf672b67421d8f87a3665f1ddf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d10b21d56993c3c6bc0aa80dd4168911</data>
