</node>
<node id="&quot;ESCROW WAIVERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Escrow Waivers are permissions granted to waive the requirement of an escrow account for certain transactions if specific conditions are met."&lt;SEP&gt;"Escrow Waivers indicate the situations in which lenders may waive the requirement to establish an escrow account for property taxes and insurance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-46cceddf672b67421d8f87a3665f1ddf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d10b21d56993c3c6bc0aa80dd4168911</data>
