<node id="&quot;CASH-OUT REFINANCING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cash-Out Refinancing is a mortgage transaction where the homeowner refinances their mortgage for more than the amount owed and takes the difference in cash."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d10b21d56993c3c6bc0aa80dd4168911</data>
