<node id="&quot;SPECIAL PURPOSE CASH-OUT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Special Purpose Cash-Out describes the scenario where refinancing proceeds are used to buy out the equity of a co-owner in property transactions."</data>
