<node id="&quot;ATTORNEY OPINION LETTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Attorney Opinion Letter is a document provided by an attorney confirming that legal aspects of the title and property transactions are satisfactory, which is required under specific conditions."</data>
