<node id="&quot;TITLE INSURER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Title Insurer is a company that provides insurance against defects in title to real property, protecting lenders and homeowners from claims against the title."&lt;SEP&gt;"A title insurer is an organization that provides insurance against potential defects in a title, mentioned in the context of issuing gap letters."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title Insurer is a company that provides insurance coverage for issues related to property titles, ensuring that the buyer receives clear ownership."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d10b21d56993c3c6bc0aa80dd4168911&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d864e2754e1d5a70d89033bc8babcdcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1cb7303f4ec7884e602c27628160dc28</data>
