</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-OWNER-OCCUPIED LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Non-owner-occupied loans are a type of mortgage designed for properties that are not occupied by the borrower, with specific regulatory requirements to follow."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-46cceddf672b67421d8f87a3665f1ddf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TEMPORARY BUYDOWNS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Temporary Buydowns refer to a financing arrangement that temporarily reduces the interest rate on a loan for initial periods, which are not allowed according to the stated rules."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-46cceddf672b67421d8f87a3665f1ddf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACCEPT OR APPROVE FROM LPA/DU&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Accept or Approve from LPA/DU refers to the automated underwriting systems used by lenders to evaluate loan applications for approval."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-46cceddf672b67421d8f87a3665f1ddf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 178}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 435}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ONE-YEAR TAXES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"One-Year Taxes refer to the requirement for borrowers to document their taxes for the previous year as part of the loan approval process."</data>
