<node id="&quot;REGULATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Regulations are prescribed rules or laws that govern the conduct of lenders and the terms of lending practices in the mortgage industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulations are rules or directives made and maintained by an authority to regulate practices, including the financing of manufactured homes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-46cceddf672b67421d8f87a3665f1ddf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf0031128e81eed5883f39146514f546</data>
