</node>
<node id="&quot;ESCROW ACCOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORM_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Escrow Account is a financial account held by Flagstar Bank to manage funds used for paying taxes and insurance on behalf of the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Escrow Account is a financial arrangement in which a third party holds funds on behalf of two parties in a transaction, often related to property taxes and insurance."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Escrow Account is a financial arrangement where a third party holds funds or assets on behalf of the parties involved, often used to manage real estate taxes and closing costs during the mortgage process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-46cceddf672b67421d8f87a3665f1ddf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f76dd878d76d1e8bdf5fb1cac46447ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7e863cbccfa45dfb855f96b39c4e7be</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 108}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 352}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 545}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROPERTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Property is a physical asset that is subject to occupancy rules and can be classified as a second home or rental."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property is a term used to describe real estate owned by an individual or entity, including residential and commercial buildings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property refers to a piece of real estate, including the physical land and any buildings or structures on it."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property refers to physical real estate assets owned by individuals or entities, which can be bought, sold, or refinanced."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property refers to real estate assets owned by an individual, relevant for capital gains assessment and potentially for collateral in mortgage agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property refers to real estate assets that are subject to various guidelines, including income-based resale restrictions and environmental risk evaluations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property refers to real estate or land being appraised, which is subject to various regulations and market influences affecting its value."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property refers to real estate or physical assets that borrowers may be purchasing or refinancing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property refers to real estate that can be rented, and includes specifications related to investment properties and management practices in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property refers to real estate that is bought or refined in the context of mortgage transactions and financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property refers to real estate that is subject to appraisal and valuation processes, influenced by various market factors."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property refers to real estate, which is subject to appraisal requirements and various regulations affecting its value and marketability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property refers to the real estate or physical asset involved in mortgage transactions, including terms and restrictions on sales."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property refers to the real estate or physical asset that is the subject of the mortgage loan and its related financial obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property refers to the real estate under consideration in the appraisal process, encompassing its physical features and improvements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2e912b60195be8ca87a44127ef55d282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1da51e05e6600babe4a36494acdf7928&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1eb0558635c4f1b731b5f38c1ed9bb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b454650a6e8dde5a93325db30813c30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f76dd878d76d1e8bdf5fb1cac46447ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-756642bc27ab7956732455451eb4ce71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd684789b748cb20186f7859db539838&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e26a3be3838ff40fb61edfe66e0268a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e98d878b21daedfefbf36b036612418f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12708616563afb36a31ad3cf8523241b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48dc06181f6c67399f82ff0110257532&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46cceddf672b67421d8f87a3665f1ddf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1955da1ebc911d30ff778d5b9e719028&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fb1c993d98cbaba5a6755fc57b9ff69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d83092219c6a0be0948a52ad38b945a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 147}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 404}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lenders are financial institutions or individuals that offer loans to borrowers, responsible for underwriting loan applications and assessing risk."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders are financial institutions or individuals who provide funds to borrowers in the form of loans, under specific terms and conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-46cceddf672b67421d8f87a3665f1ddf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55b73f39faaa03ed0e70ba760ab8eca4</data>
