</node>
<node id="&quot;POLICY GOVERNING ESCROW ACCOUNTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Policy Governing Escrow Accounts outlines the rules and conditions under which escrow accounts may be established or waived by lenders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-46cceddf672b67421d8f87a3665f1ddf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FEDERAL NATIONAL MORTGAGE ASSOCIATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Federal National Mortgage Association, also known as Fannie Mae, is a government-sponsored enterprise that provides liquidity by purchasing mortgages."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6c0b7f4552e556318a58e96c9230e51e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 96}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 331}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COVID-19 GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Temporary COVID Guidelines outline regulations and considerations that are to be followed during the COVID-19 pandemic."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6c0b7f4552e556318a58e96c9230e51e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 96}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 333}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSUMER CREDIT PROTECTION ACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Consumer Credit Protection Act encompasses various laws to ensure the fair treatment of consumers in lending practices."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Consumer Credit Protection Act is a federal law aimed at fostering fair lending and protecting consumers from abuse in credit practices."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-73d6f2ebab21a8901f9725aa2d65678d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c0b7f4552e556318a58e96c9230e51e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 29}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN INTEGRITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Integrity refers to the adherence to ethical standards and regulations in the evaluation and processing of credit applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Integrity refers to the responsibility of lending institutions to prevent mortgage fraud and ensure the accuracy of loan information during origination."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-73d6f2ebab21a8901f9725aa2d65678d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c0b7f4552e556318a58e96c9230e51e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 108}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 353}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONVENTIONAL MORTGAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Conventional Mortgages are home loans that conform to the guidelines set by Fannie Mae and Freddie Mac, allowing greater access to funding for borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6c0b7f4552e556318a58e96c9230e51e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 96}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 331}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AUTOMATED UNDERWRITING SYSTEM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Automated Underwriting System (AUS) is a technology platform used to evaluate the creditworthiness of borrowers and the risk associated with loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6c0b7f4552e556318a58e96c9230e51e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 96}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 329}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECONDARY MARKET INVESTORS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Secondary Market Investors are entities that purchase mortgages from lenders to free up capital, allowing lenders to issue more loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6c0b7f4552e556318a58e96c9230e51e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 108}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 353}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSUMER'S ABILITY TO REPAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Consumer's Ability to Repay refers to the assessment of a borrower's financial capability to meet loan obligations based on their income, debts, and assets."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6c0b7f4552e556318a58e96c9230e51e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 50}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MONTHLY DEBT-TO-INCOME RATIO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Monthly Debt-to-Income Ratio is a financial measure used to assess a borrower's ability to manage monthly payments and repay debts."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6c0b7f4552e556318a58e96c9230e51e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 50}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN-TO-VALUE RATIO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan-to-Value Ratio (LTV) is a financial metric used by lenders to evaluate the risk of a loan based on the relationship between the loan amount and the appraised value of the property."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan-to-Value Ratio (LTV) is a financial term that measures the ratio of a loan to the value of an asset purchased and is critical for underwriting and eligibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan-to-Value Ratio (LTV) compares the amount of the loan to the appraised value of the property, indicating the risk associated with the loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d9640138f8accaa3b0962e60c94ddc9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37ec0ad59b15ed4e4c83850695f40593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c0b7f4552e556318a58e96c9230e51e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 104}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 346}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESIDUAL INCOME AMOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Residual Income Amount is the income left over after subtracting all monthly expenses from a borrower’s total income, used to evaluate loan eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6c0b7f4552e556318a58e96c9230e51e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 50}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FAIR HOUSING ACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LAW"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Fair Housing Act is a federal law prohibiting discrimination in housing-related practices based on race, color, religion, national origin, sex, familial status, or disability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6c0b7f4552e556318a58e96c9230e51e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 29}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EQUAL CREDIT OPPORTUNITY ACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LAW"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Equal Credit Opportunity Act is a federal law that ensures all consumers are given fair access to credit without discrimination based on race, color, religion, sex, marital status, or national origin."</data>
