<node id="&quot;LIEN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Lien is a legal right or interest that a lender has in a borrower's property, granted until the debt obligation is satisfied."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Lien is a legal right or interest that a lender has in the borrower's property, granted until debt obligations are satisfied."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Lien is a legal right or interest that a lender has in the borrower's property, granted until the obligation is satisfied."&lt;SEP&gt;"A lien refers to a legal right or interest that a lender has in the borrower's property, until the debt obligation is satisfied."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lien refers to a legal right or interest that a lender has in the borrower's property, granted until the debt obligation is satisfied."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d864e2754e1d5a70d89033bc8babcdcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf0031128e81eed5883f39146514f546&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f76dd878d76d1e8bdf5fb1cac46447ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6843059eea11d10d23493c39af4afd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c315a6b793aa073b8f6cb2ffb42e4f97</data>
