<node id="&quot;LOAN APPLICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Loan Application is a formal request for a loan, which includes necessary documentation to verify the legal status and eligibility of the borrower in the United States."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Loan Application is the formal request initiated by a borrower to seek funds from a lender, contingent upon verification of income and eligibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Application is the formal request made by a borrower to a lender seeking to obtain financing for a property or project."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Application is the process during which a borrower submits documentation to qualify for a mortgage, including income verification and supporting documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Application is the process through which a borrower requests a loan, requiring various verifications and compliance with guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Application is the formal request submitted by the Borrower seeking funds, requiring detailed financial and personal information."&lt;SEP&gt;"The loan application process is the procedure through which individuals apply for financing, requiring various verifications of financial stability and income."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d864e2754e1d5a70d89033bc8babcdcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9f00ed91955a5d8af076ae0a21e6a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-444e5ed0aa3891f1dfc3371133a3be60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c5f3698bd3a35ae6c5127d81864d41d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fb1c993d98cbaba5a6755fc57b9ff69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 245}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ESCROW/IMPOUND FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Escrow/Impound Funds are deposits required by Flagstar Bank to ensure that funds are available for property taxes and insurance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d864e2754e1d5a70d89033bc8babcdcc</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VERIFICATIONS OF DEPOSIT (VOD)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Verifications of Deposit (VOD) is a process used to confirm the existence of funds in a borrower's account during the loan approval process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d864e2754e1d5a70d89033bc8babcdcc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 245}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VERBAL VERIFICATIONS FOR EMPLOYMENT (VVOE)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Verbal Verifications for Employment (VVOE) is a method to confirm a borrower's employment status directly with their employer during the loan approval process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d864e2754e1d5a70d89033bc8babcdcc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 245}]</data>
