  <data key="d1">"Designated Employee refers to a specific person within the bank authorized to review exceptions to loan application guidelines on a case-by-case basis."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d864e2754e1d5a70d89033bc8babcdcc</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOCUMENTATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Documentation encompasses the required materials and evidence needed to support a loan application, including financial and personal information."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documentation encompasses the various forms of records that borrowers must provide, such as bank statements, cancelled checks, or creditor statements, to validate their financial information."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documentation encompasses various records and papers that provide proof of transactions, such as payment confirmations and tax-related evidence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documentation in the context of loan applications refers to the collection of paperwork and evidence required to verify a borrower's financial situation and compliance with lending guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documentation involves providing written proof or records that support various aspects of a financial transaction, such as income, source of funds, and credit history."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documentation is the process of collecting and submitting necessary papers to verify income and other financial information during a mortgage application."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documentation refers to supporting records, such as bank statements, required to verify income or other financial information in mortgage applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documentation refers to the collection of necessary papers and reports that support a borrower’s claims regarding their financial circumstances and credit history."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documentation refers to the collection of required papers and records necessary to verify the financial status and obligations of the borrower during the underwriting process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documentation refers to the necessary paperwork and evidence required to support a borrower's loan application, ensuring compliance with financial regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documentation refers to the necessary paperwork and records required to verify ownership, transactions, and financial conditions in the lending process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documentation refers to the necessary paperwork and records that validate the terms of the lease, mortgage, or assignment involved in property transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documentation refers to the process of providing the necessary papers to substantiate a transaction or application in the mortgage process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documentation refers to the required paperwork that provides evidence and details pertaining to mortgage transactions and underwriting processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documentation refers to the required records and proofs provided to verify a borrower's financial and employment details during the lending process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documentation refers to the supporting information required to verify a borrower's mortgage status and any resolutions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documentation refers to the various forms and records needed to support claims, applications, or requests in legal and financial contexts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documentation refers to written evidence used to prove facts, such as income sources and eligibility for benefits in the context of social security."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a021e31a2283c93026e9b4e4159dcdf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d864e2754e1d5a70d89033bc8babcdcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f359b1edc6f123eca67b08265c9b89e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b8e57f220eeefd0215ac958c381bc47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10ce55972cf12e21fd77796ab69a96ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f76dd878d76d1e8bdf5fb1cac46447ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c568dd7273250cbc578b2e15944d1bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cd8475962bfe1c2428c1ea6691488c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b4494b2a290a96f3ee6a9d358a812a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f91be92d53c1aed3b7126461f33e415&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1955da1ebc911d30ff778d5b9e719028&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-105c313a28b49198d2d2b78db6e7529b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fb1c993d98cbaba5a6755fc57b9ff69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-faa30e2538a6e107a9cdb96ee1067084&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35b11a1ced8de5c90f65c0b1344222c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ca2c4d1778a11943201b4e917c15322&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebee13ef54f5a678a952e514a3a25998</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 241}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 534}]</data>
</node>
