<node id="&quot;SUBORDINATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Subordination Agreement is a legal document that establishes the priority of liens in relation to one another, affecting the mortgage approval process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Subordination Agreement is a legal document that establishes the priority of one loan over another in case of borrower default, important for understanding financing hierarchies."</data>
