</node>
<node id="&quot;EXISTING CONSTRUCTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Existing Construction refers to buildings that are already erected and may require repairs or renovations to address issues over time."&lt;SEP&gt;"Existing Construction refers to property that has been previously built and is available for purchase or refinancing in a mortgage transaction."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d864e2754e1d5a70d89033bc8babcdcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed0db69e97fa62c70a7cb29c5e75fe07</data>
