<node id="&quot;NEW CONSTRUCTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"New Construction involves building new structures and may be subject to specific regulations concerning permits and inspections."&lt;SEP&gt;"New Construction pertains to properties that are currently being built or have recently been completed and are available for loan applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"New Construction refers to newly built residential properties that have recently been completed or are under development."&lt;SEP&gt;"New Construction refers to properties that are being built or have been newly built, which may affect eligibility for various underwriting guidelines."</data>
