  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"California is a state in the United States where specific property tax regulations and assessments are applied."&lt;SEP&gt;"California is a state referenced in the context of trust documents and certificates acceptable for legal compliance."&lt;SEP&gt;"California is a state where specific underwriting guidelines and escrow waivers are permitted under regulatory laws."</data>
