<node id="&quot;ESCROW FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Escrow Funds are amounts set aside to ensure that repair obligations are met during property transactions, providing security for both the buyer and seller."&lt;SEP&gt;"Escrow Funds are financial resources set aside for specific purposes, such as property improvements, to ensure transactions are completed as agreed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Escrow Funds are monthly deposits collected by Flagstar Bank to cover future payments such as taxes and insurance premiums."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d77c56c7ef7f25742c687f6ad137c8f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7e863cbccfa45dfb855f96b39c4e7be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed0db69e97fa62c70a7cb29c5e75fe07</data>
