  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Real Estate Tax Credits refer to legitimate credits that can affect the financial obligations of a borrower regarding real estate transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-144555be48c11828e99c3a7c623170fa</data>
