  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 48}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPRAISAL COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Appraisal Costs are expenses associated with evaluating a property's market value, which is often required by lenders during the mortgage process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-144555be48c11828e99c3a7c623170fa</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 78}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 301}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTEREST RATE BUYDOWN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Interest Rate Buydown is a financing option where the borrower pays upfront to lower the interest rate on their mortgage, reducing monthly payments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-144555be48c11828e99c3a7c623170fa</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 86}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ESCROW ACCRUALS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Escrow Accruals are funds set aside in an escrow account to cover future property expenses such as taxes and insurance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-144555be48c11828e99c3a7c623170fa</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 44}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 277}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRO-RATED TAX CREDIT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Pro-Rated Tax Credit is a financial adjustment in real estate transactions reflecting taxes paid in advance or returns on taxes for a portion of the year."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-144555be48c11828e99c3a7c623170fa</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 78}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 303}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PAYMENT ABATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Payment Abatement is an incentive provided to borrowers, involving funds that cover monthly payments on their behalf, influencing borrower obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-05495faf7d0cd92781a907bc384d2f21</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 44}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 277}]</data>
