<node id="&quot;PERSONAL PROPERTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Personal Property refers to movable items that are not permanently affixed, which may or may not be included in a sales price depending on their nature and value."&lt;SEP&gt;"Personal Property refers to movable items that are not permanently attached to land, distinguishing solar panels under certain financial agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Personal property includes movable items that are not fixed to the land or property, distinguishing them from real estate in transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e2c659b65edef4a5e599f9445602b752&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05495faf7d0cd92781a907bc384d2f21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f443d70c1b97ab92c6f9f441ec9ced99</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 179}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 444}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REALTOR COMMISSION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Realtor Commission pertains to fees earned by licensed realtors representing themselves in transactions, with specific requirements for usage during closing."</data>
