</node>
<node id="&quot;SALES PRICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sales Price is the agreed amount at which a property is sold, impacting the calculation of mortgage requirements and insurance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sales Price is the amount agreed upon by the buyer and seller for the purchase of property, influencing the loan amount."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sales Price is the price at which a property is sold, significant in determining the need for mortgage insurance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sales Price is the total value at which a property is offered for sale, crucial in determining financial transactions and estimates of proceeds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sales Price refers to the negotiated amount at which a property is sold, which is crucial for determining loan-to-value ratios in mortgage assessments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sales Price represents the amount for which a property is sold, often influenced by subsidies in affordable housing programs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sales price refers to the final agreed amount for which a property is sold, impacting the borrower's financing and equity."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d30aff8ce4b53c163b59f9369ea58842&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05495faf7d0cd92781a907bc384d2f21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-787de407af176e62ce6eb517b2dd1d21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-023647e2d4d4ed50a6e5f501c055a8b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-464152a069c6a4d42a031274bf69430a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6261b628a88157f5bd4a959ee8fdb8f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebee13ef54f5a678a952e514a3a25998</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 179}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 444}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLTV&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"CLTV (Combined Loan-to-Value Ratio) is the ratio of all loans secured by a property to its appraised value, important for determining mortgage eligibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"CLTV refers to Combined Loan-to-Value ratio, which considers the total amount of loans relative to the property value."&lt;SEP&gt;"CLTV stands for Combined Loan-to-Value, a financial metric comparing the total outstanding loans to the appraised value of the property."&lt;SEP&gt;"CLTV, or Combined Loan-to-Value ratio, is a calculation used in mortgage lending to assess the total amount of loans secured by a property relative to its value."&lt;SEP&gt;"CLTV, or Combined Loan-to-Value ratio, is a financial measurement that compares the total amount of all loans secured by a property to its appraised value."&lt;SEP&gt;"CLTV, or combined loan-to-value ratio, represents the ratio of all loans on a property to its appraised value, used for underwriting assessments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-995f33933031b2ea33803f61f1ece1b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05495faf7d0cd92781a907bc384d2f21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1da51e05e6600babe4a36494acdf7928&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c315a6b793aa073b8f6cb2ffb42e4f97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-164ff18d322608d7342cc1d0619c9f0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 179}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 445}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOWN PAYMENT ASSISTANCE PROGRAM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Down Payment Assistance Program is a program designed to assist buyers in covering the down payment and closing costs of purchasing a home."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-05495faf7d0cd92781a907bc384d2f21</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 94}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 327}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SELLER CONTRIBUTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Seller contributions refer to additional financial assistance provided by the seller to the home buyer, often outside of the official closing process, and can affect the effective sales price and loan-to-value ratio."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c315a6b793aa073b8f6cb2ffb42e4f97</data>
