  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Earnest Money Deposit (EMD) is a deposit made to a seller indicating the buyer's good faith in a transaction, often supported by gift funds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Earnest Money Deposit is a sum paid by a buyer to demonstrate good faith in a real estate transaction, which can contribute to down payments and closing costs."</data>
