<node id="&quot;APPRAISED VALUE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Appraised Value is an estimate of a property's fair market value, determined by a professional appraiser based on various criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Appraised Value is the assessed worth of a property by a qualified appraiser, used in determining mortgage loan eligibility and coverage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Appraised Value is the assessed worth of a property determined by a professional appraiser, influencing loan eligibility and insurance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Appraised Value is the assessed worth of the land or property, crucial for determining mortgage loan amounts and equity contributions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Appraised Value is the determined worth of a property, assessed by a professional appraiser during the mortgage process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Appraised Value is the estimated worth of a property as determined by a professional assessment, crucial for purchase price calculations and financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Appraised Value is the estimated worth of a property determined by a professional appraiser, which plays a critical role in real estate transactions and mortgage financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Appraised Value is the estimated worth of a property determined by a qualified appraiser, serving as a basis for lending decisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Appraised Value is the estimated worth of a property determined by an appraiser, specifically noting the inclusion or exclusion of solar panels in the assessment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b81be5b6336b17987b5cd27bc0cf519d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d048ce21946dbbaf2025fa9d108f909&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37ec0ad59b15ed4e4c83850695f40593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a008bee56d46d46fc9de7e014d26695&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fb1c993d98cbaba5a6755fc57b9ff69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c315a6b793aa073b8f6cb2ffb42e4f97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-464152a069c6a4d42a031274bf69430a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6261b628a88157f5bd4a959ee8fdb8f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebee13ef54f5a678a952e514a3a25998</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 185}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 462}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MARKET RENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Market Rent is the amount that a property could potentially command for rent, determined through comparable sales or rental analyses."&lt;SEP&gt;"Market Rent is the evaluated average rental price of a property in a specific area, which can impact financial calculations for mortgage qualification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Market Rent is the usual rental price for similar properties in a given area, used to establish a baseline for income evaluations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Market rent is the amount of rent that a property would likely command in the current rental market, determined through comparable sales or rental analyses."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7a01c4d224477788cf5c6bfd6ccc84e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c315a6b793aa073b8f6cb2ffb42e4f97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78e642bbbbe6e4f896abe6c8dfd4bab2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cea98d6086733276bdd5c19993c4deb7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 127}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNDERTAKING GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Underwriting Guidelines are a set of rules and criteria applied by lenders when assessing mortgage applications to evaluate the risk of lending."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c315a6b793aa073b8f6cb2ffb42e4f97</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 78}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 301}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EQUITY CONTRIBUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Equity Contribution refers to the portion of the value of a manufactured home that the borrower can use as a contribution towards a new loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Equity Contribution represents the portion of property value that the borrower owns outright, after accounting for outstanding loans against it."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c315a6b793aa073b8f6cb2ffb42e4f97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebee13ef54f5a678a952e514a3a25998</data>
