</node>
<node id="&quot;PRINCIPAL AND INTEREST (P&amp;I)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Principal and Interest refers to the two main components of a mortgage payment, with 'principal' being the loan amount and 'interest' being the cost for borrowing the money."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c315a6b793aa073b8f6cb2ffb42e4f97</data>
