  <data key="d1">"Table 1 is a reference point in the document providing structured information about homeownership education and counseling guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Table 1 is a section within the documentation that provides specific details about RSU Income type and its corresponding requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Table 1 is part of the underwriting documentation that outlines specific requirements for existing mortgages."&lt;SEP&gt;"Table 1 outlines guidelines related to gross rent and its absorption due to vacancy losses and maintenance expenses, as per underwriting standards."&lt;SEP&gt;"Table 1 refers to a specific section in the underwriting guidelines document, containing data related to personal property requirements."</data>
