</node>
<node id="&quot;LISTING PRICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Listing Price is the amount a property is offered for sale, which can affect the calculation of expected sales proceeds."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 172}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 425}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NET PROCEEDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Net Proceeds are the actual money received from the sale of the property after accounting for sales costs and liens."&lt;SEP&gt;"Net Proceeds is the amount of money expected to be received from a sale after deducting costs and liens, significant in financial planning for transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Net Proceeds refer to the amount remaining after all expenses of the sale of a business are deducted, important for financial evaluations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-452a34dee684e3a93929cc44930deb38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d30aff8ce4b53c163b59f9369ea58842</data>
