</node>
<node id="&quot;CLOSING STATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Closing Statement is a summary of the final financial transactions associated with the sale or purchase of a property."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 82}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 312}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DRIVER'S LICENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Driver's License is an example of supporting documentation that can verify identity and address of the donor in financial transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 48}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BANK STATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Bank Statement is a document that summarizes transactions over a specific period, showing the proceeds from sales or deposits."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Bank Statement is a financial document that shows all transactions, balances, and deposits over a specified period, used to verify income."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bank Statement can serve as supporting documentation to demonstrate financial capacity and shared residency between the borrower and donor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bank Statement is a financial document used to verify current receipt of income and assess the financial status of an individual applying for benefits."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bank Statement is a monthly summary of transactions in a bank account, used to verify financial stability and address for the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d30aff8ce4b53c163b59f9369ea58842&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c5f3698bd3a35ae6c5127d81864d41d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32546641e2f2fec0a52f658ed70fc338</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 241}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 535}]</data>
</node>
