<node id="&quot;GRADUATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Graduation is a significant event marking the completion of an educational program, which can also involve financial documentation for eligibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Graduation refers to the completion of an educational program, which enables students to receive gifts in connection with their academic achievements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d30aff8ce4b53c163b59f9369ea58842</data>
