<node id="&quot;EDUCATIONAL INSTITUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Educational Institution refers to any establishment that provides instruction or education, which can produce documentation like diplomas or transcripts for graduation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 84}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SALES COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sales Costs are the expenses incurred when selling a property, which need to be considered in calculating net proceeds from a sale."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 58}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 289}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIENS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Liens are legal claims against a borrower's assets, often resulting from unpaid debts, impacting their eligibility for loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liens are legal claims against an asset that secure the payment of a debt or obligation, impacting the transfer and financing of real estate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liens are legal claims or holds on property as security for a debt, which can affect the ownership transfer and sales process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liens are legal rights granted against a property by a lender, which can affect ownership and asset transfer during real estate transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liens refer to legal claims against a property, which must be settled before owners can realize net proceeds from a sale."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f359b1edc6f123eca67b08265c9b89e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b4494b2a290a96f3ee6a9d358a812a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32546641e2f2fec0a52f658ed70fc338&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebee13ef54f5a678a952e514a3a25998</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 18}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 188}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 474}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CERTIFICATION FROM DONOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Certification from Donor is a document asserting the donor's residency history with the borrower, which supports their eligibility for gift funds."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 184}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 458}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ESTIMATED PROCEEDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL CONCEPT"</data>
