<node id="&quot;EMPLOYER RELOCATION PLAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Employer Relocation Plan involves corporate strategies that facilitate the relocation of employees, sometimes including financial plans like buy-out agreements to manage mortgage responsibilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Employer Relocation Plan is an event involving the transfer of an employee to a new location, which includes a buy-out agreement for the outstanding mortgage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d30aff8ce4b53c163b59f9369ea58842&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3500178db8c114017db2f8c6f93e2791</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SALES CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Sales Contract is a legal agreement detailing the terms of sale, including requirements for repairs and improvements in real estate transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A sales contract is a legally binding agreement outlining the terms of a sale between a buyer and a seller, including specifics of the property being transacted."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sales Contract is a legal agreement between a buyer and seller outlining the terms of a sale, specifically not allowed as sole verification of proceeds from sales in financing transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sales Contract is a legal document outlining the terms of sale between a buyer and seller, often subject to conditions such as inspections and appraisals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sales Contract is a legally binding agreement between a buyer and seller regarding the sale of property, which is essential in the context of a pending sale."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Sales Contract is a legally binding agreement that specifies the terms and conditions for the sale of property, including repairs and improvements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d30aff8ce4b53c163b59f9369ea58842&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed0db69e97fa62c70a7cb29c5e75fe07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3500178db8c114017db2f8c6f93e2791&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4de71275bc933c2c228984f601d0e0a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d77c56c7ef7f25742c687f6ad137c8f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f443d70c1b97ab92c6f9f441ec9ced99</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 208}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 507}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOCUMENTARY EVIDENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
