<node id="&quot;BILL OF SALE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Bill of Sale is a legal document that conveys ownership of an asset from one party to another, detailing the terms of the transaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bill of Sale is a document that records the transfer of ownership of an asset, required when selling personal assets to show evidence of transaction."</data>
