<node id="&quot;CRYPTOCURRENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cryptocurrency is a type of virtual currency that uses cryptography for secure transactions and is noted for its volatile nature."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cryptocurrency refers to digital or virtual currencies that use cryptography for security, making them a key part of modern financial transactions and investment options."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cryptocurrency refers to virtual currency assets like Bitcoin, which facilitate digital transactions, and are governed by specific financial regulations."</data>
