</node>
<node id="&quot;PROCEEDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORM_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Proceeds refer to the amount of money received from a financial transaction, such as the refinancing of a mortgage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Proceeds refer to the money received from a financial transaction, often concerning mortgage refinancing or sale of property."&lt;SEP&gt;"Proceeds refer to the money received from the sale of an asset, which can be utilized for subsequent transactions or investments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f76dd878d76d1e8bdf5fb1cac46447ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32546641e2f2fec0a52f658ed70fc338&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7482b9f302a8cac2d717810389222b99</data>
