  <data key="d2">chunk-32546641e2f2fec0a52f658ed70fc338</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MINIMUM CONTRIBUTION REQUIREMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Minimum Contribution Requirement denotes the least amount a borrower must contribute from their own funds towards a loan down payment."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Minimum Contribution Requirement is a standard in mortgage lending to ensure that borrowers contribute a certain amount of their own funds to the down payment."</data>
