<node id="&quot;CPA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A CPA (Certified Public Accountant) serves as a reliable third-party source for verifying income and business existence for self-employed borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"A CPA, or Certified Public Accountant, is a financial professional who assists clients with accounting, tax, and financial advisory services."</data>
