</node>
<node id="&quot;VIRTUAL CURRENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Virtual Currency encompasses digital forms of money, including cryptocurrencies, utilized for various online transactions and exchanges."&lt;SEP&gt;"Virtual Currency refers to digital assets such as cryptocurrencies, which can be used to secure loans and impact borrower's financial obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Virtual Currency refers to digital or cryptocurrency accounts that are not eligible for income documentation in this context."&lt;SEP&gt;"Virtual Currency, including cryptocurrency, is specified as an ineligible asset for loan qualification purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Virtual Currency, including cryptocurrency, refers to digital assets used as a medium of exchange for transactions and can be a source of income for individuals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Virtual currency refers to digital or cryptocurrencies that may be volatile and are generally assessed as ineligible for mortgage qualification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Virtual currency, such as cryptocurrency, is recognized in the document as a type of asset that cannot be used as additional income in mortgage applications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-455b5668460db6760959b99f4a51a667&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-446d02f0d6609ee8a932eea7a8d1302e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a5de738b6afbcb23707b2c0aeb68ab2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60ae7a36306412ca14db54586048b8bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32546641e2f2fec0a52f658ed70fc338&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a9a7e59e34af57946c09cfa07672f92</data>
