</node>
<node id="&quot;EXISTING LIENS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Existing Liens are any legal claims against a property that existed prior to the refinancing process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Existing Liens represent legal claims against an asset or property that must be settled before ownership can be transferred in transactions."</data>
