<node id="&quot;HCLTV&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"HCLTV stands for Home Equity Combined Loan-to-Value, which includes all loans secured by the property to assess risk levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"HCLTV, or Home Equity Combined Loan-to-Value ratio, is an advanced ratio used to evaluate the total amount of secured debt against a property when considering loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"HCLTV, or Home Equity Combined Loan-to-Value ratio, is an assessment tool that considers the total amounts of all mortgages and home equity lines associated with a property."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-164ff18d322608d7342cc1d0619c9f0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-995f33933031b2ea33803f61f1ece1b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 179}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 445}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWER’S OWN FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Borrower’s Own Funds refer to the amount of money that a borrower has available to contribute from their own savings towards the purchase of a home."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-164ff18d322608d7342cc1d0619c9f0f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 80}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 307}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXCEPTIONS TO BORROWER MINIMUM CONTRIBUTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Exceptions to Borrower Minimum Contributions are specific rules that allow borrowers to use gift funds to meet down payment requirements under certain circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-164ff18d322608d7342cc1d0619c9f0f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 82}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 311}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESERVES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Reserves are the minimum liquid assets that borrowers must have available to qualify for a mortgage loan, ensuring their ability to pay."&lt;SEP&gt;"Reserves refer to additional savings that borrowers need to retain after closing, ensuring they have financial backup for mortgage payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Reserves refer to the funds that a borrower must have available to cover certain expenses related to loan payments, often required by lenders for securing approval."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-446d02f0d6609ee8a932eea7a8d1302e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cd8475962bfe1c2428c1ea6691488c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2</data>
