  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Documentation Requirement refers to the need for specific paperwork and evidence provided by borrowers to verify information necessary for loan approval."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3cd8475962bfe1c2428c1ea6691488c9</data>
