<node id="&quot;PERCENTAGE OF UPB&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Percentage of UPB (Unpaid Principal Balance) indicates the ratio used to determine reserves required for financed properties based on their outstanding mortgage balances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Percentage of UPB refers to the calculated proportion of the unpaid principal balance of multiple financed properties, impacting reserve requirements for future transactions."</data>
