<node id="&quot;DESKTOP UNDERWRITER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Desktop Underwriter is Fannie Mae's automated underwriting software, used to evaluate loan applications and determine borrower eligibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Desktop Underwriter is a technology used to assess the maximum number of borrowers that can be evaluated on a single loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Desktop Underwriter is an automated underwriting system that helps lenders evaluate mortgage applications based on set criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Desktop Underwriter is an automated underwriting system utilized by lenders to assess borrower eligibility and streamline the loan approval process."</data>
