</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN PRODUCT ADVISOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Product Advisor is Freddie Mac's automated underwriting system designed to facilitate loan approvals by providing risk assessments and recommendations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Product Advisor is a digital tool used in the mortgage industry to assess loan eligibility and options based on various parameters of a project."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Product Advisor is a technology that can evaluate a maximum of five borrowers on a single loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-756818f22cafd11009f520745a0306df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3fe3f1cf3ad46c315af5250198974ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3455e52007c02e364a735d4c4a7efa70</data>
