</node>
<node id="&quot;PITIA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"PITIA includes Principal, Interest, Taxes, Insurance, and any Association dues owed on a mortgage, which is critical in assessing monthly debt obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"PITIA refers to Principal, Interest, Taxes, Insurance, and Association dues, which are used to determine the financial stability of the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"PITIA stands for Principal, Interest, Taxes, Insurance, and Association Dues, representing the total housing payment that can be offset by rental income from the investment property."&lt;SEP&gt;"PITIA stands for Principal, Interest, Taxes, Insurance, and Association Dues, representing the total monthly housing expense for loan qualification."&lt;SEP&gt;"PITIA stands for Principal, Interest, Taxes, Insurance, and Association dues that a borrower must account for when calculating a mortgage payment."&lt;SEP&gt;"PITIA stands for Principal, Interest, Taxes, Insurance, and Association dues, commonly used to calculate a borrower's total housing cost."&lt;SEP&gt;"PITIA stands for Principal, Interest, Taxes, Insurance, and Association dues, which are the costs associated with owing a property."&lt;SEP&gt;"PITIA stands for Principal, Interest, Taxes, Insurance, and Association dues, which represent the total monthly payment obligation for a property owner, relevant for mortgage qualifications."&lt;SEP&gt;"PITIA stands for Principal, Interest, Taxes, Insurance, and Association fees, and is used to calculate the total monthly obligations for a borrower when assessing eligibility for loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-843cd03316121e01909837126fbbe24c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-455b5668460db6760959b99f4a51a667&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10ce55972cf12e21fd77796ab69a96ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b454650a6e8dde5a93325db30813c30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48dc06181f6c67399f82ff0110257532&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-756818f22cafd11009f520745a0306df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1578b8b51044019bfff38a69eecab0be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78e642bbbbe6e4f896abe6c8dfd4bab2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 118}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 360}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESERVES IN MONTHS OF PITIA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Reserves in Months of PITIA indicate how many months' worth of mortgage payments a borrower must have in reserve to qualify for a loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Reserves in Months of PITIA represent the financial reserves required for mortgage approvals, calculated based on the borrower's monthly housing expense."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-756818f22cafd11009f520745a0306df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9480c322229448ccd0b724ce848cac14</data>
