  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Second Home and Investment Property refers to real estate purchased as a vacation home or for investment purposes, requiring specific guidelines for financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Second Home and Investment Property refers to the classification of properties eligible for different mortgage criteria and required reserves."</data>
