  <data key="d1">"Nontraditional Credit refers to alternative credit sources or methods used to evaluate borrowers when they lack a traditional credit history."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nontraditional Credit refers to credit history that is not based on traditional credit scores, often involving alternative payment histories like rent or utility payments."</data>
