  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Eligibility encompasses the criteria by which borrowers can qualify for mortgage products, particularly in connection with deed restrictions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Eligibility encompasses the criteria determining whether borrowers meet the necessary standards to secure a mortgage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Eligibility refers to the conditions under which a borrower qualifies for mortgage financing, influenced by appraisal outcomes and property compliance standards."</data>
