</node>
<node id="&quot;REPRESENTATIVE CREDIT SCORE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL_CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Representative Credit Score denotes the credit score used as the basis for assessing loan eligibility, typically the lowest median among multiple scores."&lt;SEP&gt;"Representative Credit Score is a specific credit score threshold used by lenders to evaluate the creditworthiness of borrowers and determine loan terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-49e500168a0590aef42a229f4ea93fe3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9480c322229448ccd0b724ce848cac14</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHRONIC PATTERN OF HEAVY LATE PAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Chronic Pattern of Heavy Late Pays indicates a borrower's history of delayed payments that adversely affects their creditworthiness."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9480c322229448ccd0b724ce848cac14</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 18}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 189}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BANKRUPTCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Bankruptcy is a legal proceeding involving a person or business that is unable to repay outstanding debts, often leading to the discharge of those debts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bankruptcy is a legal status of a person or organization that cannot repay the debts it owes, leading to a defined recovery time after discharge or dismissal."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bankruptcy is a legal status that affects a borrower's credit history and eligibility for future loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bankruptcy is a significant derogatory credit event that dramatically increases the risk of default and must be carefully considered in mortgage applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bankruptcy refers to a legal proceeding involving a person or business that is unable to repay outstanding debts, with specific waiting periods to qualify for loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bankruptcy refers to a legal status of a person or organization that cannot repay the debts they owe, which heavily influences refinancing eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7482b9f302a8cac2d717810389222b99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8fbac57b62fb040bd0302d8a94d9f65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b4494b2a290a96f3ee6a9d358a812a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9da80c7f63e32b0d7dc6df2ae9032546&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd0f34ee8edcf779e6ff94578f8ab9c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9480c322229448ccd0b724ce848cac14</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 18}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 189}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TAX LIENS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Tax Liens indicate debts owed to the government for unpaid taxes, significantly affecting a borrower's credit profile."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tax Liens refer to governmental claims against a property due to unpaid taxes, which can influence a borrower's credit profile."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9480c322229448ccd0b724ce848cac14</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 18}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 189}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JUDGMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Judgments are legal decisions against a borrower that can significantly impact their credit history and ability to secure loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Judgments refer to legal decisions made by a court, typically regarding financial obligations, which can impact a borrower's credit report and ability to secure loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2b4494b2a290a96f3ee6a9d358a812a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9480c322229448ccd0b724ce848cac14</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 18}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 188}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 474}]</data>
</node>
