</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWERS WITHOUT A CREDIT SCORE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Borrowers Without a Credit Score refers to individuals seeking loans who do not have a traditional credit score, requiring alternative qualifications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-341a8217a86a20f7b3a1712ac24de48f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 22}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN PRODUCT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Product refers to the specific type of financing offering that lenders provide, such as Fixed Rate Agency Products, tailored for mortgage loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-341a8217a86a20f7b3a1712ac24de48f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 103}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FIXED RATE AGENCY PRODUCT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fixed Rate Agency Product is a category of mortgage loans with a fixed interest rate, provided and insured by government-sponsored enterprises."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-341a8217a86a20f7b3a1712ac24de48f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 44}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 274}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DU APPROVE/ELIGIBLE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"DU Approve/Eligible is a designation from the Fannie Mae AUS indicating that a loan meets the necessary automated underwriting criteria for approval."&lt;SEP&gt;"DU Approve/Eligible refers to the automated underwriting system used by lenders to assess eligibility for loans based on borrower data."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-341a8217a86a20f7b3a1712ac24de48f</data>
