</node>
<node id="&quot;OBLIGATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Obligation refers to a binding commitment, typically involving payments for services such as utilities or insurance, that borrowers must disclose in their financial history."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f359b1edc6f123eca67b08265c9b89e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 18}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 195}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 481}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HISTORICAL ACCOUNT HISTORY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Historical Account History refers to the record of a borrower's financial behavior over time, particularly concerning payment practices and outstanding balances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f359b1edc6f123eca67b08265c9b89e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 18}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 188}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 470}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CREDIT REPORTING AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
