  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Transcripts are documents provided by the IRS that summarize tax returns, used for verifying income and financial status during the loan application process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Transcripts are official records containing the detailed account of a borrower's financial interactions, which may be required during the loan application process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4f5775363168aa3256002e8b909c2f52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f359b1edc6f123eca67b08265c9b89e</data>
