  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Mortgage Loan is a loan secured by real estate property, which is expected to be paid back over a specified period of time."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Mortgage Loan is a loan specifically used to purchase real estate, involving the use of the property as collateral."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Mortgage Loan is a type of loan specifically used to purchase real estate, where the property serves as collateral."&lt;SEP&gt;"A mortgage loan is a type of loan specifically for purchasing real estate, where the property itself serves as collateral."</data>
