<node id="&quot;NOTE DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Note Date is the date on which the mortgage loan is executed and serves as a reference point for various mortgage-related deadlines and requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Note Date is the date on which the signed mortgage note is executed, serving as a critical timestamp in the loan process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Note Date is the date when the mortgage note is signed, marking important timelines for refinancing transactions including seasoning periods."&lt;SEP&gt;"Note Date refers to the date on which the mortgage loan agreement is signed and the terms become effective."&lt;SEP&gt;"Note Date refers to the date the mortgage note is signed, which is relevant for determining the applicable tax documentation needed for the loan process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Note Date is the date on which a mortgage loan agreement is signed, marking the start of loan terms and assessments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Note Date is the date on which a mortgage note is signed, marking a key moment in the loan process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Note Date is the date on which a mortgage or loan document is signed, marking the commencement of the loan's repayment schedule."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-137c762b3ac588b243786790757dd239&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f01d27887cb1edc56efdd9355e2cbba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9da80c7f63e32b0d7dc6df2ae9032546&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a173c08400538977a1dc5397bceda0a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05020d8707d581b6c2d0c1b184d17f01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-212cbc70c3f0e59feb09b85b04e1c40f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2eef4940eec1ef97062f77d3efe4074e</data>
