<node id="&quot;REPAYMENT PLAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Repayment Plan is a financial agreement allowing time for borrowers to repay overdue amounts to avoid foreclosure, requiring documented payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Repayment Plan is a structured plan outlining how a borrower will repay their debts, typically involving a series of scheduled payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Repayment Plan is an arrangement made to catch up on missed mortgage payments, requiring documentation and approval from the servicer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7482b9f302a8cac2d717810389222b99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8fbac57b62fb040bd0302d8a94d9f65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-105c313a28b49198d2d2b78db6e7529b</data>
