</node>
<node id="&quot;FORECLOSURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Foreclosure is a legal process through which a lender takes possession of property when the borrower defaults on their mortgage payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foreclosure is a legal process where a lender sells or reclaims a property after the borrower defaults on the mortgage payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foreclosure is another significant derogatory credit event that impacts the likelihood of future defaults and is essential in the evaluation of mortgage applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foreclosure is the legal process by which a lender attempts to recover the balance of a loan from a borrower who has stopped making payments, resulting in the forced sale of the property."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foreclosure is the legal process by which a lender takes possession of a property when the borrower fails to make mortgage payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foreclosure is the legal process through which a lender takes possession of a property when the borrower fails to make mortgage payments, with specific timeframes for recovery."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foreclosure is the legal process where a lender attempts to recover the balance of a loan from a borrower who has stopped making payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foreclosure refers to the legal process through which a lender takes possession of a property when the borrower fails to meet mortgage obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-787de407af176e62ce6eb517b2dd1d21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7482b9f302a8cac2d717810389222b99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8fbac57b62fb040bd0302d8a94d9f65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d048ce21946dbbaf2025fa9d108f909&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b4494b2a290a96f3ee6a9d358a812a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d635e8ee0ac48c5c8906a09d9d6759ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe6ee5848653e2ade85b8c44b7433dac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd0f34ee8edcf779e6ff94578f8ab9c2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 18}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 192}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 475}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEED-IN-LIEU&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Deed-in-Lieu is a mortgage event that involves voluntarily transferring property ownership to the lender to avoid foreclosure and has implications on credit evaluations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Deed-in-Lieu is an arrangement in which a borrower hands over the property title to the lender to avoid foreclosure proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c8fbac57b62fb040bd0302d8a94d9f65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7482b9f302a8cac2d717810389222b99</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 18}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 192}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 476}]</data>
</node>
