</node>
<node id="&quot;PROPERTY TAX BILL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Property Tax Bill is an official document that outlines the amount of property taxes owed based on assessed property values and local tax rates."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-35b11a1ced8de5c90f65c0b1344222c2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 213}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOCAL ASSESSOR'S OFFICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Local Assessor's Office is an administrative body that evaluates property values for tax purposes and provides current tax rates."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-35b11a1ced8de5c90f65c0b1344222c2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 213}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SPECIAL ASSESSMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Special Assessment is a fee levied on property owners for improvements or services that benefit their property, not included in annual tax payments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-35b11a1ced8de5c90f65c0b1344222c2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 213}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TAX ABATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Tax Abatement is a reduction in the amount of property tax owed, often requiring documentation to ensure continuance of the abatement for a specified period."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-35b11a1ced8de5c90f65c0b1344222c2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 124}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DELINQUENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Delinquency refers to the failure to make timely payments on debts, which can affect a borrower's creditworthiness and ability to secure financing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-35b11a1ced8de5c90f65c0b1344222c2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 44}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 273}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTEREST EXPENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Interest Expense is the cost incurred by the borrower for borrowing funds, typically calculated as a percentage of the total loan amount."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-35b11a1ced8de5c90f65c0b1344222c2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 124}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TAX RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Tax Rate is the percentage at which an individual or business is taxed, which can affect the calculation of property tax obligations for real estate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-35b11a1ced8de5c90f65c0b1344222c2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CASH FLOW ANALYSIS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cash Flow Analysis involves assessing the borrower's income and expenses to determine financial stability, often used in mortgage underwriting."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cash Flow Analysis is a financial evaluation to determine the cash inflows and outflows of a business, critical for assessing its financial health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cash flow analysis is a financial assessment that examines the inflow and outflow of cash in a business to evaluate its liquidity and profitability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-27c5b5517eef234cf0db585936ec28f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35b11a1ced8de5c90f65c0b1344222c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8864c52069485823a39babaa2b2005e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 120}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 365}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GOVERNMENT REGULATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Government Regulations refer to the rules and laws established by governmental bodies that govern financial transactions, including lending and property assessments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-35b11a1ced8de5c90f65c0b1344222c2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 104}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 342}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HOMESTEAD EXEMPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Homestead Exemption is a legal provision that reduces the property tax burden for homeowners by exempting a portion of their property's value from taxation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Homestead Exemption is a legal provision that reduces the property tax burden for homeowners on their primary residences."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-35b11a1ced8de5c90f65c0b1344222c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b41d8874999d184a44ade7d9217e24a9</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 214}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 518}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MONTHLY HOUSING EXPENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Monthly Housing Expense is the total cost associated with owning a home, including mortgage payments, property taxes, insurance, and other related liabilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-35b11a1ced8de5c90f65c0b1344222c2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 124}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CASHED CHECKS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cashed Checks are financial instruments indicating that payment has been made from a borrower's account, often used as evidence in financial transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-35b11a1ced8de5c90f65c0b1344222c2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 63}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CURRENT TAX BILL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Current Tax Bill is the most recent bill that outlines the amount of taxes owed on a property, based on its assessed value."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-35b11a1ced8de5c90f65c0b1344222c2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 213}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RECALCULATED TAXES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Recalculated Taxes refer to the adjusted amount of property taxes that may occur when there is a change in ownership or value assessments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-35b11a1ced8de5c90f65c0b1344222c2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 213}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXISTING PROPERTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Existing Properties are properties that have been previously constructed and are being evaluated for refinancing or sale."&lt;SEP&gt;"Existing Properties refer to real estate that has already been constructed and is currently assessed for property taxes, as opposed to new construction."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-35b11a1ced8de5c90f65c0b1344222c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dd59acfc6b78474b4cbf40ec7d05399</data>
