</node>
<node id="&quot;STUDENT LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Student Loans are financial products provided to individuals seeking to fund their education, with specific repayment terms and eligibility that lenders must consider."&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Loans refer to educational loans that are subject to specific underwriting considerations as mentioned in the guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-61ba5485d92daa30adf4ee02bfab7d8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3500178db8c114017db2f8c6f93e2791</data>
