<node id="&quot;LEASE AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Lease Agreement is a contract in which the borrower pays for the use of solar panels without owning them, outlining the terms of the lease."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Lease Agreement is a legal contract between a lessor and lessee outlining the terms and conditions for renting property."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Lease Agreement is a legal document outlining the terms of rental arrangements, which may be required to document rental income for lending purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Lease Agreement is a legal document outlining the terms under which a tenant may occupy rental property, including the obligations of both tenant and landlord."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lease Agreement is a contract outlining the terms of rental between a landlord and tenant, detailing payment amounts and duration of tenancy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lease Agreement is a formal contract between a landlord and tenant outlining the terms of rental arrangements, crucial for evidencing rental income."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lease Agreement is a formal contract between the landlord and tenant outlining the terms of renting a property."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lease Agreement is a legal document between a landlord and tenant outlining the terms of rental, crucial for validating the borrower's income."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lease Agreement refers to a contractual arrangement where the owner of the solar panels agrees to terms regarding their use, installation, and responsibilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lease Agreement refers to the contractual arrangement regarding the conditions under which solar panels are financed and their terms of use."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6b454650a6e8dde5a93325db30813c30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb02bde5abfff1b16d83434416df7465&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48dc06181f6c67399f82ff0110257532&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8864c52069485823a39babaa2b2005e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78e642bbbbe6e4f896abe6c8dfd4bab2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6434821b2faf91ece4b375276017b775&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61ba5485d92daa30adf4ee02bfab7d8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2c659b65edef4a5e599f9445602b752&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ca2c4d1778a11943201b4e917c15322&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3eb9a9047b04f55e775ab1675823f162</data>
