  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Non-Occupant Co-Borrower is an individual who is listed on the loan application but does not reside in the property associated with the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Non-occupant Co-borrower refers to a person who co-signs a mortgage loan but does not live in the property, impacting eligibility and loan terms."</data>
