</node>
<node id="&quot;GUARANTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Guarantor is a person who agrees to take responsibility for the loan if the borrower fails to repay, playing a vital role in securing financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Guarantor is someone who guarantees to pay the debt if the primary borrower defaults, without an ownership stake."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c3fe3f1cf3ad46c315af5250198974ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9fd7a30043bf2ff61e50fbd6141d212</data>
