  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Living Revocable Trust, also known as a family trust or inter vivos trust, is a trust that can be altered or revoked by the settlor during their lifetime, facilitating estate planning and management of assets."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b9fd7a30043bf2ff61e50fbd6141d212</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 212}]</data>
</node>
