</node>
<node id="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF TRUST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Certificate of Trust is a document that certifies the existence of a trust and outlines the powers of the trustee without disclosing the full terms of the trust."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b9fd7a30043bf2ff61e50fbd6141d212</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 24}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 212}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN PROGRAM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Loan Program refers to specific types of loans that are offered under defined terms and conditions, usually serving particular borrower needs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b9fd7a30043bf2ff61e50fbd6141d212</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 104}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 342}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;U.S. CITIZENS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"U.S. Citizens are individuals who hold citizenship in the United States and are eligible for certain mortgage products and terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c3fe3f1cf3ad46c315af5250198974ab</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 228}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERMANENT RESIDENT ALIEN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Permanent Resident Alien is a non-citizen who has been granted the right to live and work in the U.S. indefinitely, relevant to income verification for mortgage loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Permanent Resident Alien is an immigrant lawfully allowed to reside permanently in the United States, with specific documentation requirements, including a green card."&lt;SEP&gt;"Permanent Resident Alien refers to non-citizens legally residing in the United States who have the right to stay indefinitely."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c3fe3f1cf3ad46c315af5250198974ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ae330f51f478e78f1b91957f17dcdec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31a563a8507e131e7544819dbd9373b4</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 228}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REFUGEES AND ASYLUM SEEKERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refugees and those seeking asylum are individuals immigrating to the U.S. under special programs to obtain permanent residency, while eligible to seek employment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c3fe3f1cf3ad46c315af5250198974ab</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 228}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-ARMS-LENGTH TRANSACTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Non-Arms-Length Transactions refer to property transactions where there is a relationship between the buyer and seller, which could affect eligibility for loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c3fe3f1cf3ad46c315af5250198974ab</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 25}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 220}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Home refers to a property that individuals occupy, which is central to discussions on co-borrowing and transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c3fe3f1cf3ad46c315af5250198974ab</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 25}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 220}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLOSING DOCUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Closing Document is a legal document signed at the conclusion of a property transaction, confirming the details and obligations of the involved parties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c3fe3f1cf3ad46c315af5250198974ab</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 25}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 220}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LTV/CLTV/HCLTV&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"LTV (Loan-To-Value), CLTV (Combined Loan-To-Value), and HCLTV (Home Equity Combined Loan-To-Value) are financial metrics used to determine the risk of a mortgage loan based on the value of the property versus the total amount of loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"LTV (Loan-to-Value), CLTV (Combined Loan-to-Value), and HCLTV (High Combined Loan-to-Value) are metrics used to assess the relationship between the loan amount and the appraised value of the property."&lt;SEP&gt;"LTV (Loan-to-Value), CLTV (Combined Loan-to-Value), and HCLTV (Home Equity Combined Loan-to-Value) are metrics used to determine the ratio of loans to the value of the property, influencing loan eligibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"LTV (Loan-to-Value), CLTV (Combined Loan-to-Value), and HCLTV (Home Equity Combined Loan-to-Value) refer to metrics used to assess the risk of a mortgage loan compared to the value of the property being financed."&lt;SEP&gt;"LTV, CLTV, and HCLTV refer to different types of loan-to-value ratios used to determine the risk and eligibility of mortgage loans in property transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c3fe3f1cf3ad46c315af5250198974ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49e500168a0590aef42a229f4ea93fe3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe6ee5848653e2ade85b8c44b7433dac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d77c56c7ef7f25742c687f6ad137c8f8</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 96}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 329}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;IMMIGRATION STATUS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Immigration Status refers to the legal standing of an individual concerning their residency and eligibility to live and work in the United States."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c3fe3f1cf3ad46c315af5250198974ab</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 228}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REFUGEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refugees are individuals who have fled their home countries due to persecution or fear of persecution, and they may provide necessary documentation to support their status during loan applications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d9f00ed91955a5d8af076ae0a21e6a69</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 227}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 530}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DACA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"DACA stands for Deferred Action for Childhood Arrivals, a program that provides temporary employment authorization for eligible immigrants who arrived in the U.S. as children."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d9f00ed91955a5d8af076ae0a21e6a69</data>
</node>
