  <data key="d1">"H Series includes various temporary work visas (e.g., H-1B, H-2B) for individuals performing professional services for a sponsoring employer."&lt;SEP&gt;"H Series refers to a temporary work VISA category for individuals performing services of a professional nature, requiring employer sponsorship."</data>
