  <data key="d1">"O Series is a category of visa for individuals with extraordinary abilities or achievements in specific fields, emphasizing immigration for high-skilled professionals."&lt;SEP&gt;"O Series refers to visas for individuals with extraordinary abilities in specific fields such as sciences or entertainment, categorized as O-1 and O-2."</data>
