<node id="&quot;EAD CLASS A17&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"EAD Class A17 is an employment authorization document issued to spouses of certain visa holders, facilitating their ability to work."&lt;SEP&gt;"EAD class A17 is an employment authorization document issued to spouses of individuals under the E Series visa classifications."</data>
