  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"EAD Class C02 may be issued to dependents of certain visa holders, allowing them to work while in the U.S."&lt;SEP&gt;"EAD class C02 is an employment authorization document class that may be issued to dependents of some individuals."</data>
