<node id="&quot;EMPLOYERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employers are entities that sponsor workers for specific visas, providing them with job opportunities in the U.S."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employers are organizations or individuals providing jobs to workers, which may be involved in subsidy programs to assist their employees."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employers refer to individuals or organizations that provide jobs, which is crucial for assessing a borrower's employment status and income."</data>
