</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWER'S INITIAL INVESTMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORM_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Borrower's Initial Investment refers to the amount of money put forth by the borrower at the time of purchasing a property."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f76dd878d76d1e8bdf5fb1cac46447ae</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 178}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 437}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NEW LOAN AMOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORM_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"New Loan Amount refers to the total sum of money that a borrower is approved to borrow during the refinancing process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f76dd878d76d1e8bdf5fb1cac46447ae</data>
