</node>
<node id="&quot;EXISTING LIEN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORM_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Existing Lien refers to a legal claim against a property that has already been established prior to a refinancing operation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f76dd878d76d1e8bdf5fb1cac46447ae</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 94}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 328}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ORIGINAL PURCHASE PRICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORM_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Original Purchase Price is the initial amount paid to acquire a property, which is documented in the settlement statement."</data>
