  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"LLC refers to a Limited Liability Company, which can be a borrower type in property ownership scenarios."&lt;SEP&gt;"LLC refers to a Limited Liability Company, which is a legal structure for a business entity that provides limited liability to its owners."&lt;SEP&gt;"LLC, or Limited Liability Company, is a business structure that combines the limited liability of a corporation with the tax efficiencies and operational flexibility of a partnership."&lt;SEP&gt;"LLC, or Limited Liability Company, is a flexible business structure that protects its owners from personal liability and allows for pass-through taxation."</data>
