  <data key="d1">"Title Insurance is a form of indemnity insurance that protects lenders and property owners against legal defects in the title to real estate, essential for secure property transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title Insurance is a type of insurance policy issued during real estate transactions to protect against claims regarding the ownership of property."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title Insurance protects lenders from losses due to defects in the title of the property, ensuring that the bank's lien position is maintained according to applicable state law."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cefb0ad4148eab93b794bfdc3eb3eac7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f066acdedf5a2cb0d5c7abb401d7c950&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b81be5b6336b17987b5cd27bc0cf519d</data>
