<node id="&quot;MECHANIC LIENS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mechanic Liens are legal claims against a property by contractors or suppliers who have provided labor or materials but have not been paid, often included in financing discussions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mechanic Liens are legal claims against a property for unpaid work and materials, often relevant in the context of construction-to-permanent financing when completing property development."</data>
