  <data key="d2">chunk-995f33933031b2ea33803f61f1ece1b7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 108}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 352}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 544}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MONTHLY MORTGAGE INSURANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Monthly Mortgage Insurance is a program offered by MI companies that allows borrowers to pay insurance premiums on a monthly basis rather than upfront."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-995f33933031b2ea33803f61f1ece1b7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 108}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 352}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 544}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NEW YORK PROPERTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"New York Properties refers to specific loan origination guidelines and deviations applicable in the New York area regarding mortgage financing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-995f33933031b2ea33803f61f1ece1b7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 104}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 342}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPREHENSIVE RISK ASSESSMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Comprehensive Risk Assessment involves evaluating various financial factors, such as CLTV, HCLTV, and total debt-to-income ratio, to determine the risk level of mortgage financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Comprehensive Risk Assessment is the evaluation process that considers the borrower's financial metrics such as CLTV, HCLTV, and other debt ratios."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-464152a069c6a4d42a031274bf69430a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-995f33933031b2ea33803f61f1ece1b7</data>
