</node>
<node id="&quot;RADIAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Radian is a financial services provider that includes mortgage insurance as part of their offerings to manage lender risk."&lt;SEP&gt;"Radian is a provider of mortgage insurance and risk management solutions, aiding lenders and homeowners in the private mortgage insurance market."&lt;SEP&gt;"Radian is an organization involved in the mortgage insurance industry, specifically dealing with guidelines and requirements for mortgage insurance coverage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-464152a069c6a4d42a031274bf69430a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed0db69e97fa62c70a7cb29c5e75fe07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-995f33933031b2ea33803f61f1ece1b7</data>
