  <data key="d1">"Enact, formerly known as Genworth, is a mortgage insurance provider focused on underwriting and risk management services."&lt;SEP&gt;"Enact, previously known as Genworth, is a company offering mortgage insurance solutions to support home buying and lending."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ed0db69e97fa62c70a7cb29c5e75fe07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-995f33933031b2ea33803f61f1ece1b7</data>
