  <data key="d2">chunk-995f33933031b2ea33803f61f1ece1b7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 184}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 457}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FIRST PAYMENT LETTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The First Payment Letter is a document sent to borrowers outlining the details of their first mortgage payment, including timing and amount."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-995f33933031b2ea33803f61f1ece1b7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 184}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 457}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SINGLE PREMIUM MORTGAGE INSURANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Single Premium Mortgage Insurance is a type of mortgage insurance that requires a one-time upfront premium payment to cover the mortgage insurance expense."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-464152a069c6a4d42a031274bf69430a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 151}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LENDER PAID MORTGAGE INSURANCE (LPMI)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lender Paid Mortgage Insurance (LPMI) is a product where the lender pays the mortgage insurance premium on behalf of the borrower, typically included in the interest rate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-464152a069c6a4d42a031274bf69430a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 151}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEBT-TO-INCOME (DTI)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Debt-to-Income (DTI) is a financial measure used to assess a borrower's ability to manage monthly payments and repay debts."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-464152a069c6a4d42a031274bf69430a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 151}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN-TO-VALUE (LTV)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan-to-Value (LTV) ratio is a financial term used to express the ratio of a loan to the value of the asset purchased."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-464152a069c6a4d42a031274bf69430a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 151}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TOTAL LOAN-TO-VALUE (TLTV)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Total Loan-to-Value (TLTV) ratio includes all financing used to purchase a property, critical for determining mortgage insurance requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-464152a069c6a4d42a031274bf69430a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 151}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SINGLE FINANCED MORTGAGE INSURANCE (SFMI)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Single Financed Mortgage Insurance (SFMI) is a specific type of mortgage insurance that is accounted for in the loan amount."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-464152a069c6a4d42a031274bf69430a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SINGLE FINANCED MI MATRIX&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Single Financed MI Matrix is a document detailing the specific requirements and parameters for single financed mortgage insurance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-464152a069c6a4d42a031274bf69430a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 96}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 335}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAXIMUM MORTGAGE AMOUNTS SECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Maximum Mortgage Amounts Section outlines the limits on the amount that can be borrowed, crucial for determining eligibility for loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-464152a069c6a4d42a031274bf69430a</data>
