  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Income Stability is a critical factor in determining a borrower's eligibility for a mortgage, focusing on the consistency and reliability of income over time."&lt;SEP&gt;"Income Stability refers to the assurance that a borrower's income will remain consistent, crucial for loan qualification."</data>
