<node id="&quot;W-2S&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"W-2s are tax forms provided by employers that report annual wages and taxes withheld, used for validating income history."&lt;SEP&gt;"W-2s are tax forms provided by employers to report annual wages paid to employees and the taxes withheld, utilized in the income verification process for mortgages."&lt;SEP&gt;"W-2s are tax forms that indicate employment earnings and are required documentation for income verification in lending processes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-31a563a8507e131e7544819dbd9373b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-444e5ed0aa3891f1dfc3371133a3be60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f91be92d53c1aed3b7126461f33e415</data>
