</node>
<node id="&quot;PAYSTUB&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Paystub is a document provided by an employer that outlines an employee's earnings for a specific pay period, used as evidence of income for mortgage qualification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Paystubs are issued statements of earnings which are critical for confirming a borrower's income during the loan application process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-31a563a8507e131e7544819dbd9373b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f91be92d53c1aed3b7126461f33e415</data>
