</node>
<node id="&quot;INCOME VERIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Income Verification is a vital process that confirms the income details of a borrower, necessary for assessing qualification for a mortgage loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Income Verification is the process of confirming a borrower's earnings to determine loan eligibility and financial stability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Income Verification is the process of confirming a borrower's income sources, including alimony and child support, to ensure they meet the criteria for mortgage approval."&lt;SEP&gt;"Income Verification is the process of confirming a borrower's reported income through documentation and evidence as part of the mortgage underwriting."&lt;SEP&gt;"Income Verification is the process of confirming a mortgage applicant's income, often required to qualify for a loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Income Verification is the process of confirming an individual's earnings through documentation such as paystubs, W-2s, and statements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Income Verification is the process of confirming the amount and source of a borrower's income to assess their ability to meet loan obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Income verification is the process of confirming an individual's earnings from various sources to assess eligibility for loan products."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d411e3f303846f3eb00356498af7761f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e28f33ddf3b335e19135327f9afb2b07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9004bef6d0a745fff75d973c6b90ef4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f91be92d53c1aed3b7126461f33e415&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-444e5ed0aa3891f1dfc3371133a3be60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60ae7a36306412ca14db54586048b8bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95358b428c5f107947a116a0643878c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-332ea40a8706fdd85456078cf47232fe</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 169}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 421}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INCOME HISTORY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Income history refers to the record of a borrower's earnings over a specified period, impacting their qualification for loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f91be92d53c1aed3b7126461f33e415</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 76}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 296}]</data>
</node>
