<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT VERIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employment Verification is a procedural requirement wherein lenders confirm a borrower's job status and income through various means prior to loan closing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employment Verification is the process of confirming a borrower's employment status and income to ensure they are eligible for a mortgage loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employment Verification is the process of confirming an individual's employment status and income, often required by lenders for underwriting purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employment verification is the process of confirming a borrower's job status and income sources to ensure compliance with lending guidelines."</data>
