  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A U.S. Citizen is an individual recognized as a legal member of the United States, who may have specific rights and responsibilities regarding income documentation and taxation."&lt;SEP&gt;"U.S. Citizen refers to individuals born or naturalized in the United States who may live abroad for work but must maintain a present address in the U.S."</data>
