<node id="&quot;MILITARY PAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Military Pay refers to the compensation received by individuals serving in the armed forces, which is noted as a specific income type in mortgage guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-31a563a8507e131e7544819dbd9373b4</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 226}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OVERTIME INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Overtime Income refers to additional earnings received by employees who work beyond their standard hours, which can be included in income calculations for mortgages."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-31a563a8507e131e7544819dbd9373b4</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 226}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BONUS INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Bonus Income refers to extra compensation received by employees, often based on performance, that can be factored into income verification for mortgage applications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-31a563a8507e131e7544819dbd9373b4</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 226}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMMISSION INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Commission Income is earnings received by employees based on sales performance, which must be verified for inclusion in mortgage loan qualification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Commission Income pertains to earnings received based on sales or performance metrics, often variable and subject to fluctuation year-to-year."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8a5de738b6afbcb23707b2c0aeb68ab2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31a563a8507e131e7544819dbd9373b4</data>
