</node>
<node id="&quot;VERIFICATION OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Verification of Employment is a process that employers use to confirm a current or former employee's job status and income details."&lt;SEP&gt;"Verification of Employment is a process undertaken to confirm that a borrower continues to perform services for an income provider, especially relevant in mortgage applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Verification of Employment is the process by which lenders confirm the borrower's employment status as part of the mortgage qualification process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Verification of Employment is the process of confirming a borrower's employment status and income, critical for assessing mortgage eligibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Verification of Employment is the process of confirming the employment status and terms of a Borrower prior to loan closing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f01d27887cb1edc56efdd9355e2cbba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b8e57f220eeefd0215ac958c381bc47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-332ea40a8706fdd85456078cf47232fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31a563a8507e131e7544819dbd9373b4</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 57}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 283}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INCOME TYPES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Income Types refer to various categories of income that can be documented and verified for mortgage eligibility, influencing underwriting decisions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-31a563a8507e131e7544819dbd9373b4</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 226}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOCUMENT VERIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Document Verification involves the process of ensuring that provided documentation (like paystubs or tax forms) is accurate and legitimate for loan qualifications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-31a563a8507e131e7544819dbd9373b4</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 42}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ELECTRONIC DATABASE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Electronic Database is a digital system used to store and retrieve information, such as income and employment documents, for processing mortgage applications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-31a563a8507e131e7544819dbd9373b4</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 42}]</data>
