  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The U.S. Federal Individual Income Tax Return is a form filed by individuals to report their income and calculate tax obligations, important for income verification in mortgages."&lt;SEP&gt;"The U.S. Federal Individual Income Tax Return is a form used to report an individual's income to the federal government, essential for loan qualification."</data>
