<node id="&quot;SELF-EMPLOYMENT INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Self-Employment Income refers to the income that a borrower earns as a self-employed individual, which must be verified and analyzed for mortgage approval."&lt;SEP&gt;"Self-employment income refers to earnings from work conducted by an individual as a sole proprietor or business owner, and is subject to specific documentation requirements when considering loan applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Self-employment income refers to income earned by individuals who work for themselves instead of being employed by someone else."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3ae330f51f478e78f1b91957f17dcdec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-332ea40a8706fdd85456078cf47232fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76dfd0d1478f77acd572a51bf4e3956a</data>
