<node id="&quot;SELF-EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Self-Employment refers to income derived from an individual's own business activities, which may require specific documentation and is treated separately in loan qualification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Self-Employment refers to the state of working for oneself rather than an employer, often necessitating specific income verification for loan purposes."</data>
