<node id="&quot;INCOME SOURCES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Income Sources pertains to various forms of income that can affect qualifying income standards for loans, with explicit exclusions for certain types of income."&lt;SEP&gt;"Income Sources refer to various origins of income which may include wages, bonuses, and other non-traditional income such as those from cannabis-related activities and virtual currencies."</data>
