<node id="&quot;RENTAL PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Rental Payments are periodic payments made by tenants to landlords, which must reflect in U.S. dollars when calculating income for loan obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8a5de738b6afbcb23707b2c0aeb68ab2</data>
