<node id="&quot;EDUCATION BENEFITS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Education Benefits are financial advantages provided to military personnel, often used to assist with tuition and educational expenses but not typically counted as qualifying income."</data>
