  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Flight Pay is a type of additional income provided to military members who are required to fly as part of their duties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flight Pay is compensation given to military members who are required to fly as part of their official military duties."</data>
