  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Rations refer to food allowances provided to military personnel, which may contribute to their overall income."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rations refer to the food supply provided to military personnel, part of the benefits received during active service."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0610be8f2c48d2ab9263a9d9aea08a29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a5de738b6afbcb23707b2c0aeb68ab2</data>
