<node id="&quot;MILITARY ADDRESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Military Address refers to the context of military service and the associated benefits and income related to housing, rations, and pay allowances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0610be8f2c48d2ab9263a9d9aea08a29</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Employment Contract is a formal agreement detailing the terms of employment including start date, type, and rate of pay."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employment Contract outlines the terms and conditions of the employment relationship between the borrower and their employer, relevant for qualifying for a mortgage."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Employment Contract is a formal agreement detailing the terms of employment, including start date and salary, which is crucial for loan verification processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Employment Contract refers to the formal agreement defining the terms of employment for the Borrower, including salary and starting date."</data>
