  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mortgage Premises refers to the property against which a mortgage is secured, relevant in the context of solar panel interests."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortgage Premises refers to the property that is financed through a mortgage loan, specifically a 1-unit primary residence in this context."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0610be8f2c48d2ab9263a9d9aea08a29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6434821b2faf91ece4b375276017b775</data>
