<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT OFFER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Employment Offer is a formal proposal from an employer to a potential employee that outlines the terms and conditions of employment."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Employment Offer refers to the documentation and agreement between the employer and borrower detailing employment terms necessary for mortgage qualification."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0610be8f2c48d2ab9263a9d9aea08a29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f01d27887cb1edc56efdd9355e2cbba</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 57}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 283}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWER'S DEPOSITORY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Borrower's Depository refers to the accounts where borrowed funds or financial reserves are held to support loan qualification."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0610be8f2c48d2ab9263a9d9aea08a29</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 57}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 282}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 540}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACTIVE SERVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Active Service refers to the period of time a military member is engaged in service, which is relevant for understanding benefits and qualifications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0610be8f2c48d2ab9263a9d9aea08a29</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 224}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 522}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TAX-FREE INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Tax-Free Income refers to earnings that are not subject to income tax, such as benefits from housing and allowances for military personnel."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0610be8f2c48d2ab9263a9d9aea08a29</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 224}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 522}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LES STATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"LES Statement (Leave and Earnings Statement) is a monthly record of a military member's pay and deductions, important for verifying financial status."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0610be8f2c48d2ab9263a9d9aea08a29</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRIMARY EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Primary Employment refers to the main job or occupation that an individual holds, significant for loan qualification criteria."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0610be8f2c48d2ab9263a9d9aea08a29</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 150}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 414}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINANCIAL RESOURCES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Financial Resources denote the assets and income that a borrower has available to cover monthly obligations, including mortgage payments and other liabilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Financial Resources denotes the available funds that can be used to ensure loan eligibility, including savings and income."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0610be8f2c48d2ab9263a9d9aea08a29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f01d27887cb1edc56efdd9355e2cbba</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 57}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 283}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWER RESERVES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Borrower Reserves denote the additional funds that a borrower must have, which can cover mortgage obligations during employment transition."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0610be8f2c48d2ab9263a9d9aea08a29</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 57}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 282}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 540}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT START DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employment Start Date refers to the date the Borrower is scheduled to begin their new job as indicated in the employment contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Employment Start Date is a critical point in the loan process, determining when the borrower's income from new employment is considered for qualifying for a mortgage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f01d27887cb1edc56efdd9355e2cbba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-843cd03316121e01909837126fbbe24c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 57}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 283}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRINCIPAL, INTEREST, TAXES, INSURANCE, AND ASSOCIATION DUES (PITIA)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"PITIA refers to the total monthly expenses that include the borrower's mortgage principal, interest, property taxes, insurance, and any association fees for the property."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f01d27887cb1edc56efdd9355e2cbba</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 12}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 158}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 416}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CURRENT INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Current Income refers to the net income that the borrower is presently receiving, which may or may not be used for qualifying for a mortgage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f01d27887cb1edc56efdd9355e2cbba</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 57}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 283}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NEW PRIMARY EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"New Primary Employment is when a borrower starts a new job that is considered stable income for mortgage qualification."&lt;SEP&gt;"New Primary Employment signifies the new job for which the borrower must start earning income to qualify for the mortgage, with specific timing requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f01d27887cb1edc56efdd9355e2cbba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2eef4940eec1ef97062f77d3efe4074e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 57}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 285}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DELIVERY DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Delivery Date indicates the timeline by which certain mortgage-related documents or funds must be provided."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Delivery Date refers to the timeline by which the loan must be processed and finalized following the Note Date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f01d27887cb1edc56efdd9355e2cbba</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 183}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MORTGAGED PREMISES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mortgaged Premises are the specific real estate properties being financed through a mortgage, crucial for establishing the terms and eligibility of the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortgaged Premises is the property being financed by the mortgage, specifically a 1-unit Primary Residence as stated in the guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f01d27887cb1edc56efdd9355e2cbba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2eef4940eec1ef97062f77d3efe4074e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 44}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 274}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FIXED BASE INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fixed Base Income is a type of income that remains constant and is one of the criteria considered for loan eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f01d27887cb1edc56efdd9355e2cbba</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 48}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HOUSING EXPENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Housing Expense encompasses all costs related to owning a property, including mortgage payments, taxes, insurance, and fees."&lt;SEP&gt;"Housing Expense refers to the costs associated with owning a home, such as mortgage payments, taxes, and insurance, relevant in evaluating borrowing situations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Housing Expense refers to the total amount a borrower must pay monthly for their housing obligations, including principal, interest, taxes, insurance, and association fees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1578b8b51044019bfff38a69eecab0be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2eef4940eec1ef97062f77d3efe4074e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 44}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 274}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REAL ESTATE TRANSACTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Real Estate Transaction is the process of buying, selling, or leasing properties, which involves legal agreements and financial arrangements between parties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2eef4940eec1ef97062f77d3efe4074e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 44}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 272}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CURRENT PRIMARY EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Current Primary Employer is the organization where the borrower is currently employed and from which they receive primary income, essential for mortgage qualification."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2eef4940eec1ef97062f77d3efe4074e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 57}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 285}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FUTURE SALARY INCREASE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Future Salary Increase refers to the anticipated increase in earnings that may influence the borrower's ability to qualify for a mortgage loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2eef4940eec1ef97062f77d3efe4074e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 174}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 429}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWER'S DEPOSITORY AND SECURITIES ACCOUNTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Borrower's Depository and Securities Accounts refer to the financial accounts held by a borrower, which can include checking accounts, savings accounts, and investments that provide proof of financial stability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2eef4940eec1ef97062f77d3efe4074e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 57}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 285}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEPOSITORY AND SECURITIES ACCOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Depository and Securities Account is a type of financial account where the borrower's funds are held, necessary for verifying financial readiness for a mortgage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2eef4940eec1ef97062f77d3efe4074e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VERIFICATION REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Verification Requirements are the criteria that must be met to confirm the authenticity of a borrower's financial situation and employment status for mortgage approval."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2eef4940eec1ef97062f77d3efe4074e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 57}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 285}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HOUSING EXPENSE CALCULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Housing Expense Calculation involves determining the total monthly obligations of a borrower related to their housing, impacting qualifying criteria for mortgage lending."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2eef4940eec1ef97062f77d3efe4074e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 57}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 285}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESTRICTED STOCK (RS)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Restricted Stock (RS) refers to grants of company shares that represent equity interest in the company and are subject to a restriction period before recipients can access the shares."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 57}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 282}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 543}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESTRICTED STOCK UNITS (RSU)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Restricted Stock Units (RSU) are a form of compensation where an employee is given shares of stock, subject to vesting conditions, which must be reported for financial purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Restricted Stock Units (RSU) are grants valued in terms of company shares that do not represent equity interest, with access subject to vesting requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d411e3f303846f3eb00356498af7761f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 57}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 282}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 543}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SALARY INCREASE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Salary Increase refers to the approved adjustments in a Borrower's income that must be documented as part of the mortgage application process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 57}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 282}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 542}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN PURPOSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Purpose defines the specific reason a borrower takes out a loan, such as purchasing or refinancing a property."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Purpose outlines the intended use of the mortgage, such as for purchase or refinancing, influencing eligibility criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Purpose refers to the intended use of the loan, specifically for purchase and rate-term refinance of investment properties as per underwriting guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Purpose refers to the valid reasons for which a mortgage must be originated, including purchase transactions and rate-and-term refinances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6b454650a6e8dde5a93325db30813c30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-446d02f0d6609ee8a932eea7a8d1302e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a9a7e59e34af57946c09cfa07672f92</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 129}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 376}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Employer is an organization or individual that provides employment to the Borrower, influencing their income stability and loan qualification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employer refers to a person or organization that hires employees and provides financial assets like severance packages or retirement plans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employer refers to the company or entity that provides employment and issues severance or retirement packages to its employees."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employer refers to the organization or individual providing the job to the Borrower, and whose verification is required during the mortgage process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Employers are entities or individuals that hire workers and are responsible for providing income verification and employment documentation for loan applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Employer is the entity providing employment and associated income through mechanisms such as RS and RSU shares that need to be documented for underwriting."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Employer is the entity that provides employees with RSU compensation and is responsible for related documentation and stock transfers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d411e3f303846f3eb00356498af7761f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-444e5ed0aa3891f1dfc3371133a3be60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efc5b39715a3cc6b0751b8cfe29a66e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95d0c65d8599d7d0f56b6359c8d77e68</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 278}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADDITIONAL FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Additional Funds refer to extra money that must be verified and documented, which supports the Borrower's ability to cover monthly housing expenses and liabilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 170}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RS AND RSU INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"RS (Restricted Stock) and RSU (Restricted Stock Units) income types are forms of compensation that may impact a Borrower's financial assessment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-843cd03316121e01909837126fbbe24c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 72}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 294}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STOCK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Stock refers to the shares of a company owned by an individual, which may have restrictions on their accessibility when used in financial assessments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-843cd03316121e01909837126fbbe24c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 57}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 282}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 541}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INCOME FLUCTUATION AND STABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Income Fluctuation and Stability refers to the analysis of changes in income based on various performance metrics and financial distributions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-843cd03316121e01909837126fbbe24c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 176}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 432}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;YTD EARNINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"YTD Earnings represents the total income earned by an individual or entity from the beginning of the year up to the current date, often documented for loan qualification."&lt;SEP&gt;"YTD earnings refer to Year-To-Date earnings that provide insight into the financial performance of the Borrower over the current year."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-843cd03316121e01909837126fbbe24c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 176}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 432}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADDITIONAL RESERVES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Additional Reserves are funds set aside to ensure that the Borrower can cover further financial liabilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-843cd03316121e01909837126fbbe24c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 72}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 294}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;10-DAY PRE-CLOSING VERBAL VERIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The 10-day pre-closing verbal verification is a critical step in the loan approval process that confirms the Borrower's employment and financial conditions prior to closing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-843cd03316121e01909837126fbbe24c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 176}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 432}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REDUCTION IN RESERVES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Reduction in Reserves relates to the adjustment made to the Borrower's reserves, reflecting their income level and financial obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-843cd03316121e01909837126fbbe24c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 57}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 282}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 542}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOCUMENTATION OF ADDITIONAL FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Documentation of Additional Funds refers to the required evidence used to verify the Borrower's financial resources needed for the loan process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-843cd03316121e01909837126fbbe24c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 57}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 282}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 541}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"RS (Restricted Stock) refers to shares given to employees as part of their compensation which are subject to certain restrictions until vested."&lt;SEP&gt;"RS refers to Restricted Stock, a financial product that is subject to vesting conditions before ownership is fully transferred to the holder."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-15bd1add6397f9fb7a5eda377f3403cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 176}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 434}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RSU&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"RSU (Restricted Stock Units) are a form of compensation offered by an employer to an employee in the form of company shares that are subject to vesting."&lt;SEP&gt;"RSU (Restricted Stock Units) are a form of compensation where employees receive shares after meeting certain vesting requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"RSU stands for Restricted Stock Units, a type of compensation where shares are promised but not fully transferred until certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-15bd1add6397f9fb7a5eda377f3403cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95d0c65d8599d7d0f56b6359c8d77e68</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 176}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 434}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VESTING SCHEDULE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Vesting Schedule details the timeline over which RSU shares are earned and subsequently available to the employee."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vesting Schedule outlines the timeline over which an employee earns the right to receive shares or stock options, detailing past and future conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95d0c65d8599d7d0f56b6359c8d77e68</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 176}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 433}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;THIRD-PARTY VERIFICATION SERVICE PROVIDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Third-Party Verification Service Provider is an external company that assists in verifying employment and income claims for underwriting purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Third-party Verification Service Provider aids in the process of confirming employment and income information to ensure accuracy in loan underwriting."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d411e3f303846f3eb00356498af7761f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 171}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERFORMANCE-BASED VESTING PROVISIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Performance-based Vesting Provisions refer to a set of conditions that must be met for stock options or shares to vest, often tied to company performance or individual achievement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 176}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 434}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PAYOUTS OF RS OR RSU&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Payouts of RS or RSU refer to the actual distribution of shares or their cash equivalent, which becomes available to the employee upon vesting."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
