</node>
<node id="&quot;W-2 FORMS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"W-2 Forms are official tax documents issued annually by employers, detailing employees' earnings and tax withholdings, necessary for verifying income."&lt;SEP&gt;"W-2 Forms are tax forms used in the United States to report wages paid to employees and the taxes withheld from them, essential for income verification."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d411e3f303846f3eb00356498af7761f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
