</node>
<node id="&quot;VERBAL VERIFICATION OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Verbal Verification of Employment is a process where an underwriter confirms an individual's employment status through direct communication with their employer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 171}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;10-DAY PRIOR TO CLOSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"10-day Prior to Close refers to a time-sensitive requirement where verification must occur shortly before the closing of a loan transaction."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 171}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CURRENT EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Current Employer is the organization that employs the Borrower and is responsible for issuing RS and RSU, as well as providing income documentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Current Employer is the company or organization where the Borrower is presently employed, critical for verifying income and employment status."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d411e3f303846f3eb00356498af7761f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
