</node>
<node id="&quot;PUBLICLY TRADED STOCK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Publicly Traded Stock refers to shares of a company that are available for purchase on stock exchanges, which must be evidenced for certain financial verifications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 176}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 433}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERFORMANCE-BASED VESTING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Performance-based Vesting is a condition that requires achieving certain performance metrics before stock options or shares are granted to the employee."</data>
