<node id="&quot;10-DAY PRIOR VERIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"10-day Prior Verification refers to the requirement for a last-minute, often verbal, confirmation of employment status before loan closing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 171}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CALENDAR YEARS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Calendar Years refer to the annual periods used for financial reporting and compliance, which are relevant for RSU payouts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Calendar Years refer to the standard twelve-month period from January 1 to December 31, used as a timeframe for financial assessments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Calendar years refer to the 12-month period starting from January 1 to December 31, which is often used as a standard for financial reporting and tax purposes."</data>
