<node id="&quot;INCOME CONTINUANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Income Continuance pertains to the expectation that income will be received regularly for a specified duration, essential for mortgage evaluations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Income Continuance refers to the assurance that an individual's income will continue for a specified period, relevant in evaluating loan viability."</data>
