  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cash Equivalent refers to the monetary value that can be received in place of shares from RSUs upon vesting."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cash equivalent refers to the form of payment that equals the value of vested shares in monetary terms rather than physical shares."</data>
