<node id="&quot;VERIFICATION OF BORROWER'S INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Verification of Borrower's Income is a necessary documentation process that confirms a borrower's earnings, crucial for loan qualification during temporary leave circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-efc5b39715a3cc6b0751b8cfe29a66e7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 281}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employment Income refers to the regular income a borrower receives from their employer, critical for mortgage qualification."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-efc5b39715a3cc6b0751b8cfe29a66e7</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TIP INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"TIP Income denotes additional earnings received by a borrower that can potentially enhance their qualifying income for loan purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tip income refers to additional earnings received by employees, often in service industries, which can be reported and verified for eligibility in financial applications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-efc5b39715a3cc6b0751b8cfe29a66e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-444e5ed0aa3891f1dfc3371133a3be60</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 57}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 284}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SHORT-TERM DISABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Short-Term Disability refers to an insurance product that provides income replacement for employees unable to work due to medical reasons."&lt;SEP&gt;"Short-Term Disability refers to insurance benefits that provide temporary financial assistance to individuals who are unable to work for a brief period due to illness or injury."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-efc5b39715a3cc6b0751b8cfe29a66e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1955da1ebc911d30ff778d5b9e719028</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 281}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MATERNITY LEAVE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Maternity Leave is a type of temporary leave specifically for new parents, potentially affecting a Borrower's income during the leave period."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-efc5b39715a3cc6b0751b8cfe29a66e7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 281}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIQUID RESERVES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Liquid Reserves are cash or cash-equivalent assets that a Borrower can use to supplement income during qualifying for a mortgage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-efc5b39715a3cc6b0751b8cfe29a66e7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 170}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRE-LEAVING INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Pre-Leaving Income is the income a Borrower earns prior to going on a temporary leave, used for loan qualification assessment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-efc5b39715a3cc6b0751b8cfe29a66e7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 279}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONFIRMATION DATE OF RETURN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Confirmation Date of Return is the agreed-upon date when a Borrower expects to return to work after a temporary leave."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-efc5b39715a3cc6b0751b8cfe29a66e7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 279}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOCUMENTATION FROM CURRENT EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Documentation from Current Employer may include letters or forms providing evidence of a Borrower's employment status and their right to return after temporary leave."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-efc5b39715a3cc6b0751b8cfe29a66e7</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 281}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNEMPLOYMENT BENEFITS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Unemployment benefits are financial support provided to individuals who are temporarily unemployed and have a documented history of receiving these benefits."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-444e5ed0aa3891f1dfc3371133a3be60</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 54}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNION WORKERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Union workers are members of a specific trade union and are often skilled tradespersons, facilitated by the union for job placements and employment verification."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-444e5ed0aa3891f1dfc3371133a3be60</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 26}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FORM 4137&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Form 4137 is related to reporting Social Security and Medicare tax on unreported tip income for individuals, used for income documentation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-444e5ed0aa3891f1dfc3371133a3be60</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 48}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FORM WVOE (FORM 1005)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Form WVOE (Form 1005) is an employment verification form used to document borrower income during financial assessments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-444e5ed0aa3891f1dfc3371133a3be60</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PAYSTUBS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Paystubs are documents provided by employers that detail an employee's earnings, essential for verifying income during loan applications."</data>
