</node>
<node id="&quot;SOCIAL SECURITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Social Security is a government program in the United States that provides financial assistance to eligible individuals based on their work history, aimed at supporting retirees, disabled persons, and survivors."&lt;SEP&gt;"Social Security is a government program that provides financial benefits to retirees, disabled individuals, and dependents, which can include unemployment benefits."&lt;SEP&gt;"Social Security is a governmental program that provides financial assistance to individuals based on their work history, often impacting mortgage qualification processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Social Security is a social insurance program in the United States that provides financial assistance to retirees and individuals with disabilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Social Security refers to the social insurance program in the United States that provides benefits to retirees and disabled individuals, which are discussed in terms of documentation for mortgage qualification."</data>
  <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3719c6acb29bd52b7e1e409b90cedc6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-444e5ed0aa3891f1dfc3371133a3be60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95358b428c5f107947a116a0643878c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1955da1ebc911d30ff778d5b9e719028</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 239}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 532}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MEDICARE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Medicare is a federal health insurance program that serves individuals over 65 and those with certain disabilities, relevant for financial services that address worker income."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-444e5ed0aa3891f1dfc3371133a3be60</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 239}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 532}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TAX RETURNS (FEDERAL)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Federal tax returns are official documents submitted to the IRS that outline an individual's income and tax obligations, used for verifying employment and income."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-444e5ed0aa3891f1dfc3371133a3be60</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWER S SIGNED FEDERAL INCOME TAX RETURNS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The signed federal income tax returns are essential documents used to validate a borrower's financial history and stability for loan qualification."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-444e5ed0aa3891f1dfc3371133a3be60</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GOOD STANDING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Good standing refers to the status of a borrower or union member indicating compliance with financial or organizational obligations necessary for loan eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-444e5ed0aa3891f1dfc3371133a3be60</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 54}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TEMPORARY EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Temporary employment refers to jobs that are not permanent and can impact a borrower's financial stability relevant in loan applications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-444e5ed0aa3891f1dfc3371133a3be60</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWER'S MEMBER STATUS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The borrower's member status indicates their affiliation with a union, which can affect employment and income verification in the lending process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-444e5ed0aa3891f1dfc3371133a3be60</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SEPARATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Separation Agreement is a legal document that specifies terms for payment of alimony or child support; it becomes critical when divorce is not finalized."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9004bef6d0a745fff75d973c6b90ef4a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 73}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INCOME TAX RETURNS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Income Tax Returns are official documents submitted to tax authorities that detail income earned by an individual or entity, relevant for determining financial qualifications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Income Tax Returns provide financial documentation to lenders, including details on alimony or child support payments necessary for qualifying mortgage loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f7c7059ebd575d1369f6649db3e25ee4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9004bef6d0a745fff75d973c6b90ef4a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 121}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANNUITY INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Annuity Income is regular payments received from an investment or insurance product, which must meet specific criteria to be considered stable for mortgage applications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9004bef6d0a745fff75d973c6b90ef4a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 104}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 342}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CAPITAL GAINS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Capital Gains are profits that investors realize when they sell an asset for more than its purchase price, considered when evaluating a borrower's financial status for loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Capital Gains represent profit from the sale of an asset that may not be considered stable monthly income for mortgage qualification."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1955da1ebc911d30ff778d5b9e719028&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9004bef6d0a745fff75d973c6b90ef4a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 280}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COURT RECORDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Court Records are official documents that provide legal verification of alimony or child support payments and are critical in the qualifying process for a mortgage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9004bef6d0a745fff75d973c6b90ef4a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 73}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BANK STATEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Bank Statements show the regular deposits of payments made for alimony or child support, serving as financial evidence in the mortgage qualification process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9004bef6d0a745fff75d973c6b90ef4a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 74}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEPOSITS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Deposits refer to funds placed into financial accounts, which must be verified to ensure they meet eligibility for mortgage qualification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Deposits refer to the routine payments made into a bank account, which must demonstrate stability for income qualifying when seeking a mortgage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9004bef6d0a745fff75d973c6b90ef4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-023647e2d4d4ed50a6e5f501c055a8b5</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 74}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PAYMENT TERMS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Payment Terms outline the specifics regarding amounts and durations of alimony, child support, or maintenance payments that are significant for mortgage assessments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9004bef6d0a745fff75d973c6b90ef4a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 74}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SIX MONTHS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TIME FRAME"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Six Months indicates the minimum duration required for demonstrating stable income sources, such as alimony or child support in mortgage evaluations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9004bef6d0a745fff75d973c6b90ef4a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 74}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VOLUNTARY PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Voluntary Payments are funds given without a legal obligation, which cannot be considered as stable income for mortgage qualification."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9004bef6d0a745fff75d973c6b90ef4a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 77}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 299}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAINTENANCE PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Maintenance Payments refer to financial support beyond alimony or child support, which must also be documented for mortgage assessment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9004bef6d0a745fff75d973c6b90ef4a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 74}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PAYMENT VERIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Payment Verification is the process of providing evidence of consistent receipt of alimony or child support and is crucial for mortgage eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9004bef6d0a745fff75d973c6b90ef4a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 74}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COURT DECREE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Court Decree serves as a legal judgment that outlines payment arrangements for alimony and child support, important for financial stability in loan applications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9004bef6d0a745fff75d973c6b90ef4a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 74}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AGE OF CHILDREN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Age of Children is a factor considered in determining alimony and child support payments, which affects the stability assessment for borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9004bef6d0a745fff75d973c6b90ef4a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 73}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;QUALIFYING RATIO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Qualifying Ratio refers to the financial ratio used by lenders to determine a borrower's ability to repay a mortgage, influenced by documented income stability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9004bef6d0a745fff75d973c6b90ef4a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 48}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEPOSITS HISTORY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Deposits History refers to the recorded instances of income payments into a bank account, essential for verifying the stability of income when applying for a mortgage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9004bef6d0a745fff75d973c6b90ef4a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MORTGAGE APPLICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Mortgage Application is a form that a prospective borrower submits to a lender to apply for a mortgage loan to purchase a home."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortgage Application is a formal request by a borrower to receive a mortgage loan, requiring detailed verification of income and financial stability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortgage Application is the process by which individuals apply for home financing, requiring documentation of stable income."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortgage Application is the process through which a borrower applies for a mortgage and must provide evidence of income and financial stability."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Mortgage Application is a formal request for financing to acquire real estate, requiring detailed financial disclosures including business income."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d14191b10a7b641a859301abcf2d9873&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9004bef6d0a745fff75d973c6b90ef4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3719c6acb29bd52b7e1e409b90cedc6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60ae7a36306412ca14db54586048b8bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95358b428c5f107947a116a0643878c1</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 33}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 235}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNDERWRITING ANALYSIS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Underwriting Analysis is the evaluation process undertaken by lenders to assess the risk of lending and determine borrower's eligibility based on their financial data."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9004bef6d0a745fff75d973c6b90ef4a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 44}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 276}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGULAR RECEIPT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Regular Receipt indicates the consistency with which income payments, especially for alimony or child support, must occur for verification in mortgage applications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9004bef6d0a745fff75d973c6b90ef4a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 77}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 299}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEGAL AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal Agreement refers to formal contracts that outline the terms of alimony or child support, which are necessary for verification in loan assessments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9004bef6d0a745fff75d973c6b90ef4a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 73}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SPORADIC PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sporadic Payments refer to irregular payment patterns that are not accepted for stable income qualification in mortgage applications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9004bef6d0a745fff75d973c6b90ef4a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 77}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 299}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;IRS FORM 1040&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"IRS Form 1040 is a tax form used in the United States for individual income tax returns, specifically for documenting income and deductions."&lt;SEP&gt;"IRS Form 1040 is the standard individual tax return form used by U.S. taxpayers to report their income, important for verifying self-employment income."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-332ea40a8706fdd85456078cf47232fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1955da1ebc911d30ff778d5b9e719028</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 48}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT-RELATED ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employment-Related Assets indicate the financial resources linked to a person's employment that can be utilized as qualifying income for loan applications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1955da1ebc911d30ff778d5b9e719028</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 281}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MORTGAGE PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mortgage Payments refer to the regular payments made by borrowers to pay back loans secured by real estate, often evaluated in loan underwriting processes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1955da1ebc911d30ff778d5b9e719028</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 280}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISABILITY BENEFIT PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Disability Benefit Payments are financial compensations provided to individuals unable to work due to disability, which can affect qualifying income assessments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1955da1ebc911d30ff778d5b9e719028</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 280}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN CLOSING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Closing is a significant event in the mortgage process where the borrower finalizes their mortgage agreement and obtains funds to purchase real estate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Closing is the final step in the loan process where the property sale is finalized and the mortgage is executed, affected by appraisal status."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-137c762b3ac588b243786790757dd239&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1955da1ebc911d30ff778d5b9e719028</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 13}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 161}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CURRENT RECEIPT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Current Receipt refers to the evidence that an individual is actively receiving Social Security benefits, such as bank statements or award letters."&lt;SEP&gt;"Current Receipt refers to the verification of ongoing income such as disability payments, ensuring borrowers have stable income at the time of their loan application."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3c5f3698bd3a35ae6c5127d81864d41d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1955da1ebc911d30ff778d5b9e719028</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 241}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 535}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISABILITY POLICY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Disability Policy is an insurance document that outlines the terms of disability benefits, including eligibility and duration, which affects qualifying for loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1955da1ebc911d30ff778d5b9e719028</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 280}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INSURANCE COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Insurance Company provides various types of insurance, including disability insurance, which is relevant for income qualification during loan assessments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1955da1ebc911d30ff778d5b9e719028</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 56}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 280}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EVIDENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Evidence in this context refers to documentation or proof required to support claims made by the borrower, particularly regarding income and assets."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1955da1ebc911d30ff778d5b9e719028</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 147}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 404}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REAL ESTATE SALE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Real Estate Sale is an event where ownership of property is transferred from one individual or entity to another, which impacts financial assessments for loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1955da1ebc911d30ff778d5b9e719028</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 150}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 414}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN PARAMETERS FOR EMPLOYMENT-RELATED ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Parameters for Employment-Related Assets outline specific financial requirements and guidelines for borrowers using employment-related assets in mortgage processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Parameters for Employment-Related Assets refers to the specific criteria and requirements applicable to determining acceptable assets in the context of mortgage loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 88}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 317}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;401(K)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"401(k) is a retirement savings plan sponsored by an employer that allows employees to save and invest a portion of their paycheck before taxes are taken out."&lt;SEP&gt;"A 401(k) is a retirement savings plan sponsored by an employer that allows employees to save and invest a portion of their paycheck before taxes are taken out."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f67964fc288da88f7bb3defef1f29177&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 36}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 254}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NET DOCUMENTED ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Net Documented Assets is a financial measure calculated by subtracting the penalties and costs from the total eligible assets to determine the borrower's financial standing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Net Documented Assets refer to the total amount of verified financial resources available to a borrower after certain deductions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Net Documented Assets refers to the total amount of verified liquid assets that a borrower possesses, minus certain deductions relevant to mortgage qualification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Net Documented Assets represent the calculation of a borrower's eligible assets minus certain deductions, used to qualify for a mortgage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Net Documented Assets represent the total eligible assets available to a borrower, calculated to determine financial eligibility for loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-446d02f0d6609ee8a932eea7a8d1302e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a9a7e59e34af57946c09cfa07672f92</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 88}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 317}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ELIGIBLE ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Eligible Assets are financial resources recognized as valid for mortgage qualification, which must be liquid and readily available to the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 88}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 317}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INELIGIBLE ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Ineligible Assets are types of financial resources that are not accepted for mortgage qualification, such as stocks, lottery winnings, or inheritance funds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ineligible Assets describe specific types of assets that cannot be counted towards a borrower's reserves during mortgage qualification."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a9a7e59e34af57946c09cfa07672f92</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 89}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 320}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACCESS TO FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Access to Funds describes the borrower's ability to withdraw money from their retirement accounts without restrictions at the time of loan calculation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Access to Funds indicates the borrower's ability to withdraw and utilize assets from accounts such as 401(k) or IRA without restrictions, influencing loan eligibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Access to Funds refers to the borrower's ability to withdraw and utilize funds in their retirement accounts without penalties, relevant for loan qualification purposes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f67964fc288da88f7bb3defef1f29177&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 89}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 319}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PENALTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Penalty refers to the financial cost or reduction of funds that would apply if a borrower attempts to withdraw from their retirement savings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 88}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 317}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NET ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Net Assets are the total value of a borrower's financial resources after accounting for penalties and expenses associated with accessing those funds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Net Assets refers to the total value of eligible assets after accounting for penalties and other deductions, vital for financial assessments in lending."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 88}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 318}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AUS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"AUS (Automated Underwriting System) is a system used to evaluate the creditworthiness of borrowers and assess mortgage applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"AUS (Automated Underwriting System) is a technology platform used in the mortgage industry to assess borrower applications and eligibility based on automated criteria."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b8e57f220eeefd0215ac958c381bc47</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 104}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 345}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SEVERANCE PACKAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A severance package is a financial agreement provided by an employer to an employee upon termination, often including monetary compensation and benefits."&lt;SEP&gt;"Severance Package is a set of benefits provided to an employee upon their departure from a company, often including financial compensation and support."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 89}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 319}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LUMP SUM RETIREMENT PACKAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A lump sum retirement package is a one-time payment distributed to a retiree, encompassing their retirement savings or benefits."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 89}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 319}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIQUID ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Liquid assets are financial resources that can be quickly converted into cash without significant loss of value, essential for mortgage qualification."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 88}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 317}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STOCK OPTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Stock options are financial contracts offering employees the right to buy company stock at a predetermined price, which may not be considered eligible assets for mortgage purposes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 89}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 320}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LAWSUITS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lawsuits are legal disputes initiated by one party against another to resolve issues such as breaches of contract or personal disputes, often considered in discussions about asset eligibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lawsuits represent legal claims or disputes that may result in potential financial gains or losses, typically deemed ineligible assets for mortgage qualification."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 89}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 321}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOTTERY WINNINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lottery Winnings refer to financial gains obtained through winning a lottery, which are often categorized as non-employment-related assets and may be ineligible for certain loan processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lottery winnings refer to substantial monetary awards resulting from lottery participation, which are generally not considered reliable income for mortgage eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 89}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 321}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INHERITANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Inheritance is the assets passed down from deceased relatives, often not recognized as steady income for lending unless received before loan processing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Inheritance pertains to assets received from deceased individuals, often considered non-employment-related and impacting financial processes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 89}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 320}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DIVORCE PROCEEDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Divorce Proceeds refer to financial distributions resulting from the process of divorce, which can affect asset considerations during loan qualification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Divorce proceeds are financial settlements received during divorce proceedings, typically not viewed as eligible income in mortgage applications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 89}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 321}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-EMPLOYMENT-RELATED ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Non-employment-related assets refer to financial resources that do not derive from employment income, often considered ineligibly for certain loan qualifications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 89}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 321}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSET PARAMETERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Asset Parameters are the specific requirements set forth regarding the assets that a borrower must meet in loan applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Asset Parameters provide criteria that must be met for financial assets to qualify as eligible for loans or other financial processes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 88}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 318}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN PARAMETERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Parameters refer to the set of specific conditions and requirements that must be met for a loan application, including aspects like credit scores and asset requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Parameters refer to the specific criteria and conditions that govern how mortgage loans are structured and qualified."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-49e500168a0590aef42a229f4ea93fe3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 91}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESERVE REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Reserve Requirements are the guidelines dictating the amount of liquid assets a borrower must have available to cover future mortgage payments or costs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-49e500168a0590aef42a229f4ea93fe3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 91}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NET DOCUMENT ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL_CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Net Document Assets represent the total amount of documented assets available to a borrower after accounting for penalties and required funds for closing transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-49e500168a0590aef42a229f4ea93fe3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 91}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MONTHLY INCOME CALCULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Monthly Income Calculation refers to the process of determining the monthly payment that can be afforded based on net documented assets."&lt;SEP&gt;"Monthly Income Calculation refers to the process used to determine the monthly payment amount for a mortgage based on available net assets divided by the term of the loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-49e500168a0590aef42a229f4ea93fe3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-446d02f0d6609ee8a932eea7a8d1302e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 91}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AUS DU&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"AUS DU refers to Automated Underwriting System Desktop Underwriter, a technology used by lenders to assess the creditworthiness of loan applicants."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-49e500168a0590aef42a229f4ea93fe3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 178}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 441}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SPECIAL FEATURE CODE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Special Feature Code indicates specific underwriting requirements or features that apply to certain loan transactions, helping to standardize loan processing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-49e500168a0590aef42a229f4ea93fe3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 178}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 441}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MORTGAGE LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mortgage Loans are financial products provided by lenders to borrowers for the purchase of real estate, structured with various requirements and terms according to underwriting guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 104}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 342}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INCOME STREAM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Income Stream refers to the regular cash flow received from various sources, important for assessing a borrower's financial stability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 76}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 297}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ELIGIBILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Eligibility refers to the conditions met by a borrower to qualify for a loan based on financial, credit, and asset parameters."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 93}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 324}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VESTED LIFE INSURANCE POLICY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Vested Life Insurance Policy refers to a financial product where the cash value is available for borrowing by the policyholder."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 93}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 323}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STOCKS, BONDS, MUTUAL FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL PRODUCTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Stocks, Bonds, Mutual Funds are types of financial securities and investments that can be held as assets for loan qualifications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stocks, Bonds, and Mutual Funds are financial assets that are subject to valuation rules in mortgage applications, specifically accounting for their volatile nature."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a9a7e59e34af57946c09cfa07672f92</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 92}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHECKING AND SAVINGS ACCOUNTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Checking and Savings Accounts are financial products that provide liquidity to borrowers and are part of their documentable assets for loan eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 92}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loans are borrowed financial resources which entail the commitment of repayment under specific terms and conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRINCIPAL RESERVES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Principal Reserves are the assets set aside by borrowers which must meet specific liquidity requirements for mortgage qualifications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRANSACTION REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Transaction Requirements outline the necessary conditions and stipulations that must be satisfied for a loan or financial transaction to be approved."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 91}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PARAMETER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Parameter refers to a defined quantity or requirement that serves as a standard for assessing eligibility or qualifications for loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSET REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Asset Requirements specify the qualifications that assets must meet in order to be considered valid during the lending process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2</data>
