  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Borrower is a party involved in the financing or leasing of solar panels, having varying levels of ownership or access based on the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is a person who must meet eligibility requirements to access proceeds from a mortgage and verify assets, particularly those over the age of 62."</data>
