<node id="&quot;SSA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The SSA (Social Security Administration) is a U.S. government agency responsible for administering Social Security programs, including providing benefits to individuals based on their work records."&lt;SEP&gt;"The SSA, or Social Security Administration, is the U.S. government agency responsible for administering social security programs, including retirement, disability, and survivor benefits."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3c5f3698bd3a35ae6c5127d81864d41d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc</data>
