</node>
<node id="&quot;SOCIAL SECURITY BENEFITS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Social Security Benefits are payments made to qualified individuals based on their earnings history, which are crucial for financial assessments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Social Security benefits are government-provided financial payments based on work history or familial relationships, designed to support individuals in retirement or disability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3c5f3698bd3a35ae6c5127d81864d41d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3719c6acb29bd52b7e1e409b90cedc6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 240}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SURVIVOR BENEFITS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Survivor Benefits are Social Security benefits that provide assistance to the dependents of deceased workers, ensuring financial support for surviving family members."&lt;SEP&gt;"Survivor Benefits are Social Security payments made to the beneficiaries of deceased individuals, helping dependents maintain financial stability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3c5f3698bd3a35ae6c5127d81864d41d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 239}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 532}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUPPLEMENTAL SECURITY INCOME (SSI)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Supplemental Security Income (SSI) is a program that offers financial aid to individuals who are aged, blind, or disabled and have little or no income."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3c5f3698bd3a35ae6c5127d81864d41d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 240}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SSA-1099&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"SSA-1099 is a tax form used by the Social Security Administration to report the amount of Social Security benefits received by an individual during a year."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3c5f3698bd3a35ae6c5127d81864d41d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 240}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AWARD LETTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Award Letter is a document issued by the SSA, confirming an individual's eligibility and amount of Social Security benefits they are to receive."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3c5f3698bd3a35ae6c5127d81864d41d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 240}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TAX EXEMPT INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Tax Exempt Income refers to income that is not subject to taxation and must be verified for qualification purposes when applying for loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tax Exempt Income refers to income that is not subject to taxation, allowing individuals to retain a larger portion of their earnings for qualifying purposes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3c5f3698bd3a35ae6c5127d81864d41d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc</data>
