</node>
<node id="&quot;RETIREMENT AND DISABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Retirement and Disability are types of Social Security benefits that offer financial support to individuals who are retired or unable to work due to a disability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3c5f3698bd3a35ae6c5127d81864d41d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXECUTED SSA-3288 CONSENT FOR RELEASE OF INFORMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Executed SSA-3288 is a form that allows the Social Security Administration to release the individual's information to third parties for verification purposes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3c5f3698bd3a35ae6c5127d81864d41d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 244}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 538}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CORRESPONDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Correspondent refers to a party involved in the process of documenting Social Security Income, possibly acting on behalf of the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3c5f3698bd3a35ae6c5127d81864d41d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 241}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 535}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TYPE OF SOCIAL SECURITY BENEFIT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Type of Social Security Benefit classifies the various benefits available under the Social Security program, affecting documentation and eligibility requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3c5f3698bd3a35ae6c5127d81864d41d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 244}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 538}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MOST RECENT SIGNED TAX RETURNS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Most Recent Signed Tax Returns are financial documents submitted to verify income sources for the loan application, covering the borrower's earnings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3c5f3698bd3a35ae6c5127d81864d41d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 240}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VERIFICATION LETTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Verification Letter is a document confirming an individual's eligibility for benefits or income, usually issued by a relevant government agency or organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"Verification Letter is a formal document from the payer certifying the terms and receipt of Social Security benefits for loan qualification."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3c5f3698bd3a35ae6c5127d81864d41d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc</data>
