</node>
<node id="&quot;SUPPLEMENT SECURITY INCOME (SSI)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Supplement Security Income (SSI) is a program that provides cash to meet basic needs for food, clothing, and shelter for qualified individuals, particularly those with disabilities or the elderly."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 244}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 539}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INCOME DOCUMENTATION REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Income Documentation Requirements outline the necessary documentation needed to verify the source and continuance of income for individuals applying for loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 48}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACCOUNT/WORK RECORD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Account/Work Record is related to the documentation of an individual's earnings and social security contributions that determines eligibility for certain benefits."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 239}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 531}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BENEFITS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Benefits refer to the financial or non-financial support provided to individuals, often through government programs like Social Security."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 239}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 533}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISABILITY BENEFITS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Disability Benefits are financial assistance programs provided to individuals who cannot work due to a medical condition or disability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 239}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 533}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WORKERS COMPENSATION BENEFITS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Workers Compensation Benefits are insurance payments made to employees injured on the job, covering medical expenses and loss of income."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 239}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 533}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PUBLIC ASSISTANCE PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Public Assistance Payments are financial aid programs funded by the government to support low-income individuals and families in meeting their basic needs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 239}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 533}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CERTIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Certification involves validating or officially recognizing the accuracy of a document, income, or qualification for benefits."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FEDERAL INDIVIDUAL TAX RETURN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Federal Individual Tax Return is an annual report filed with the IRS by individuals to summarize their income, deductions, and tax obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BANK STATEMENT DOCUMENTATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Bank Statement Documentation refers to the necessity of providing bank statements as evidence of financial stability and income for loan applications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 241}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 534}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXAMPLE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Example illustrates a specific case or scenario that serves as a model for understanding or applying rules or regulations in the context of income eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 241}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 534}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BENEFICIARY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Beneficiary is an individual designated to receive benefits from a trust, will, or insurance policy, often linked to benefits like Social Security."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 244}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 537}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BENEFIT TYPE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Benefit Type categorizes the various forms of assistance or payments individuals can receive under social security or other benefit programs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 244}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 539}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Age is a critical factor in determining eligibility for certain benefits, as many programs tie benefit continuance to the age of the recipient."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 244}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 537}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEPARTMENT OF VETERANS AFFAIRS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Department of Veterans Affairs provides various benefits to veterans, including financial aid that can be documented for mortgage qualification."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d3719c6acb29bd52b7e1e409b90cedc6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 240}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VA BENEFITS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"VA Benefits refer to the financial assistance programs offered to veterans, eligible for use as stable income for mortgage applications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d3719c6acb29bd52b7e1e409b90cedc6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 34}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 240}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRUST INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Trust Income refers to payments received from a trust, which can be utilized as stable income if properly documented."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d3719c6acb29bd52b7e1e409b90cedc6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 33}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 238}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SOCIAL SECURITY INCOME CALCULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Social Security Income Calculation is the process of determining the taxable and non-taxable portions of social security benefits for income qualification."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d3719c6acb29bd52b7e1e409b90cedc6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 110}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LUMP SUM DISTRIBUTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lump Sum Distributions refer to one-time payments from trusts that can be used for mortgage down-payment or closing costs if verified."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d3719c6acb29bd52b7e1e409b90cedc6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 66}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INCOME TAX WITHHOLDING TABLES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Income Tax Withholding Tables are official guidelines used to determine how much tax should be withheld from various forms of income, including Social Security."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d3719c6acb29bd52b7e1e409b90cedc6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 110}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TAX-EXEMPT INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Tax-exempt Income refers to income that is not subject to federal income tax, which may include certain Social Security benefits."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d3719c6acb29bd52b7e1e409b90cedc6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FREDDIE MAC ONLY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Freddie Mac Only designates specific practices or treatments of income within the Freddie Mac underwriting guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d3719c6acb29bd52b7e1e409b90cedc6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TAXABLE PORTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Taxable Portion indicates the segment of income that is subject to taxation, important for understanding total income for mortgage qualification."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d3719c6acb29bd52b7e1e409b90cedc6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 110}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-TAXABLE PORTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Non-taxable Portion refers to the part of income that is exempt from taxation, affecting the overall calculation of qualifying income."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d3719c6acb29bd52b7e1e409b90cedc6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 110}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRUST AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Trust Agreement is a legal document establishing a trust, which outlines how trust income is managed and distributed."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d3719c6acb29bd52b7e1e409b90cedc6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 33}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 238}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRUSTEE'S STATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Trustee's Statement is a document verifying the income details of a trust as required for stable income validation in loan applications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d3719c6acb29bd52b7e1e409b90cedc6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 33}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 238}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TWO-YEAR HISTORY OF RECEIPT&quot;">
