  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Rental Property is real estate that is leased to tenants in exchange for payment, with specific guidelines for income reporting and mortgage calculations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rental Property refers to real estate that is leased to generate rental income, subject to taxation and financial analysis."</data>
