</node>
<node id="&quot;MONTHLY NET RENTAL INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Monthly Net Rental Income is the income a property generates each month after deducting expenses necessary to maintain the property."&lt;SEP&gt;"Monthly Net Rental Income is the income generated from rental properties after subtracting vacancy losses and maintenance expenses, crucial for evaluating the financial health of borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-78e642bbbbe6e4f896abe6c8dfd4bab2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8864c52069485823a39babaa2b2005e</data>
