</node>
<node id="&quot;TOTAL DEBT-TO-INCOME RATIO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL_TERM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Total Debt-to-Income Ratio is a financial measure that compares a borrower's total monthly obligations to their gross monthly income, essential in loan underwriting."</data>
