<node id="&quot;FORM 1007&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Form 1007 is a document utilized to calculate the rental income and expenses associated with a subject property for qualifying purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Form 1007 is a property appraisal form used to report market rent, important for determining qualifying rental income."&lt;SEP&gt;"Form 1007 is a property appraisal report used to determine the market rent for a single-family rental property."&lt;SEP&gt;"Form 1007 is a report used to determine the rental income potential of an investment property, relevant in the securing of mortgages."&lt;SEP&gt;"Form 1007 is a specific appraisal report used to analyze rental properties, detailing market rent information."&lt;SEP&gt;"Form 1007 is a specific form used in the appraisal process to evaluate rental income from a single-family rental property."&lt;SEP&gt;"Form 1007 is a standardized document used to assess rental income for underwriting purposes in real estate transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-48dc06181f6c67399f82ff0110257532&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8864c52069485823a39babaa2b2005e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb02bde5abfff1b16d83434416df7465&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1578b8b51044019bfff38a69eecab0be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78e642bbbbe6e4f896abe6c8dfd4bab2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1fc933db1bd6fd3476c94d029ad8540&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7c7059ebd575d1369f6649db3e25ee4</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 120}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 365}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FORM 1025&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Form 1025 is a form used for operating income statements for investment properties, which is crucial for assessing the financial viability of rental properties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Form 1025 is a particular appraisal document used to evaluate two- to four-unit residential properties, concerning rental income assessments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Form 1025 is a standardized form utilized for evaluating the rental income from investment properties in mortgage underwriting."&lt;SEP&gt;"Form 1025 is a type of appraisal used for two- to four-unit properties, evaluating their rental income potential."&lt;SEP&gt;"Form 1025 is similar to Form 1007 and is used for one-to-four unit residential properties, aiding in the assessment of rental income."&lt;SEP&gt;"Form 1025 is similar to Form 1007 but is used for appraisals involving multi-family rental properties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Form 1025 is used for reporting the appraisal of a small residential income property, including multiple units."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-48dc06181f6c67399f82ff0110257532&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8864c52069485823a39babaa2b2005e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb02bde5abfff1b16d83434416df7465&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1578b8b51044019bfff38a69eecab0be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78e642bbbbe6e4f896abe6c8dfd4bab2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1fc933db1bd6fd3476c94d029ad8540&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7c7059ebd575d1369f6649db3e25ee4</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 120}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 365}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MONTHLY OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL_TERM"</data>
