<node id="&quot;GROSS RENTAL INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Gross Rental Income is the total income generated from rental activities before any deductions are made and serves as a basis for financial analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gross Rental Income refers to the total rental income earned from a property before any deductions, such as expenses for maintenance or vacancy."</data>
