<node id="&quot;SCHEDULE 1&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Schedule 1 is a federal income tax form that reports additional income, which is relevant for analyzing a borrower's rental income."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule 1 is a tax form that is used to report additional income or adjustments to income, relevant for analyzing financial data."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule 1 is a tax form used to report additional income and adjustments to income for tax purposes, important in assessing a borrower's financial stability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule 1 is a tax form used to report additional income, such as rental income, which accompanies the main federal income tax return."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f7c7059ebd575d1369f6649db3e25ee4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1fc933db1bd6fd3476c94d029ad8540&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb02bde5abfff1b16d83434416df7465&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8864c52069485823a39babaa2b2005e</data>
