</node>
<node id="&quot;SCHEDULE E&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Schedule E is a form used for reporting income or loss from rental real estate, royalties, partnerships, S corporations, estates, and trusts by the IRS."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule E is a form used for reporting rental income and expenses on federal income tax returns, detailing a property owner's rental activity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule E is a form used in U.S. tax returns to report income and losses from rental real estate, and is referenced in the context of determining net rental income for properties including ADUs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule E is a form used to report income or loss from rental real estate and royalties, essential for calculating net rental income."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule E is a form used to report income or loss from rental real estate, providing essential information for assessing the borrower's rental income."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule E is a form used to report supplemental income or loss, specifically rental income, as part of tax reporting."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule E is a part of the federal income tax return used to report income or loss from rental real estate and is essential in assessing a borrower's rental income."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule E is a tax document used to report income or loss from rental real estate and royalties, relevant in the context of rental income assessment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule E is a tax form used to report income or loss from rental real estate, essential for determining net rental income in accordance with tax guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule E is a tax form used to report income or loss from rental real estate, royalties, partnerships, S corporations, estates, trusts, and other income."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule E is a tax form used to report income or losses from rental real estate, used as a basis for qualifying for a mortgage under Freddie Mac guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-10ce55972cf12e21fd77796ab69a96ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cea98d6086733276bdd5c19993c4deb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-151a292558f7e1fe4b393da7f73632a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48dc06181f6c67399f82ff0110257532&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8864c52069485823a39babaa2b2005e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb02bde5abfff1b16d83434416df7465&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1578b8b51044019bfff38a69eecab0be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1fc933db1bd6fd3476c94d029ad8540&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81edfb1496d26226dca5f3238aa461cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79943296a1fa68394820a29e269db689&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7c7059ebd575d1369f6649db3e25ee4</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 118}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 361}]</data>
</node>
