</node>
<node id="&quot;VACANCY LOSSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Vacancy Losses refer to income lost due to rental units not being occupied, which impacts the calculation of net rental income for borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vacancy Losses refer to the income lost when rental properties are not occupied, impacting overall cash flow."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vacancy Losses refer to the potential loss of income due to unoccupied rental units, which is factored into rental income calculations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vacancy Losses represent the loss of rental income due to unoccupied properties, affecting the calculation of net rental income."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vacancy Losses represent the potential income lost when a rental property is not occupied, impacting overall revenue calculations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fb02bde5abfff1b16d83434416df7465&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48dc06181f6c67399f82ff0110257532&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8864c52069485823a39babaa2b2005e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1fc933db1bd6fd3476c94d029ad8540&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7c7059ebd575d1369f6649db3e25ee4</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 119}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ONGOING MAINTENANCE EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Ongoing Maintenance Expenses are continual costs associated with the upkeep of rental properties, which factors into the net rental income calculation for underwriting."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ongoing Maintenance Expenses are costs associated with keeping a rental property in good condition, which can affect net rental income calculations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ongoing Maintenance Expenses refer to the costs incurred to maintain a rental property, deducted from the gross rental income to calculate net income."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f7c7059ebd575d1369f6649db3e25ee4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb02bde5abfff1b16d83434416df7465&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8864c52069485823a39babaa2b2005e</data>
