  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Tax Filing Year refers to the period during which tax returns are filed, impacting the calculation and documentation of rental income."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tax Filing Year refers to the specific year during which income is reported to tax authorities, relevant for assessing rental income documentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tax Filing Year refers to the year for which tax returns are filed, essential for evaluating rental income and property income claims during mortgage applications."</data>
