<node id="&quot;TRANSACTION TYPE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Transaction Type refers to the category of loan or financial activity being undertaken, which influences the documentation and qualifying criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Transaction Type refers to the classification of a loan application process, including purchase, refinance, or investment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Transaction Type refers to the nature of the real estate transaction, such as purchase or refinance, which determines the lending criteria and mortgage options."</data>
