  <data key="d1">"Extended Period indicates a duration wherein a property was not operational as a rental, affecting income calculations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Extended Period refers to a significant timeframe during which a rental property may be out of service, influencing its financial reporting and implications for income."</data>
