  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Property Management Experience is the expertise in managing rental properties, which may be considered when evaluating a borrower's qualifications for a loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property Management Experience refers to the knowledge and skills gained from managing rental properties, which can affect a borrower's qualification for a mortgage."</data>
