  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Repair Expenses are costs incurred for maintaining or improving a property, which can affect financial assessments in rental income calculations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Repair Expenses refer to costs incurred for renovation or maintenance of a rental property, essential for determining financial viability during loan assessments."</data>
