<node id="&quot;SPECIAL FEATURE CODE (SFC J66)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"IDENTIFIER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Special Feature Code (SFC J66) is a designation applied to certain loan types or properties, indicating specific characteristics or requirements for the underwriting process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-81edfb1496d26226dca5f3238aa461cd</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 6}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 111}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RENOVATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Renovation refers to the process of improving or restoring a property, which may impact its rental income and the documentation requirements within the mortgage file."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-151a292558f7e1fe4b393da7f73632a9</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 6}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 111}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CALENDAR YEAR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Calendar Year refers to the annual period used for financial reporting and tax purposes, affecting the timelines and documentation related to ADU rental analyses."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-151a292558f7e1fe4b393da7f73632a9</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 6}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 111}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPRAISAL REPORT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Appraisal Report assesses the value of a property, taking into account factors such as resale restrictions and current market conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Appraisal Report is a document prepared by a licensed appraiser that establishes the value of a property based on various market factors and comparable sales."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Appraisal Report is a document prepared by an appraiser that details the value and condition of a property, including compliance with zoning laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Appraisal Report is a document required to evaluate the value of a property, including updates performed by certified appraisers."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Appraisal Report is a formal analysis provided by a qualified appraiser evaluating the market value of a property, including potential impacts of solar panels."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Appraisal Report is a formal assessment of a property's value, which includes relevant information about market comparisons, resale restrictions, and conditions affecting the property’s valuation."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Appraisal Report is a formal document prepared by an appraiser detailing the value and condition of a property, including specific characteristics of manufactured homes and accessory dwelling units."&lt;SEP&gt;"An appraisal report is a formal document that presents the findings of an appraisal, detailing the analysis of property values and the appraiser's conclusions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Appraisal Report is a comprehensive document prepared by appraisers detailing the analysis, findings, and opinion of value for a specific property."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Appraisal Report is a formal evaluation of a property's value, which includes specific information about the condition and characteristics of an ADU to support rental analyses."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Appraisal Report is the formal document created by the appraiser that details the findings, methodology, and analysis of property value assessments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-24638398312c4aec93c00e795739cbf9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-787de407af176e62ce6eb517b2dd1d21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f443d70c1b97ab92c6f9f441ec9ced99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea0854aedb400acc54c26d78db5065c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd684789b748cb20186f7859db539838&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-151a292558f7e1fe4b393da7f73632a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d048ce21946dbbaf2025fa9d108f909&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6434821b2faf91ece4b375276017b775&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a01c4d224477788cf5c6bfd6ccc84e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f562ac717c24b9fccfb1aab0164fb157&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42fe7768b333d42fc15f00fc4e0ba0d3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 142}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 396}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REPAIR COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Repair Costs are the expenses incurred to maintain or restore a property, which should be documented in the mortgage file to support claims of income and usage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-151a292558f7e1fe4b393da7f73632a9</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 6}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 114}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 358}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DAYS IN USE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Days in Use refers to the count of days a property, including an ADU, has been actively rented or utilized, which is significant for financial reporting and rental income calculations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-151a292558f7e1fe4b393da7f73632a9</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 118}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 361}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MINIMUM INCOME DOCUMENTATION REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Minimum Income Documentation Requirements refer to the set of guidelines that dictate the necessary documents and proofs needed to verify rental income for mortgage applications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-151a292558f7e1fe4b393da7f73632a9</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 6}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 114}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 358}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BOARDER INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Boarder Income refers to the rental income derived from individuals living in the borrower’s principal residence or second home, generally deeming it unstable income except under specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7a01c4d224477788cf5c6bfd6ccc84e2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RENTAL INCOME CALCULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Rental Income Calculation refers to the method used to determine net income from rental properties, considering factors like vacancies and operating costs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7a01c4d224477788cf5c6bfd6ccc84e2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 127}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MEDICAL WAIVER FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Medical Waiver Funds are financial resources used to pay for personal assistance services, which may include room and board for individuals with disabilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7a01c4d224477788cf5c6bfd6ccc84e2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 67}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;IRS FORM 1099&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"IRS Form 1099 is a tax document used to report income received, often applicable to contractors or contingent workers."&lt;SEP&gt;"IRS Form 1099 is a tax form used to report various types of income other than wages, salaries, and tips to the Internal Revenue Service (IRS), playing a critical role in income documentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"IRS Form 1099 is a tax form used to report various types of income other than wages, salaries, and tips, crucial for documenting income from services performed."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7a01c4d224477788cf5c6bfd6ccc84e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ed1a879d48c49b16f42ce89ae56d954&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cea98d6086733276bdd5c19993c4deb7</data>
