</node>
<node id="&quot;OPERATING AND MAINTENANCE COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Operating and Maintenance Costs are expenses associated with running and maintaining a rental property, which must be considered in rental income calculations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Operating and maintenance costs encompass the expenses associated with running and maintaining a property, including repairs, utilities, and management fees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7a01c4d224477788cf5c6bfd6ccc84e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cea98d6086733276bdd5c19993c4deb7</data>
