</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTINGENT WORKER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Contingent Worker is an employee engaged on a temporary or part-time basis, particularly in contract-based arrangements, often reported via IRS Form 1099."&lt;SEP&gt;"A contingent worker is a person employed on a non-permanent basis, such as freelancers, temporary workers, or independent contractors."</data>
