</node>
<node id="&quot;INCOME REPORTING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Income Reporting refers to the process through which borrowers detail their earnings for mortgage qualification, including various forms like IRS Form 1099."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7a01c4d224477788cf5c6bfd6ccc84e2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SCHEDULE C&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Schedule C is a form used by sole proprietors to report income or loss from a business they operated or a profession they practiced."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule C is a form used to report income or loss from a business operated or a profession practiced by the taxpayer."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule C is a tax form used by sole proprietors to report income and expenses from their business, critical in verifying self-employment income."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule C is a tax form used by sole proprietors to report income and expenses related to their business on their individual income tax return."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule C is a tax form used to report income or loss from a business operated as a sole proprietorship, providing essential information for income calculations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cea98d6086733276bdd5c19993c4deb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d14191b10a7b641a859301abcf2d9873&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-332ea40a8706fdd85456078cf47232fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79943296a1fa68394820a29e269db689&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ed1a879d48c49b16f42ce89ae56d954</data>
