<node id="&quot;CONTRACTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A contractor refers to an individual or business that enters into a contract to provide services, which may include construction, maintenance, or other specialized services."</data>
