<node id="&quot;W-2&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"W-2 forms are tax documents provided by employers to report wages paid and taxes withheld to the IRS, integral for income verification."&lt;SEP&gt;"W-2 is a tax form that reports an employee's annual wages and the amount of taxes withheld from their paycheck, crucial for verifying income."&lt;SEP&gt;"W-2 is a tax form used by employers to report an employee's annual wages and the taxes withheld, which may be relevant for analyzing a borrower’s complete income history."</data>
