<node id="&quot;IRS FORM 1065&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"IRS Form 1065 is a tax form used to report income, deductions, gains, losses, etc., from the operation of a partnership."&lt;SEP&gt;"IRS Form 1065 is used by partnerships to report income, deductions, and other tax-related items, essential for analyzing self-employment income."&lt;SEP&gt;"IRS Form 1065 is used by partnerships to report income, deductions, gains, and losses, along with the partners' shares of these amounts."</data>
