  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"IRS Form 1120S is a tax form used to report income, deductions, gains, losses, and other tax-related information for S corporations."&lt;SEP&gt;"IRS Form 1120S is for S Corporations to report income, deductions, and credits, providing a pass-through taxation benefit to shareholders."&lt;SEP&gt;"IRS Form 1120S is the tax form used by S corporations to report income, which is crucial in the context of self-employment income verification."</data>
