<node id="&quot;S CORPORATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"S Corporations are a type of corporate structure that allows income to pass through to shareholders, avoiding double taxation while meeting specific IRS requirements."</data>
