</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSETS WITHDRAWAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Assets Withdrawal describes the process by which a business owner removes funds or resources from their business for personal use, impacting cash flow considerations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d14191b10a7b641a859301abcf2d9873</data>
