<node id="&quot;SCHEDULE K-1&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Schedule K-1 is a tax document used to report income, deductions, and credits from a partnership or S Corporation to each partner or shareholder."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule K-1 is a tax document used to report income, deductions, and credits from partnerships to the IRS, reflecting ownership and earnings distributions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule K-1 is a tax document used to report income, deductions, and credits from partnerships, S corporations, or limited liability companies (LLCs) to partners."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-27c5b5517eef234cf0db585936ec28f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d14191b10a7b641a859301abcf2d9873&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-398938dbff78b05d0c3830d36e6918b6</data>
