</node>
<node id="&quot;BUSINESS LIQUIDITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Business Liquidity is the ability of a business to meet its short-term financial obligations using its liquid assets."&lt;SEP&gt;"Business liquidity refers to the ease with which a business can convert its assets into cash to meet immediate obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-76dfd0d1478f77acd572a51bf4e3956a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-398938dbff78b05d0c3830d36e6918b6</data>
