</node>
<node id="&quot;GUARANTEED PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Guaranteed Payments are payments made to partners in a partnership for services rendered or capital invested, which are not dependent on the partnership's profits."&lt;SEP&gt;"Guaranteed payments are fixed amounts that a partner in a partnership receives, typically for services rendered, regardless of the partnership's income."&lt;SEP&gt;"Guaranteed payments are fixed payments made to partners in a partnership, regardless of the income of the business."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-76dfd0d1478f77acd572a51bf4e3956a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27c5b5517eef234cf0db585936ec28f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-398938dbff78b05d0c3830d36e6918b6</data>
