<node id="&quot;IRS FORM 4868&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"IRS Form 4868 is a form that allows individuals to file for an extension for their tax returns, affecting the validity of tax transcripts."&lt;SEP&gt;"IRS Form 4868 is a form used to apply for an automatic extension of time to file U.S. individual income tax returns, allowing taxpayers additional time to file their tax documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"IRS Form 4868 is an application for an automatic extension of time to file U.S. Individual Income Tax Return, used when the borrower has not filed their tax return."&lt;SEP&gt;"IRS Form 4868 is an application for automatic extension of time to file U.S. Individual Income Tax Returns, crucial for taxpayers seeking to extend their filing deadline."&lt;SEP&gt;"IRS Form 4868 is the application form used for filing a tax extension with the Internal Revenue Service (IRS), allowing taxpayers extra time to file their tax returns."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bf6a394b54c040882b94d8dd97b886e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a173c08400538977a1dc5397bceda0a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddb3009468a2e7eaa9aab8998eae8ca6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79943296a1fa68394820a29e269db689&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f5775363168aa3256002e8b909c2f52</data>
