  <data key="d1">"Tax Transcripts are official documents issued by the IRS summarizing individual or business tax return information for a specific year."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tax Transcripts are official records provided by the IRS that summarize tax return information, which are crucial during application processes for loans and financial assessments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tax Transcripts are required financial documents that detail an individual's reported income to the IRS, crucial for loan qualification."</data>
