</node>
<node id="&quot;SELF-EMPLOYMENT LOSS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Self-Employment Loss refers to the financial losses that a borrower may incur from their own business, which are not required to be considered when qualifying for a loan under specific circumstances."</data>
