<node id="&quot;W2 WAGE EARNER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A W2 Wage Earner is an individual who receives wages and is reported by their employer on the W2 form, representing a common income source used in loan applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"W2 Wage Earner refers to employees whose tax information is summarized on IRS Form W-2, detailing wages and taxes withheld, which is used for tax filing."</data>
