<node id="&quot;IRS FORM 4506 C&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"IRS Form 4506 C is a form used to request a copy of tax documents from the IRS, particularly relevant when transcripts are unavailable to validate income."&lt;SEP&gt;"IRS Form 4506 C is a form used to request a transcript of tax returns directly from the IRS, often used to verify income and taxes owed."&lt;SEP&gt;"IRS Form 4506 C is a request form used to obtain tax return transcripts from the IRS, necessary for verifying income and tax history for underwriting purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"IRS Form 4506 C is a tax form used to request transcripts of tax returns from the IRS, necessary for the lending process."</data>
