<node id="&quot;APPRAISER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Appraiser is a professional responsible for estimating the value of a property based on various criteria and inspections."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Appraiser is a professional who evaluates the value of properties and prepares appraisal reports, often required in mortgage processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Appraiser is a qualified professional who assesses a property's value, including consideration of environmental impacts and risk factors."&lt;SEP&gt;"An appraiser is a professional who assesses property values according to established guidelines, including the ANSI standard."&lt;SEP&gt;"An appraiser is a trained professional who evaluates properties to determine their market value based on various factors and methodologies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Appraiser is a professional responsible for assessing the value of real estate and must meet specific eligibility requirements as defined by Flagstar Bank."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Appraiser is a professional responsible for assessing the value of properties based on various factors, including environmental considerations and market conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Appraiser is a professional responsible for evaluating the value of the subject property by analyzing comparable sales data and market trends."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Appraiser is a professional tasked with evaluating properties and determining their market value based on various criteria and comparable sales."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Appraiser is a qualified individual responsible for assessing the value of a property based on its condition and the completion of necessary repairs."&lt;SEP&gt;"The appraiser is a professional responsible for evaluating properties and determining their market value based on various factors, including comparable sales."&lt;SEP&gt;"The appraiser is a professional responsible for evaluating the value of manufactured homes, ensuring compliance with relevant guidelines and requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-24638398312c4aec93c00e795739cbf9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1eb0558635c4f1b731b5f38c1ed9bb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f443d70c1b97ab92c6f9f441ec9ced99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e26a3be3838ff40fb61edfe66e0268a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-756642bc27ab7956732455451eb4ce71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea0854aedb400acc54c26d78db5065c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d1c3e36c841bdc1a7ede120ae160e58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d77c56c7ef7f25742c687f6ad137c8f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b93ae0daff9b29376c9af8da1cb0522&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d83092219c6a0be0948a52ad38b945a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42fe7768b333d42fc15f00fc4e0ba0d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3eb9a9047b04f55e775ab1675823f162</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 149}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 407}]</data>
</node>
