<node id="&quot;DU RESPONSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"DU Response is part of the automated underwriting system used to assess loan applications and determine eligibility for appraisal waivers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3eb9a9047b04f55e775ab1675823f162</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 106}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 348}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECURITY AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL TERM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Security Agreement is a contract that outlines the collateral for a loan, detailing what property is to be secured against the borrowed funds."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3eb9a9047b04f55e775ab1675823f162</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 150}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 411}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MORTGAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mortgages are financial instruments used to secure loans for purchasing real estate, governed by various underwriting guidelines and regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortgages are financial loans secured by real estate, allowing borrowers to purchase properties by repaying over time, typically with interest."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortgages are loans specifically for the purchase of real estate, secured by the property itself, forming a significant aspect of property acquisition."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b81be5b6336b17987b5cd27bc0cf519d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1da51e05e6600babe4a36494acdf7928&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3eb9a9047b04f55e775ab1675823f162</data>
