</node>
<node id="&quot;REMOVAL OF EQUIPMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Removal of Equipment refers to the action that may take place in the event of foreclosure, allowing for the extraction of installed solar panels from the property."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3eb9a9047b04f55e775ab1675823f162</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 150}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 413}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INSTALLATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Installation refers to the process of setting up solar panels on a property, which includes responsibilities for damage that might occur during this procedure."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3eb9a9047b04f55e775ab1675823f162</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 150}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 413}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINANCED SOLAR PANELS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Financed Solar Panels are solar energy systems that are acquired through loans, impacting the terms of property agreements and financing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3eb9a9047b04f55e775ab1675823f162</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 150}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 411}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DAMAGE RESPONSIBILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Damage Responsibility pertains to the obligations assigned to the solar panel owner concerning any damages arising from installation, malfunction, or removal of the equipment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3eb9a9047b04f55e775ab1675823f162</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 150}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 413}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HOMEOWNER'S INSURANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Homeowner's Insurance is a type of property insurance that provides financial protection against damage to a home and liability for accidents that occur on the property."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-645973893eaf0e8d2eb4a7822c3fe6eb</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 150}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 412}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROPERTY TYPES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Property Types refer to the classification of properties based on their intended use, which can influence the mortgage application process and requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property Types refers to the different categories of properties that may be financed, including single-family homes, condominiums, and investment properties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-645973893eaf0e8d2eb4a7822c3fe6eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4de71275bc933c2c228984f601d0e0a1</data>
