</node>
<node id="&quot;APPRAISAL RESTRICTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Appraisal Restrictions pertain to guidelines affecting property appraisals, influencing the types and conditions under which appraisals can be waived or required."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-388d67b329a7c9987f1aa1ce87dad2a8</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 106}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 348}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSTRUCTION LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Construction loans are short-term loans used to finance the construction of a property, which may come with distinct appraisal requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-388d67b329a7c9987f1aa1ce87dad2a8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TEXAS 50(A)(6) LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Texas 50(a)(6) loans are specific mortgage products available in Texas, which have unique regulatory criteria affecting loan amounts and terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-388d67b329a7c9987f1aa1ce87dad2a8</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 94}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 327}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FULL APPRAISAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Full appraisal refers to a comprehensive assessment performed to determine the market value of a property, often required when certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-388d67b329a7c9987f1aa1ce87dad2a8</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 106}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 348}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEED RESTRICTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Deed Restrictions are legal limitations placed on a property by the seller that restrict how the property can be used, often affecting mortgage eligibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Deed Restrictions are legal limitations placed on a property that dictate certain uses and obligations regarding the property, affecting ownership and transfer."&lt;SEP&gt;"Deed Restrictions are legal limitations placed on property use and ownership, often related to resale and occupant eligibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Deed restrictions are legally binding provisions that limit how property can be used and affect eligibility for appraisal waivers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8cfec8ddeaba989b347c8cc9daa583b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d635e8ee0ac48c5c8906a09d9d6759ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f55695b58ffd5e2ba42b42a2ed0cdbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-388d67b329a7c9987f1aa1ce87dad2a8</data>
