</node>
<node id="&quot;RURAL HIGH-NEEDS APPRAISAL WAIVER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Rural High-Needs Appraisal Waiver is a specific type of appraisal waiver offering additional requirements for properties in selected high-needs rural areas."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rural High-Needs Appraisal Waiver refers to specific guidelines set forth for properties in areas deemed high-need by the FHFA, affecting appraisal processes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-388d67b329a7c9987f1aa1ce87dad2a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91cf1d5ee6d1d8b224c54c5417b6eaee</data>
