  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Ineligible or Caution AUS response indicates automated underwriting system responses that flag loans for additional scrutiny or disqualification based on guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-91cf1d5ee6d1d8b224c54c5417b6eaee</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 184}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 459}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NATURAL DISASTER PROCEDURES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Natural Disaster Procedures refers to the guidelines established for handling properties affected by disaster events such as tornados and flooding, ensuring properties are assessed and repaired as needed."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4de71275bc933c2c228984f601d0e0a1</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 12}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 154}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;C6 CONDITION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"C6 Condition is a classification relating to property status, indicating that any issues compromising safety, soundness, or structural integrity must be addressed prior to loan approval."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4de71275bc933c2c228984f601d0e0a1</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 12}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 154}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REAL ESTATE OWNED (REO) PROPERTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Real Estate Owned (REO) Property refers to properties that have been foreclosed upon and are owned by a lender, now available for sale, often requiring an appraisal before transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4de71275bc933c2c228984f601d0e0a1</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 12}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 153}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COOPERATIVE UNITS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cooperative Units are a type of housing where residents own shares in a corporation that owns the building, thus sharing ownership of a communal property."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4de71275bc933c2c228984f601d0e0a1</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 132}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 382}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROPERTY INSPECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Property Inspection is an evaluative process conducted to assess the condition of a property, often required before concluding a real estate transaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property Inspection is the process of examining a property's condition and value, which is often required prior to completing real estate transactions to ensure safety and compliance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cefb0ad4148eab93b794bfdc3eb3eac7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4de71275bc933c2c228984f601d0e0a1</data>
