</node>
<node id="&quot;AFFIDAVIT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Affidavit is a written statement confirmed by oath or affirmation, used as evidence in court, particularly in confirming that a borrower received and reviewed the property inspection report."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4de71275bc933c2c228984f601d0e0a1</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 10}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 136}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EDUCATION REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Education Requirements entail the necessary training, testing, and ethical standards required for property inspectors to ensure they are qualified and competent in their profession."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4de71275bc933c2c228984f601d0e0a1</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 12}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 154}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN DELIVERY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Delivery is the process where mortgage lenders submit the finalized loan package to secondary market entities for funding and securitization."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4de71275bc933c2c228984f601d0e0a1</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 12}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 154}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INSPECTION CONTINGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Inspection Contingency is a clause in a real estate contract that allows buyers to back out if the inspection uncovers issues with the property."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4de71275bc933c2c228984f601d0e0a1</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 12}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 154}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPRAISAL INDEPENDENCE REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Appraisal Independence Requirements are guidelines intended to ensure the integrity of the appraisal process by preventing conflicts of interest."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8d2d43086c2d67020db933397546a228</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 106}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 347}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UCDP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"UCDP stands for Universal Companion Data Portal, a technology platform for submitting appraisal reports prior to delivery."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8d2d43086c2d67020db933397546a228</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MISMO 2.6 XML FILE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
