  <data key="d2">chunk-756642bc27ab7956732455451eb4ce71</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEASEHOLD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Leasehold refers to a legal property interest wherein the tenant holds the right to occupy and use a property for a specific term under a lease, impacting mortgage eligibility and underwriting processes."</data>
