</node>
<node id="&quot;INDUSTRIAL SITES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Industrial Sites are areas designated for industrial use, which may negatively affect nearby property values due to environmental or economic factors."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cefb0ad4148eab93b794bfdc3eb3eac7</data>
