</node>
<node id="&quot;LEASEHOLD MORTGAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Leasehold Mortgage is a type of mortgage secured against a leasehold estate, specifically tailored for properties with long-term leases."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Leasehold Mortgage refers to a mortgage secured by a leasehold interest in the land, which requires specific conditions regarding property ownership and market acceptance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b81be5b6336b17987b5cd27bc0cf519d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ca2c4d1778a11943201b4e917c15322</data>
