<node id="&quot;MORTGAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mortgage" refers to a financial product that allows individuals to borrow funds for purchasing property, with the property serving as collateral for the loan. It is a type of loan specifically designed for purchasing real estate, requiring stable income verification and adherence to specific guidelines for eligibility. The borrower is obligated to make regular payments, including principal and interest, until the debt is settled. The mortgage is a legal agreement where the lender provides funds to the borrower, secured by the property itself, with repayment terms specified. In essence, a mortgage is a loan used to finance the purchase of real estate, involving the borrowing process and specific documentation requirements for borrowers.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2e912b60195be8ca87a44127ef55d282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d864e2754e1d5a70d89033bc8babcdcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f01d27887cb1edc56efdd9355e2cbba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7705559d232d0e6b4978eff8d1e8b137&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8fbac57b62fb040bd0302d8a94d9f65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6261b628a88157f5bd4a959ee8fdb8f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b58c2a47b041d2502022392c611f405c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f67964fc288da88f7bb3defef1f29177&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98fca990e6b71624308defbc9fca0285&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a05e768a9b64dd897dab3f97a6c234a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a9a7e59e34af57946c09cfa07672f92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31dff4bfbf6291a2db9c4969e0f5cbe0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b4494b2a290a96f3ee6a9d358a812a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9004bef6d0a745fff75d973c6b90ef4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ca2c4d1778a11943201b4e917c15322&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-452a34dee684e3a93929cc44930deb38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-144555be48c11828e99c3a7c623170fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf0031128e81eed5883f39146514f546&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cd8475962bfe1c2428c1ea6691488c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-105c313a28b49198d2d2b78db6e7529b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-faa30e2538a6e107a9cdb96ee1067084&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2eef4940eec1ef97062f77d3efe4074e</data>
