<node id="&quot;CLOSING COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">Closing Costs are fees and expenses associated with the finalization of a real estate transaction. These costs impact affordability and financing for buyers and sellers, typically paid at the closing meeting. They include various administrative and legal expenses, loan origination fees, title insurance, appraisal fees, processing fees, legal fees, service charges, taxes, and other related expenses. Closing Costs are crucial to consider during the purchase or sale of a property, as they are over and above the property price and can affect the overall cost for the parties involved. These expenses are necessary to transfer ownership and complete the transaction, often factored into loan underwritings and loan qualification discussions.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f76dd878d76d1e8bdf5fb1cac46447ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-756818f22cafd11009f520745a0306df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9640138f8accaa3b0962e60c94ddc9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05020d8707d581b6c2d0c1b184d17f01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9da80c7f63e32b0d7dc6df2ae9032546&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f443d70c1b97ab92c6f9f441ec9ced99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f67964fc288da88f7bb3defef1f29177&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d048ce21946dbbaf2025fa9d108f909&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66bee43127ef8c394af00a30febd1833&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2891670ed51dfc47bbb015af66f14dde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb8af4ec267d0a18313280fdbe45469d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-164ff18d322608d7342cc1d0619c9f0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a9a7e59e34af57946c09cfa07672f92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d30aff8ce4b53c163b59f9369ea58842&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e28f33ddf3b335e19135327f9afb2b07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-446d02f0d6609ee8a932eea7a8d1302e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-023647e2d4d4ed50a6e5f501c055a8b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efc5b39715a3cc6b0751b8cfe29a66e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-144555be48c11828e99c3a7c623170fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-787de407af176e62ce6eb517b2dd1d21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23ec06f9f4a15f1cb40e52e628766be9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00440a55cc64896de959c80a8727fbfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cd8475962bfe1c2428c1ea6691488c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6843059eea11d10d23493c39af4afd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c568dd7273250cbc578b2e15944d1bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c315a6b793aa073b8f6cb2ffb42e4f97</data>
