<node id="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Borrower" refers to an individual or entity seeking loans, particularly in the context of real estate transactions. They need to provide documentation of income, employment, and financial history to qualify for financing. The borrower must meet specific qualifications and adhere to underwriting guidelines set by the lender. They are obligated to repay the borrowed amount with interest as per the agreed-upon terms. Verification of income, assets, and creditworthiness is essential for approval. The borrower is responsible for providing accurate financial information and meeting specific criteria for loan eligibility, which may include evaluation of rental income and employment status. Additionally, borrowers may need to provide documentation of sources of income, such as retirement assets or contributions received from gifts. Overall, the borrower is a crucial individual seeking financial support through loans for property purchases or refinancing.</data>
  <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e912b60195be8ca87a44127ef55d282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f01d27887cb1edc56efdd9355e2cbba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-843cd03316121e01909837126fbbe24c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d2d43086c2d67020db933397546a228&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f76dd878d76d1e8bdf5fb1cac46447ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05020d8707d581b6c2d0c1b184d17f01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-212cbc70c3f0e59feb09b85b04e1c40f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b58c2a47b041d2502022392c611f405c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48dc06181f6c67399f82ff0110257532&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66bee43127ef8c394af00a30febd1833&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78e642bbbbe6e4f896abe6c8dfd4bab2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81edfb1496d26226dca5f3238aa461cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebee13ef54f5a678a952e514a3a25998&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e28f33ddf3b335e19135327f9afb2b07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31dff4bfbf6291a2db9c4969e0f5cbe0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a0d9684317720eb42eaa206a9f3cc5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-023647e2d4d4ed50a6e5f501c055a8b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-756642bc27ab7956732455451eb4ce71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0ff713c7eebcf293485e860ba8cc6a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2eef4940eec1ef97062f77d3efe4074e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1b456ca1fe500021a9d2ca86dedfd1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3719c6acb29bd52b7e1e409b90cedc6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-756818f22cafd11009f520745a0306df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ed1a879d48c49b16f42ce89ae56d954&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35b11a1ced8de5c90f65c0b1344222c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31a563a8507e131e7544819dbd9373b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f67964fc288da88f7bb3defef1f29177&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-444e5ed0aa3891f1dfc3371133a3be60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95358b428c5f107947a116a0643878c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb8af4ec267d0a18313280fdbe45469d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27c5b5517eef234cf0db585936ec28f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05495faf7d0cd92781a907bc384d2f21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cea98d6086733276bdd5c19993c4deb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec242ee203576a6a4b76efbe5458e782&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f91be92d53c1aed3b7126461f33e415&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cefb0ad4148eab93b794bfdc3eb3eac7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c5f36