<node id="&quot;FLAGSTAR BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">Flagstar Bank is a financial institution specializing in various banking and mortgage services, including loan options for manufactured homes, conventional financing, and conforming loans. They are involved in mortgage lending processes such as underwriting, credit analysis, and determining loan eligibility based on credit history. Additionally, Flagstar Bank provides specific guidelines for loan submissions, including property inspections, appraisal processes, and compliance with marketability and environmental safety standards. They are noted for their commitment to fair evaluation of credit applications, protecting borrowers and investors from mortgage fraud, and adhering to stringent guidelines for transactions. Flagstar Bank also plays a crucial role in the underwriting process, requiring specific information for prudent decision-making and oversight of fund management during property repairs, including repair escrows. It is mentioned that Flagstar Bank may experience difficulties in obtaining tax transcripts for customers due to identity theft, impacting operations. They offer various mortgage products such as rate-and-term refinancing, cash-out refinancing, and have guidelines for appraisal waivers. Flagstar Bank is also responsible for holding repair escrows, approving loans, conducting inquiries with applicants for responsible lending practices, and overseeing power of attorney transactions. Moreover, Flagstar Bank reserves the right to order Automated Valuation Models and review appraisals for any loan, ensuring compliance with specific guidelines for properties with oil tanks and resale restrictions.</data>
  <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-137c762b3ac588b243786790757dd239&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d864e2754e1d5a70d89033bc8babcdcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7e863cbccfa45dfb855f96b39c4e7be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-995f33933031b2ea33803f61f1ece1b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddb3009468a2e7eaa9aab8998eae8ca6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12708616563afb36a31ad3cf8523241b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-756818f22cafd11009f520745a0306df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ae330f51f478e78f1b91957f17dcdec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-241759937af28f9856986aac2ee15cb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6261b628a88157f5bd4a959ee8fdb8f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3455e52007c02e364a735d4c4a7efa70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b8e57f220eeefd0215ac958c381bc47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4d4f9535ffe4c256b83a381ed8c6791&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e26a3be3838ff40fb61edfe66e0268a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c0b7f4552e556318a58e96c9230e51e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d10b21d56993c3c6bc0aa80dd4168911&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d77c56c7ef7f25742c687f6ad137c8f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3eb9a9047b04f55e775ab1675823f162&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e28f33ddf3b335e19135327f9afb2b07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec242ee203576a6a4b76efbe5458e782&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-388d67b329a7c9987f1aa1ce87dad2a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d1c3e36c841bdc1a7ede120ae160e58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f91be92d53c1aed3b7126461f33e415&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a0d9684317720eb42eaa206a9f3cc5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79943296a1fa68394820a29e269db689&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f359b1edc6f123eca67b08265c9b89e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00440a55cc64896de959c80a8727fbfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73d6f2ebab21a8901f9725aa2d65678d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd684789b748cb20186f7859db539838&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-458b7b4c2fb6c14a263231eb6f3f6192&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7705559d232d0e6b4978eff8d1e8b137&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9480c322229448ccd0b724ce848cac14</data>
