  <data key="d5">"High LTV Refinance Mortgages from Freddie Mac are currently suspended by GSEs, indicating a regulatory constraint."&lt;SEP&gt;"High LTV refinance mortgages are associated with Freddie Mac guidelines but are currently suspended by GSEs, showing a connection to regulatory status."</data>
