<edge source="&quot;AGENT&quot;" target="&quot;TITLE INSURANCE COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The agent must not be employed by the title insurance company if acting as POA, indicating a need for independence in transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5e857c204b7048098a278905f60d5302</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGENT&quot;" target="&quot;ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The agent may be responsible for verifying the borrower's assets in the loan transaction, indicating a direct relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5e857c204b7048098a278905f60d5302</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGENT&quot;" target="&quot;FIDUCIARY INTEREST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An Agent is required to have a fiduciary interest under Freddie Mac's guidelines when acting on behalf of another person."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1cb7303f4ec7884e602c27628160dc28</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRID&quot;" target="&quot;FREDDIE MAC&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Freddie Mac loans must adhere to TRID rules for non-owner-occupied properties, linking these regulatory requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d10b21d56993c3c6bc0aa80dd4168911</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRID&quot;" target="&quot;ATTORNEY OPINIONS OF TITLE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"TRID compliance is influenced by the acceptance of attorney opinions of title, which Freddie Mac specifies as unacceptable."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d10b21d56993c3c6bc0aa80dd4168911</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRID&quot;" target="&quot;NON-OWNER-OCCUPIED LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Non-owner-occupied loans must adhere to TRID rules, indicating a regulatory relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-46cceddf672b67421d8f87a3665f1ddf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TITLE COMMITMENT&quot;" target="&quot;FREDDIE MAC&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Freddie Mac requires that attorney opinions of title are not acceptable, which connects to the necessity of a title commitment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d10b21d56993c3c6bc0aa80dd4168911</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TITLE COMMITMENT&quot;" target="&quot;TITLE INSURER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The title insurer is required to provide a gap letter if the title commitment exceeds the allowed timeframe, illustrating their connection."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title commitment documents are prepared by the title insurer and are necessary for verifying property ownership during the loan process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d10b21d56993c3c6bc0aa80dd4168911&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d864e2754e1d5a70d89033bc8babcdcc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TITLE COMMITMENT&quot;" target="&quot;ATTORNEY OPINION LETTER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Attorney opinion letters are excluded under the title commitment requirements from Freddie Mac, connecting their relevance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d10b21d56993c3c6bc0aa80dd4168911</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TITLE COMMITMENT&quot;" target="&quot;GAP LETTER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A gap letter is necessary if the title commitment exceeds the timeframe, showing the relationship to commitment requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"If a title commitment exceeds 120 days, a gap letter must be provided to extend the commitment period."&lt;SEP&gt;"The issuing of a gap letter is contingent upon the title commitment exceeding allowed time frames, indicating a procedural relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-46cceddf672b67421d8f87a3665f1ddf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d10b21d56993c3c6bc0aa80dd4168911&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d864e2754e1d5a70d89033bc8babcdcc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TITLE COMMITMENT&quot;" target="&quot;EFFECTIVE DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Title commitments must have an effective date of 90 days, linking them to the title insurer's responsibilities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d10b21d56993c3c6bc0aa80dd4168911</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TITLE COMMITMENT&quot;" target="&quot;LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Lenders must provide updated title commitments to avoid delays or issues in the loan process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-46cceddf672b67421d8f87a3665f1ddf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TITLE COMMITMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PROPERTY TAX BILL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The title commitment contains essential information that is relevant for determining the property tax bill."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-35b11a1ced8de5c90f65c0b1344222c2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TITLE COMMITMENT&quot;" target="&quot;DOCUMENTATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The title commitment serves as a crucial piece of documentation required for assessing property value and tax calculations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-35b11a1ced8de5c90f65c0b1344222c2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TITLE COMMITMENT&quot;" target="&quot;CLOSING DISCLOSURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A title commitment must be referenced within the closing disclosure, ensuring clarity of ownership before closing the transaction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-05020d8707d581b6c2d0c1b184d17f01</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TITLE COMMITMENT&quot;" target="&quot;MARKET DOCUMENTATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Market documentation may be required to verify property details necessary for the title commitment during refinancing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-05020d8707d581b6c2d0c1b184d17f01</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TITLE COMMITMENT&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL DESCRIPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The legal description within the title commitment must align with property appraisal and compliance for zoning requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f562ac717c24b9fccfb1aab0164fb157</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TITLE COMMITMENT&quot;" target="&quot;LAND RECORDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Land Records must reflect any claims made in the Title Commitment, particularly regarding the solar panels and potential liens."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title Commitment must include any references to the solar panels as collateral, impacting the records in the land records."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6434821b2faf91ece4b375276017b775</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TITLE COMMITMENT&quot;" target="&quot;UCC-1 FINANCING STATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The UCC-1 Financing Statement must be included in the Title Commitment to confirm any claim on the solar panels."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6434821b2faf91ece4b375276017b775</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NON-PERMANENT RESIDENT ALIENS&quot;" target="&quot;FREDDIE MAC&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Freddie Mac requires lenders to ensure non-U.S. citizen borrowers are legally present in the United States, linking them to non-permanent resident aliens."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d10b21d56993c3c6bc0aa80dd4168911</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
