  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Escrow waivers in Flagstar policy are contingent upon the loan-to-value (LTV) ratio being at or below a certain threshold."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan-to-value (LTV) ratios determine eligibility for escrow waivers, as both Freddie Mac and Fannie Mae require LTV considerations."</data>
