  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EFFECTIVE DATE&quot;" target="&quot;CONVENTIONAL UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The effective date is crucial for the appraisal process, being specified in the Conventional Underwriting Guidelines as a component for assessment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1d83092219c6a0be0948a52ad38b945a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EFFECTIVE DATE&quot;" target="&quot;TITLE COMMITMENT EFFECTIVE DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The effective date is a key aspect of title commitments, which regulates their duration and validity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1cb7303f4ec7884e602c27628160dc28</data>
