  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The personal property requirement impacts the calculation of the LTV ratio based on total aggregate value."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c315a6b793aa073b8f6cb2ffb42e4f97</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LTV&quot;" target="&quot;CLTV&quot;">
  <data key="d4">32.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"LTV and CLTV are both ratios used to assess the risk associated with mortgages, impacting underwriting decisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"LTV and CLTV are critical metrics used in mortgage underwriting that determine the risk assessment based on the amount borrowed relative to property value."&lt;SEP&gt;"LTV and CLTV are integral metrics in determining eligibility for private mortgage insurance as per underwriting guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"LTV and CLTV are related financial metrics used to evaluate mortgage eligibility and risk."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1da51e05e6600babe4a36494acdf7928&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c315a6b793aa073b8f6cb2ffb42e4f97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-164ff18d322608d7342cc1d0619c9f0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-995f33933031b2ea33803f61f1ece1b7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LTV&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER’S OWN FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"LTV is impacted by the amount of the borrower’s own funds used in the down payment, which influences loan eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-164ff18d322608d7342cc1d0619c9f0f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LTV&quot;" target="&quot;COMPREHENSIVE RISK ASSESSMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Comprehensive risk assessment involves evaluating LTV among other financial ratios for mortgage approval."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-995f33933031b2ea33803f61f1ece1b7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LTV&quot;" target="&quot;HCLTV&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"LTV and HCLTV are related metrics that help assess the risk of mortgage lending and insurance requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-995f33933031b2ea33803f61f1ece1b7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LTV&quot;" target="&quot;DOWN PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"LTV ratios are critical in determining the appropriate down payment required for a mortgage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1da51e05e6600babe4a36494acdf7928</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
