<edge source="&quot;FLAGSTAR&quot;" target="&quot;FREDDIE MAC&quot;">
  <data key="d4">29.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Flagstar adheres to Freddie Mac's Appraiser Independence Requirements in their appraisal acceptance policies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar adheres to policies set forth by Freddie Mac regarding escrow waivers and loan qualifications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar has specific guidelines that are influenced by Freddie Mac's third-party asset reports."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar must comply with Freddie Mac's appraisal requirements and other guidelines when processing loans."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-46cceddf672b67421d8f87a3665f1ddf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4de71275bc933c2c228984f601d0e0a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53373dd554a175653540f360348f32eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d2d43086c2d67020db933397546a228</data>
