<edge source="&quot;FLAGSTAR&quot;" target="&quot;FANNIE MAE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">35.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Fannie Mae's guidelines influence the policies and operations of Flagstar in financing real estate transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar lenders must adhere to Fannie Mae's underwriting guidelines when conducting transactions using appraisal waivers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar requires compliance with Fannie Mae's Appraiser Independence Requirements when accepting appraisals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar's guidelines may differ from Fannie Mae's, particularly regarding agents acting as attorneys in fact for borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Similar to Freddie Mac, Flagstar follows specific guidelines laid out by Fannie Mae for non-owner-occupied loans."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-53373dd554a175653540f360348f32eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d2d43086c2d67020db933397546a228&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e857c204b7048098a278905f60d5302&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46cceddf672b67421d8f87a3665f1ddf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4de71275bc933c2c228984f601d0e0a1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FLAGSTAR&quot;" target="&quot;HELOC&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Flagstar permits the use of a HELOC under its concurrent secondary financing plans, indicating a relationship in financial products."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-53373dd554a175653540f360348f32eb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FLAGSTAR&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FLAGSTAR purchases mortgages made to natural persons, which include borrowers who meet specific eligibility criteria."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1a05e768a9b64dd897dab3f97a6c234a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FLAGSTAR&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FLAGSTAR is involved in the purchase of mortgages, making it relevant to the mortgage process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1a05e768a9b64dd897dab3f97a6c234a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FLAGSTAR&quot;" target="&quot;U.S. CITIZENS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Flagstar requires that all borrowers be U.S. Citizens or lawful residents, indicating a direct connection to their eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c3fe3f1cf3ad46c315af5250198974ab</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FLAGSTAR&quot;" target="&quot;OWNER-OCCUPIED TRANSACTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
