  <data key="d4">23.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower must be associated with a property as part of the loan qualification process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower must purchase the property, which is a foundational aspect of any mortgage agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The type of property impacts the borrower's eligibility and loan terms for obtaining a mortgage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-46cceddf672b67421d8f87a3665f1ddf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e912b60195be8ca87a44127ef55d282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1da51e05e6600babe4a36494acdf7928</data>
