  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Closing costs are incurred during the purchase or refinance of the property, affecting the mortgage amounts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f76dd878d76d1e8bdf5fb1cac46447ae</data>
