  <data key="d4">24.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Rental income from the property is a key factor in qualifying for loans based on Freddie Mac's guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"The relationship between rental income and property is crucial as it impacts loan qualifications and income assessments for financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The type of property directly influences the amount of rental income that can be derived from it."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6b454650a6e8dde5a93325db30813c30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48dc06181f6c67399f82ff0110257532</data>
