  <data key="d4">27.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Loan Application requires specific Documentation to support the Borrower's claims regarding their financial status and income."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan applications require specific documentation for processing, including VOD, VVOE, and WVOE."&lt;SEP&gt;"Proper documentation is essential for completing the loan application as it verifies the borrower's financial status and the details of the subject property."</data>
