  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Loan applications must adhere to underwriting guidelines that specify acceptable forms of documentation, including EAD cards."&lt;SEP&gt;"Underwriting guidelines dictate the procedures and criteria applied to loan applications before approval."</data>
