<edge source="&quot;LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">53.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower and Lender have a financial relationship where the lender provides funds for the purchase or lease of Solar Panels."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower authorizes the lender to obtain verification of their deposit accounts, linking their interactions directly."&lt;SEP&gt;"The lender provides financing solutions to the borrower for property transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The lender provides financing to the borrower, establishing a fundamental transactional relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The lender provides financing to the borrower, facilitating the mortgage process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The lender provides the loan to the borrower under conditions established in the closing disclosure and other documentation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-05495faf7d0cd92781a907bc384d2f21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-144555be48c11828e99c3a7c623170fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e28f33ddf3b335e19135327f9afb2b07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66bee43127ef8c394af00a30febd1833&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05020d8707d581b6c2d0c1b184d17f01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2c659b65edef4a5e599f9445602b752</data>
