  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Large deposits in a financial portfolio account necessitate scrutiny and verification during the loan qualification process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-53373dd554a175653540f360348f32eb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
