  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"PROPERTY SELLER and PROPERTY PURCHASER interact in a transaction where costs and contributions may be allocated to closing costs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d9640138f8accaa3b0962e60c94ddc9b</data>
