</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LARGE DEPOSIT&quot;" target="&quot;CLOSING COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Large deposits may be scrutinized for their role in covering closing costs or down payments, affecting underwriting decisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-164ff18d322608d7342cc1d0619c9f0f</data>
