</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWERS&quot;" target="&quot;FREDDIE MAC&quot;">
  <data key="d4">24.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Freddie Mac mandates tax returns from borrowers to ensure they meet the necessary income stability for loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac sets guidelines that affect the obligations and options available to borrowers regarding their financing options."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac's guidelines specifically focus on borrower eligibility and their roles in mixed-use property operations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d1ab9735c2b386c1cf372b9ba4a34fe4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3e0ec6e1adaeb678f542089515e77ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23ec06f9f4a15f1cb40e52e628766be9</data>
