<edge source="&quot;DOCUMENTATION REQUIREMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">36.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"Documentation Requirements outline the necessary documents that borrowers must provide to confirm their eligibility for loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documentation requirements are essential for the Borrower to validate their financial status during the loan process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documentation requirements, such as tax returns, are essential for Borrowers to qualify for loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must provide various documentation requirements to qualify for the mortgage."</data>
