  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Stocks can be part of the total net assets that contribute to a borrower's financial profile during loan assessments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
