  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"UCC Filing may determine whether Solar Panels are treated as part of the Real Property, linking legal and property aspects."&lt;SEP&gt;"UCC filings indicate the ownership and financing status of solar panels in relation to real property."</data>
