  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The debt-to-income ratio is an essential factor considered during the loan analysis process for mortgage qualification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b58c2a47b041d2502022392c611f405c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEBT-TO-INCOME RATIO&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">25.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A borrower's financial health is assessed using the debt-to-income ratio, which compares monthly debt obligations to income."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower's debt-to-income ratio is affected by their remaining payments on the original loan and is a key factor in the loan approval process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower's income, including potential mortgage credit certificate income, is essential for calculating their debt-to-income ratio."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b58c2a47b041d2502022392c611f405c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fb1c993d98cbaba5a6755fc57b9ff69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e28f33ddf3b335e19135327f9afb2b07</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEBT-TO-INCOME RATIO&quot;" target="&quot;OPEN 30-DAY CHARGE ACCOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The balance of an open 30-day charge account may impact the debt-to-income ratio used in mortgage qualification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b58c2a47b041d2502022392c611f405c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEBT-TO-INCOME RATIO&quot;" target="&quot;RECURRING MONTHLY DEBT OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower's recurring monthly debt obligations are directly considered when calculating their debt-to-income ratio."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-61ba5485d92daa30adf4ee02bfab7d8a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEBT-TO-INCOME RATIO&quot;" target="&quot;OPEN 30-DAY ACCOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An open 30-day account affects the calculation of the borrower's debt-to-income ratio, influencing financial assessments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-61ba5485d92daa30adf4ee02bfab7d8a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEBT-TO-INCOME RATIO&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN APPROVAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The debt-to-income ratio is a critical factor that lenders assess for loan approval decisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-05020d8707d581b6c2d0c1b184d17f01</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
