  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Similar to second homes, employer assistance funds cannot be applied to investment properties, showing a direct restriction relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d9e3a88db0855762e0cc4e584fc3462d</data>
