</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LONG-TERM DISABILITY&quot;" target="&quot;FREDDIE MAC&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Freddie Mac has specific guidelines for how long-term disability is treated in relation to mortgage applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1955da1ebc911d30ff778d5b9e719028</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LONG-TERM DISABILITY&quot;" target="&quot;SHORT-TERM DISABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Short-term disability payments are converted to long-term disability payments, influencing income calculations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1955da1ebc911d30ff778d5b9e719028</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LONG-TERM DISABILITY&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT-RELATED ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employment-related assets may complement the income from long-term disability benefits in loan qualification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1955da1ebc911d30ff778d5b9e719028</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SMALL BUSINESS ADMINISTRATION&quot;" target="&quot;COVID-19&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SMALL BUSINESS ADMINISTRATION loans and grants are considered in the context of COVID-19 economic support initiatives."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d9640138f8accaa3b0962e60c94ddc9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SMALL BUSINESS ADMINISTRATION&quot;" target="&quot;FANNIE MAE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Small Business Administration loans must be included in the calculation of the CLTV and HCLTV ratios for Fannie Mae."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-55b73f39faaa03ed0e70ba760ab8eca4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SMALL BUSINESS ADMINISTRATION&quot;" target="&quot;FREDDIE MAC&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Freddie Mac requires that the SBA loans be included in the TLTV ratio and that the borrower qualifies with the payment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-55b73f39faaa03ed0e70ba760ab8eca4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COVID-19&quot;" target="&quot;FORBEARANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"COVID-19 has caused BORROWERS to opt for FORBEARANCE as a temporary relief from mortgage payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-105c313a28b49198d2d2b78db6e7529b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMBINED LOAN-TO-VALUE RATIO&quot;" target="&quot;UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES dictate the calculation involving the COMBINED LOAN-TO-VALUE RATIO for assessing loan eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d9640138f8accaa3b0962e60c94ddc9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINANCING CONCESSIONS&quot;" target="&quot;SALES CONCESSIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FINANCING CONCESSIONS refer to contributions that benefit borrowers, while SALES CONCESSIONS involve the adjustment of sales prices for loan calculations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d9640138f8accaa3b0962e60c94ddc9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINANCING CONCESSIONS&quot;" target="&quot;FREDDIE MAC&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Freddie Mac allows for certain financing concessions when selling properties, which benefit borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-144555be48c11828e99c3a7c623170fa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINANCING CONCESSIONS&quot;" target="&quot;INTEREST RATE BUYDOWN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Interest rate buydown is a type of financing concession that helps reduce a borrower's mortgage payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-144555be48c11828e99c3a7c623170fa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINANCING CONCESSIONS&quot;" target="&quot;CLOSING COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Financing concessions can be used to offset closing costs incurred by the borrower during a real estate transaction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-144555be48c11828e99c3a7c623170fa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINANCING CONCESSIONS&quot;" target="&quot;FINANCING INFORMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Financing concessions are a part of financing information relevant to transactions, linking the two entities closely."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f443d70c1b97ab92c6f9f441ec9ced99</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SALES CONCESSIONS&quot;" target="&quot;SALES PRICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sales concessions must be deducted from the sales price to calculate LTV and CLTV ratios, linking them closely."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-05495faf7d0cd92781a907bc384d2f21</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SALES CONCESSIONS&quot;" target="&quot;UPGRADES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sales concessions and upgrades are discussed in the appraisal to assess their impact on the subject property's value."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-42fe7768b333d42fc15f00fc4e0ba0d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SALES CONCESSIONS&quot;" target="&quot;MARKETABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sales concessions can directly affect the marketability of the subject property during an appraisal."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-42fe7768b333d42fc15f00fc4e0ba0d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PREPAID FEES&quot;" target="&quot;CLOSING COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"PREPAID FEES often form part of the CLOSING COSTS that are assessed in property transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d9640138f8accaa3b0962e60c94ddc9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTERESTED PARTY CONTRIBUTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRIBUTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"CONTRIBUTIONS are linked to INTERESTED PARTY CONTRIBUTIONS, as they refer to funding support for closing costs in property transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"INTERESTED PARTY CONTRIBUTIONS refer specifically to financial assistance provided to the borrower, linking them to general CONTRIBUTIONS in transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d9640138f8accaa3b0962e60c94ddc9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTERESTED PARTY CONTRIBUTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;MAXIMUM CONTRIBUTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"LIMITATIONS under MAXIMUM CONTRIBUTIONS dictate the allowable amounts for INTERESTED PARTY CONTRIBUTIONS to close transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d9640138f8accaa3b0962e60c94ddc9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSONAL UNSECURED LOANS&quot;" target="&quot;DOWN PAYMENT ASSISTANCE PROGRAMS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"PERSONAL UNSECURED LOANS are not an acceptable source of funds for down payment assistance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d9640138f8accaa3b0962e60c94ddc9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSONAL UNSECURED LOANS&quot;" target="&quot;SIGNATURE LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SIGNATURE LOANS are categorized under PERSONAL UNSECURED LOANS, which are not typically accepted for down payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d9640138f8accaa3b0962e60c94ddc9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSONAL UNSECURED LOANS&quot;" target="&quot;LINES OF CREDIT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"LINES OF CREDIT, along with PERSONAL UNSECURED LOANS, are not considered acceptable for down payments or reserves in property transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d9640138f8accaa3b0962e60c94ddc9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSONAL UNSECURED LOANS&quot;" target="&quot;OVERDRAFT PROTECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"OVERDRAFT PROTECTION is another type of PERSONAL UNSECURED LOAN that cannot be used as an accepted source of funds for closing costs or down payment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d9640138f8accaa3b0962e60c94ddc9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSONAL UNSECURED LOANS&quot;" target="&quot;INELIGIBLE ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Personal unsecured loans are classified as ineligible assets that cannot be used for mortgage qualification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a9a7e59e34af57946c09cfa07672f92</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOWN PAYMENT ASSISTANCE PROGRAMS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"Down Payment Assistance Programs offer financial aid to help borrowers cover their down payment, enhancing their ability to purchase homes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Down payment assistance programs aid borrowers in covering the necessary down payment for property purchases."</data>
  <data key="d6">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8eefd188642258e1fb627891c7c2dbb6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MONTHLY PAYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER’S DTI RATIO&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Monthly payments on subordinate liens must be included in the borrower's debt-to-income ratio calculation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-55b73f39faaa03ed0e70ba760ab8eca4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRIBUTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;MAXIMUM CONTRIBUTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"MAXIMUM CONTRIBUTIONS sets limits on how much can be contributed towards closing costs and prepaid expenses in a transaction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d9640138f8accaa3b0962e60c94ddc9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRIBUTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"Contributions from various parties can significantly aid borrowers in meeting their financial obligations required for mortgage qualification."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MAXIMUM CONTRIBUTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"Maximum Contributions stipulate the limits on the amount a borrower may receive from interested parties impacting their loan application´s eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOCUMENTED PROCEEDS&quot;" target="&quot;BUSINESS STABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"DOCUMENTED PROCEEDS from loans may affect assessments of BUSINESS STABILITY when evaluating financial support during transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d9640138f8accaa3b0962e60c94ddc9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACQUISITION FEES&quot;" target="&quot;CLOSING COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ACQUISITION FEES may be part of the overall CLOSING COSTS involved in real estate transactions, affecting what buyers must pay."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d9640138f8accaa3b0962e60c94ddc9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOMEPATH&quot;" target="&quot;FANNIE MAE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Fannie Mae facilitates the HomePath program, which provides special credit and financing options for eligible borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-144555be48c11828e99c3a7c623170fa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOMEPATH&quot;" target="&quot;FREDDIE MAC&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Freddie Mac lists HomePath as a property seller program, which allows for specific benefits for home buyers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-144555be48c11828e99c3a7c623170fa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REAL ESTATE TAX CREDITS&quot;" target="&quot;PRO-RATED TAX CREDIT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Pro-rated tax credits are a specific form of real estate tax credit applicable in certain circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-144555be48c11828e99c3a7c623170fa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT ABATEMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Payment abatements are incentives offered to the borrower to assist with monthly mortgage payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-144555be48c11828e99c3a7c623170fa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPRAISAL COSTS&quot;" target="&quot;CLOSING COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Appraisal costs are part of the overall closing costs incurred during a mortgage transaction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-144555be48c11828e99c3a7c623170fa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPRAISAL COSTS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Appraisal costs are expenses incurred by the borrower as part of the mortgage process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-144555be48c11828e99c3a7c623170fa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ESCROW ACCRUALS&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Escrow accruals are often required by lenders as part of the mortgage agreement to cover future housing costs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-144555be48c11828e99c3a7c623170fa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT ABATEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Payment abatement is an incentive provided to the borrower, indicating a direct financial relationship between them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-05495faf7d0cd92781a907bc384d2f21</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSONAL PROPERTY&quot;" target="&quot;SALES PRICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Personal property that is permanently affixed is considered part of the sales price, directly relating these two entities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-05495faf7d0cd92781a907bc384d2f21</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSONAL PROPERTY&quot;" target="&quot;REALTOR COMMISSION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Realtor commissions can sometimes involve personal property items in negotiations or transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-05495faf7d0cd92781a907bc384d2f21</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSONAL PROPERTY&quot;" target="&quot;LEASE AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The classification of Solar Panels as Personal Property or Fixture to Real Estate can depend on the terms of the Lease Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e2c659b65edef4a5e599f9445602b752</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REALTOR COMMISSION&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower can use realtor commission toward funds to close, establishing a financial relationship between them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-05495faf7d0cd92781a907bc384d2f21</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNDISCLOSED SELLER CONTRIBUTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Undisclosed seller contributions often cover expenses on behalf of the borrower, indicating a relationship in financing circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-05495faf7d0cd92781a907bc384d2f21</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNDISCLOSED SELLER CONTRIBUTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;SELLER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Undisclosed seller contributions often occur in transactions involving the seller and the borrower, indicating a financial relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-05495faf7d0cd92781a907bc384d2f21</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNDISCLOSED SELLER CONTRIBUTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;SALES PRICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The sales price can be affected by undisclosed seller contributions, which may impact the overall financing arrangement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-05495faf7d0cd92781a907bc384d2f21</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ESCROW&quot;" target="&quot;SALES PRICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Escrow often involves transactions that pertain to the sales price, as funds are held during the sale process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-05495faf7d0cd92781a907bc384d2f21</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ESCROW&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower is involved in the escrow process, usually for managing funds related to their purchase."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-05495faf7d0cd92781a907bc384d2f21</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ESCROW&quot;" target="&quot;DOCUMENTARY REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Escrow instructions are part of the documentary requirements needed to close a real estate transaction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-32546641e2f2fec0a52f658ed70fc338</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ESCROW&quot;" target="&quot;ADEQUATE FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Adequate funds must be confirmed in escrow to close the transaction successfully."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-32546641e2f2fec0a52f658ed70fc338</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ESCROW&quot;" target="&quot;FLAGSTAR BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Flagstar Bank holds all repair escrows, indicating a significant operational relationship in managing escrow accounts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-00440a55cc64896de959c80a8727fbfc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ESCROW&quot;" target="&quot;REPAIRS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Repairs must be completed and confirmed before the disbursement of escrow funds, establishing a direct connection between escrow and repairs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-00440a55cc64896de959c80a8727fbfc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ESCROW&quot;" target="&quot;UNDERWRITING MANAGER APPROVAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"All repair escrows require the approval of the underwriting manager, linking the underwriting process directly with escrow management."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-00440a55cc64896de959c80a8727fbfc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ESCROW&quot;" target="&quot;CLOSING COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Closing costs are typically tied to escrow processes, as they are often disbursed through escrow during the closing of a transaction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-00440a55cc64896de959c80a8727fbfc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ESCROW&quot;" target="&quot;ESCROW HOLDBACK AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The escrow holdback agreement outlines specific conditions under which funds are held in escrow, defining the contractual relationship between the two entities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-00440a55cc64896de959c80a8727fbfc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SALES PRICE&quot;" target="&quot;CLTV&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"CLTV is calculated in relation to the sales price, establishing a clear relationship between them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-05495faf7d0cd92781a907bc384d2f21</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SALES PRICE&quot;" target="&quot;NET PROCEEDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The sales price is required to be assessed against all costs and liens to calculate the estimated net proceeds."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d30aff8ce4b53c163b59f9369ea58842</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SALES PRICE&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE INSURANCE COVERAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The sales price is employed in determining if mortgage insurance is needed for co-op purchase transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-464152a069c6a4d42a031274bf69430a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SALES PRICE&quot;" target="&quot;LTV RATIO&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The calculation of the LTV ratio is based on the lower of the sales price or appraised value."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6261b628a88157f5bd4a959ee8fdb8f8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SALES PRICE&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The sales price is a critical factor in determining the structure of the mortgage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6261b628a88157f5bd4a959ee8fdb8f8</data>
