</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GIFT FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;CLOSING STATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The closing statement must reflect accurately the use of gift funds in the transaction, indicating a financial tracking relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GIFT FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;POOLED FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Gift funds can be pooled with the borrower's funds for down payment requirements, indicating a financial collaboration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GIFT FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;BANK STATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A bank statement is used to show the presence of gift funds in the donor's account, establishing financial proof for the transaction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GIFT FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;MINIMUM CONTRIBUTION REQUIREMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Gift funds can be utilized by the borrower to fulfill the minimum contribution requirements for a mortgage, under specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-164ff18d322608d7342cc1d0619c9f0f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GIFT FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;EXCEPTIONS TO BORROWER MINIMUM CONTRIBUTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Exceptions allow for the use of gift funds to satisfy some or all of the minimum contribution requirement, which assists borrowers in financial management."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-164ff18d322608d7342cc1d0619c9f0f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GIFT FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;CLOSING COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Gift funds can also be used to cover closing costs in certain situations, assisting borrowers in managing overall expenses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-164ff18d322608d7342cc1d0619c9f0f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GIFT FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;MINIMUM BORROWER CONTRIBUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Minimum BORROWER CONTRIBUTION rules determine when GIFT FUNDS can be utilized for the loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3cd8475962bfe1c2428c1ea6691488c9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GIFT FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;RESERVES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Usage of GIFT FUNDS may impact the RESERVES requirements for the borrower's overall financing strategy."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3cd8475962bfe1c2428c1ea6691488c9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MINIMUM BORROWER CONTRIBUTION&quot;" target="&quot;CLOSING COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"CLOSING COSTS can be influenced by the MINIMUM BORROWER CONTRIBUTION requirements for specific property types."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3cd8475962bfe1c2428c1ea6691488c9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL RESIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;RATE-AND-TERM REFINANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Rate-and-term refinances are permitted for the purchase of a principal residence, indicating a direct relationship regarding housing finance options."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd0f34ee8edcf779e6ff94578f8ab9c2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL RESIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;SIGNIFICANT COMMUTING DISTANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The assessment of a principal residence may involve analyzing significant commuting distances, reflecting the practical implications of residential addressing on loan applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ce8ebe270f2feee194ded8e3d4becdb2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL RESIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPYING THE PROPERTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"To qualify as a principal residence, the borrower must state the intention to occupy the property."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0ff713c7eebcf293485e860ba8cc6a1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL RESIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower's intention to occupy a property as a principal residence is critical in establishing mortgage eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0ff713c7eebcf293485e860ba8cc6a1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL RESIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;CURRENT HOUSING EXPENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The current housing expense can relate to owning a principal residence for qualifying income purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-48dc06181f6c67399f82ff0110257532</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL RESIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;ADU&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An ADU can serve as a rental unit on the borrower's principal residence, affecting both rental income calculations and guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7a01c4d224477788cf5c6bfd6ccc84e2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL RESIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Mortgages may have specific stipulations regarding principal residences versus investment properties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1da51e05e6600babe4a36494acdf7928</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL RESIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;MIXED-USE PROPERTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Mixed-use properties must be occupied by borrowers as their principal residence to be eligible for financing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c3e0ec6e1adaeb678f542089515e77ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL RESIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;ACCESSORY UNIT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An acceptable accessory unit is permitted on the parcel that contains the primary residence according to Freddie Mac's guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c3e0ec6e1adaeb678f542089515e77ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VOD&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"Verification of Deposit (VOD) is essential in confirming a borrower's financial activity, thereby supporting their loan eligibility assessment."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GIFT LETTER&quot;" target="&quot;DONOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The donor is required to provide a gift letter to confirm the nature of the funds being provided to the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The donor must provide a gift letter that specifies the details of the gift to the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d1b456ca1fe500021a9d2ca86dedfd1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8eefd188642258e1fb627891c7c2dbb6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GIFT LETTER&quot;" target="&quot;TRUSTEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The trustee must sign the gift letter when the gift comes from an estate or trust."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d1b456ca1fe500021a9d2ca86dedfd1a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GIFT LETTER&quot;" target="&quot;UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The gift letter must comply with specific underwriting guidelines to validate the gift funds."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d1b456ca1fe500021a9d2ca86dedfd1a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GIFT LETTER&quot;" target="&quot;MARRIAGE LICENSE/CERTIFICATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A gift letter must include marriage documentation if the gift originates from a spouse, indicating a personal and financial connection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GIFT OF EQUITY&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower is the recipient of the gift of equity that is transferred as a credit in their transaction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d1b456ca1fe500021a9d2ca86dedfd1a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GIFT OF EQUITY&quot;" target="&quot;RECIPIENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The recipient is the beneficiary of the gift of equity provided in the transaction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d1b456ca1fe500021a9d2ca86dedfd1a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GIFT OF EQUITY&quot;" target="&quot;NONPROFIT ORGANIZATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Nonprofit organizations can provide a gift of equity as acceptable donors for qualifying transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d1b456ca1fe500021a9d2ca86dedfd1a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GIFT OF EQUITY&quot;" target="&quot;INELIGIBLE OR CAUTION AUS RESPONSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A gift of equity could lead to an ineligible AUS response if not properly documented, establishing a relationship between financial practices and appraisal outcomes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-91cf1d5ee6d1d8b224c54c5417b6eaee</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GIFT OF EQUITY&quot;" target="&quot;NON-ARM'S LENGTH TRANSACTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A gift of equity may occur in non-arm's length transactions, establishing a relationship in financial practices."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-91cf1d5ee6d1d8b224c54c5417b6eaee</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GIFT OF EQUITY&quot;" target="&quot;SALES CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Gifts of equity can be included in sales contracts, indicating a relationship in the context of property transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4de71275bc933c2c228984f601d0e0a1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMUNITY SECONDS PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;MUNICIPALITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Municipalities are included as acceptable entities under the Community Seconds Program which helps with assistance programs for borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d1b456ca1fe500021a9d2ca86dedfd1a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMUNITY SECONDS PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Community Seconds Program provides assistance to the borrower related to down payment and closing costs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d1b456ca1fe500021a9d2ca86dedfd1a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ESTATE OR TRUST&quot;" target="&quot;TRUSTEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The trustee manages the estate or trust that can be a donor for the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d1b456ca1fe500021a9d2ca86dedfd1a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DONOR&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">25.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The donor provides a gift of equity to the borrower, which helps the borrower with closing costs."&lt;SEP&gt;"The donor provides financial support to the borrower, facilitating the purchase of a property through gifts."&lt;SEP&gt;"The donor's address must be the same as the borrower's, indicating a shared residency and relationship between them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1b456ca1fe500021a9d2ca86dedfd1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8eefd188642258e1fb627891c7c2dbb6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DONOR&quot;" target="&quot;NONPROFIT ORGANIZATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Nonprofit organizations can act as acceptable donors under specific guidelines for gift funds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nonprofit organizations can be involved in facilitating donations to support the borrower’s purchase of a property."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d1b456ca1fe500021a9d2ca86dedfd1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8eefd188642258e1fb627891c7c2dbb6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DONOR&quot;" target="&quot;CREDIT UNIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Credit unions can be eligible donors under the guidelines for transferring gift funds to the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d1b456ca1fe500021a9d2ca86dedfd1a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DONOR&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC AGENCIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public agencies are considered acceptable donors for gift funds to assist the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d1b456ca1fe500021a9d2ca86dedfd1a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DONOR&quot;" target="&quot;DONOR'S FINANCIAL INSTITUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The donor's financial institution manages the funds provided to support the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8eefd188642258e1fb627891c7c2dbb6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DONOR&quot;" target="&quot;CHURCHES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Churches may act as acceptable entities from which the donor can provide funds for the borrower’s down payment assistance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8eefd188642258e1fb627891c7c2dbb6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DONOR&quot;" target="&quot;MUNICIPALITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Municipalities can provide funding programs that serve as sources of donations from the donor to the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8eefd188642258e1fb627891c7c2dbb6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DONOR&quot;" target="&quot;COPY OF CANCELED GIFT CHECK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Documentation of a canceled gift check provides proof of financial support from the donor to the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DONOR&quot;" target="&quot;CERTIFICATION FROM DONOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A certification from the donor is required to verify their relationship and residency with the borrower, indicating their supporting role."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ZELLE&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Zelle can be used for transferring gift funds from the donor to the borrower's account in the transaction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d1b456ca1fe500021a9d2ca86dedfd1a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRUSTEE&quot;" target="&quot;LIVING REVOCABLE TRUST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The trustee manages the assets of the living revocable trust, making their roles inherently linked in trust management."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b9fd7a30043bf2ff61e50fbd6141d212</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MUNICIPALITIES&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSIDY PROVIDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Municipalities can serve as eligible subsidy providers, administering local subsidy programs for borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8cfec8ddeaba989b347c8cc9daa583b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NONPROFIT ORGANIZATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSIDY PROVIDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Nonprofit organizations are recognized as eligible subsidy providers that can apply resale restrictions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8cfec8ddeaba989b347c8cc9daa583b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC AGENCIES&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public agencies can provide assistance to borrowers under various down payment assistance programs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d1b456ca1fe500021a9d2ca86dedfd1a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOCUMENT GUIDELINES&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower must adhere to document guidelines regarding the transfer and acceptance of gift funds."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d1b456ca1fe500021a9d2ca86dedfd1a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GIFT/GRANT PROGRAMS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Gift/grant programs provide additional financial assistance to borrowers for down payments and closing costs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8eefd188642258e1fb627891c7c2dbb6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUILDER&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower is required to pay off interim construction financing, which often involves financial dealings with the builder."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e252311920cec13b843fb034a4a69e94</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EARNEST MONEY DEPOSIT&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"Earnest Money Deposit is a sum that a borrower must provide to demonstrate commitment to a purchase, impacting the overall loan approval process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower is responsible for making an earnest money deposit during the property transaction."</data>
  <data key="d6">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8eefd188642258e1fb627891c7c2dbb6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EARNEST MONEY DEPOSIT&quot;" target="&quot;GIFT OF FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Gift of funds can be used as an earnest money deposit in transactions to provide assurance to sellers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8eefd188642258e1fb627891c7c2dbb6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRANSFER OF FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;GIFT OF FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The transfer of funds is a process through which the gift of funds is provided to the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8eefd188642258e1fb627891c7c2dbb6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRANSFER OF FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;COPY OF DONOR'S CHECK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A copy of the donor's check serves as documentation for the transfer of funds to the borrower during the transaction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8eefd188642258e1fb627891c7c2dbb6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRANSFER OF FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;WIRING TRANSFER CONFIRMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Wire transfer confirmation is necessary to validate the electronic transfer of gift funds to the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8eefd188642258e1fb627891c7c2dbb6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHURCHES&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSIDY PROVIDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Churches are mentioned as entities that can fulfill the role of eligible subsidy providers for certain loan programs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8cfec8ddeaba989b347c8cc9daa583b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EARNEST MONEY DEPOSIT HOLDER&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The earnest money deposit holder is responsible for managing the earnest money deposit made by the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8eefd188642258e1fb627891c7c2dbb6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COPY OF DONOR'S CHECK&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Copy of Donor's Check is required to verify the source of gift funds that can assist the borrower in purchasing a home."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATION FROM THE DONOR&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A certification from the donor confirms their relationship with the borrower and supports their financial assistance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8eefd188642258e1fb627891c7c2dbb6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SHARED RESIDENCY DOCUMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Shared residency documents verify the relationship between the borrower and the donor if funds are pooled."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8eefd188642258e1fb627891c7c2dbb6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GIFT OF FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower benefits from the gift of funds to support their down payment and closing costs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8eefd188642258e1fb627891c7c2dbb6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SETTLEMENT AGENT&quot;" target="&quot;CASHIER'S CHECK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A cashier's check may be presented to the settlement agent, showing the process of confirming the payment of funds in the transaction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SETTLEMENT AGENT&quot;" target="&quot;CLOSING STATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The settlement agent prepares the closing statement, indicating their crucial role in the financial transactions involved in the mortgage process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRIMARY RESIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower is eligible for gifts that assist them in purchasing a primary residence, indicating a direct residential relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower must live in the property defined as the primary residence to qualify for specific mortgage types."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2eef4940eec1ef97062f77d3efe4074e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRIMARY RESIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;MINIMUM CONTRIBUTION REQUIREMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The minimum contribution requirement for primary residences affects borrowers' ability to secure loans with varying LTVs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-164ff18d322608d7342cc1d0619c9f0f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRIMARY RESIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;FIXED RATE AGENCY PRODUCT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A primary residence is a requirement for loans involving Fixed Rate Agency Products offered by Fannie Mae or Freddie Mac."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-341a8217a86a20f7b3a1712ac24de48f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRIMARY RESIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE PAYMENT HISTORY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Documentation proving the borrower's primary residence is necessary for mortgage payment history evaluation, indicating their connection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9da80c7f63e32b0d7dc6df2ae9032546</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRIMARY RESIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;FREDDIE MAC&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FREDDIE MAC guidelines require documentation of the primary residence for refinancing, directly connecting the two."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9da80c7f63e32b0d7dc6df2ae9032546</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRIMARY RESIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGED PREMISES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The mortgaged premises must be a primary residence, linking the type of property to the mortgage qualifications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2eef4940eec1ef97062f77d3efe4074e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRIMARY RESIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Mortgage must be originated for a 1-unit Primary Residence as per guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Mortgage must be specifically for the Primary Residence of the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRIMARY RESIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;VERIFICATION OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Verification of employment is necessary to confirm the Borrower's eligibility for financing a Primary Residence."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRIMARY RESIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE TERMS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The mortgage terms for the Affordable Second must pertain to a Primary Residence, dictating the type of properties involved in the financing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-787de407af176e62ce6eb517b2dd1d21</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRIMARY RESIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;QUALIFYING PROPERTY TYPES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Qualifying property types for affordable housing must include only primary residences to ensure eligibility under loan programs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-787de407af176e62ce6eb517b2dd1d21</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ELECTRONIC TRANSFER&quot;" target="&quot;CLOSING STATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The closing statement must verify the electronic transfer of funds, illustrating the procedural steps involved in the transaction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RESIDENCY HISTORY&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The residency history is relevant to establishing eligibility for the borrower when receiving gift funds, indicating their connection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUPPORTING DOCUMENTATION&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Supporting Documentation refers to various forms of evidence required in the loan process to substantiate claims made by the borrower regarding income and assets."&lt;SEP&gt;"Supporting documentation is required to prove the borrower's eligibility for gifts, demonstrating a procedural relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728&lt;SEP&gt;</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SALES PROCEEDS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sales proceeds from a current home can aid in qualifying for a new mortgage, indicating a financial relationship with real estate transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SALES PROCEEDS&quot;" target="&quot;SALES COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sales costs must be deducted from the sales proceeds to determine net gains, indicating a financial relationship in real estate transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SALES PROCEEDS&quot;" target="&quot;FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SALES PROCEEDS from the sale of business are considered FUNDS for the BORROWER's mortgage qualification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-023647e2d4d4ed50a6e5f501c055a8b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SALES PROCEEDS&quot;" target="&quot;BUSINESS ASSET&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SALES PROCEEDS must not originate from non-business ASSET sources for proper mortgage qualification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-023647e2d4d4ed50a6e5f501c055a8b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LISTING PRICE&quot;" target="&quot;ESTIMATED PROCEEDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The estimated proceeds calculation requires the listing price, indicating a direct relationship in the context of real estate sales."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LISTING PRICE&quot;" target="&quot;NET PROCEEDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Net proceeds are derived using the listing price as a reference point, establishing a measurable relationship in home sales."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NET PROCEEDS&quot;" target="&quot;LIENS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Liens affect the calculation of net proceeds from property sales, indicating their influence on financial outcomes for the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NET PROCEEDS&quot;" target="&quot;ACCOUNT STATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The account statement must reflect the net proceeds from the business sale to demonstrate financial integrity for the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-452a34dee684e3a93929cc44930deb38</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NET PROCEEDS&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRACT FOR SALE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The contract for sale must detail the net proceeds to qualify the Borrower financially in relation to the business sale."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-452a34dee684e3a93929cc44930deb38</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLOSING STATEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;BROKER OR REAL ESTATE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The broker or real estate agent is involved in the closing process, influencing the details reflected in the closing statement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DRIVER'S LICENSE&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A copy of the driver's license can serve as proof of shared residency between the borrower and donor."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BANK STATEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A bank statement can be used as documentary evidence to confirm the borrower's account and financial standing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d30aff8ce4b53c163b59f9369ea58842</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BANK STATEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;DEPOSIT SLIP&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both deposit slips and bank statements are used as documentation for the proceeds of the sale."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-32546641e2f2fec0a52f658ed70fc338</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BANK STATEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;DEPOSIT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A bank statement is typically used to verify the receipt of a deposit in a real estate transaction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-32546641e2f2fec0a52f658ed70fc338</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BANK STATEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;CURRENT RECEIPT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A current receipt can often be represented through bank statements which document the ongoing Social Security payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Current receipt of Social Security benefits can be documented through bank statements or other verification methods."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3c5f3698bd3a35ae6c5127d81864d41d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BANK STATEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;CORRESPONDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The correspondent may require a bank statement for verifying the receipt of Social Security payments when processing loans."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3c5f3698bd3a35ae6c5127d81864d41d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BANK STATEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;VERIFICATION LETTER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Bank statements may be used as a form of verification of income, connecting these two documentation methods."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MARRIAGE LICENSE/CERTIFICATE&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Marriage License/Certificate validates the legal union, which may affect a borrower's capacity in shared contribution applications for mortgages."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GRADUATION&quot;" target="&quot;EDUCATIONAL INSTITUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Graduation from an educational institution supports the eligibility for receiving gift funds, linking education to financial support."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GRADUATION&quot;" target="&quot;CREDIT CARD REWARDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Graduation can provide gifts that may translate into credit card rewards, which can be used for closing costs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d30aff8ce4b53c163b59f9369ea58842</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GRADUATION&quot;" target="&quot;DOCUMENTARY EVIDENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Documentary evidence must confirm the educational achievement to validate gifts received at graduation affecting financial benefits."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d30aff8ce4b53c163b59f9369ea58842</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIENS&quot;" target="&quot;TITLE TRANSFER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Existing liens must be satisfied for a valid title transfer to occur."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-32546641e2f2fec0a52f658ed70fc338</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIENS&quot;" target="&quot;EXISTING LIENS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Existing liens must be examined to ensure they do not affect the title transfer process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-32546641e2f2fec0a52f658ed70fc338</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIENS&quot;" target="&quot;JUDGEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both liens and judgements are negative items that must be absent from a borrower's record for the last 24 months."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0f359b1edc6f123eca67b08265c9b89e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIENS&quot;" target="&quot;CREDIT REPORT TRADE LINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Liens are recorded in credit report trade lines, affecting the overall credit history of the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0f359b1edc6f123eca67b08265c9b89e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIENS&quot;" target="&quot;JUDGMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"JUDGMENTS can lead to LIENS against a borrower's property, affecting their financial standing and mortgage eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b4494b2a290a96f3ee6a9d358a812a8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIENS&quot;" target="&quot;DELINQUENT CREDIT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"LIENS must be assessed as part of DELINQUENT CREDIT that could diminish the borrower’s equity and impact loan approvals."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2b4494b2a290a96f3ee6a9d358a812a8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIENS&quot;" target="&quot;LAND&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Liens can affect the status of the land and influence the borrower's ability to secure a loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ebee13ef54f5a678a952e514a3a25998</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIENS&quot;" target="&quot;OUTSTANDING INDEBTEDNESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Outstanding indebtedness refers to unpaid debts secured by liens, affecting the borrower's financial position."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ebee13ef54f5a678a952e514a3a25998</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBJECT PROPERTY&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The subject property is the asset that the mortgage loan is secured against, playing a crucial role in the lending process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8fb1c993d98cbaba5a6755fc57b9ff69</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBJECT PROPERTY&quot;" target="&quot;ARMS-LENGTH TRANSACTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An arms-length transaction ensures that the buyer and seller are independent parties, affecting the legitimacy of the property's purchase price."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8fb1c993d98cbaba5a6755fc57b9ff69</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBJECT PROPERTY&quot;" target="&quot;INSTALLMENT LAND CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The subject property may have been initially acquired through an installment land contract, which affects financing options available to the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8fb1c993d98cbaba5a6755fc57b9ff69</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBJECT PROPERTY&quot;" target="&quot;APPRAISAL REPORT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SUBJECT PROPERTY's appraisal report is required for determining its value, linking it directly to the APPRAISAL REPORT process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The appraisal report must accurately represent the value of the subject property, including the impact of the solar panels on its valuation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-24638398312c4aec93c00e795739cbf9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6434821b2faf91ece4b375276017b775</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBJECT PROPERTY&quot;" target="&quot;SMALL RESIDENTIAL INCOME PROPERTY APPRAISAL REPORT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SMALL RESIDENTIAL INCOME PROPERTY APPRAISAL REPORT is specifically required for the SUBJECT PROPERTY type when used as rental, establishing a direct relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-24638398312c4aec93c00e795739cbf9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBJECT PROPERTY&quot;" target="&quot;INCOME APPROACH&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The subject property valuation incorporates the INCOME APPROACH when it generates rental income, establishing a direct relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-24638398312c4aec93c00e795739cbf9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBJECT PROPERTY&quot;" target="&quot;COMPARABLE SALES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"COMPARABLE SALES must reflect similar properties to the SUBJECT PROPERTY, establishing their relationship in determining property value."&lt;SEP&gt;"The subject property is evaluated based on comparable sales to determine its market value."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-24638398312c4aec93c00e795739cbf9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42fe7768b333d42fc15f00fc4e0ba0d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBJECT PROPERTY&quot;" target="&quot;NEIGHBORHOOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The NEIGHBORHOOD context influences the valuation of the SUBJECT PROPERTY, reflecting the importance of location in property appraisal."&lt;SEP&gt;"The characteristics of the neighborhood play a critical role in assessing the value of the subject property."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-24638398312c4aec93c00e795739cbf9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42fe7768b333d42fc15f00fc4e0ba0d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBJECT PROPERTY&quot;" target="&quot;APPRAISAL ADDENDUM REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The APPRAISAL ADDENDUM REQUIREMENTS specify necessary information regarding the SUBJECT PROPERTY to ensure accurate appraisal results."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-24638398312c4aec93c00e795739cbf9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBJECT PROPERTY&quot;" target="&quot;COMPARABLES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Comparables are assessed in relation to the subject property to ensure they are similar and relevant for accurate valuation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ea0854aedb400acc54c26d78db5065c4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBJECT PROPERTY&quot;" target="&quot;ESTABLISHED CONDOMINIUM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The subject property may be analyzed within the context of an established condominium if applicable."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-42fe7768b333d42fc15f00fc4e0ba0d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBJECT PROPERTY&quot;" target="&quot;PROPOSED CHANGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Proposed changes often relate to the subject property, indicating potential alterations that need to be assessed in appraisals."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f443d70c1b97ab92c6f9f441ec9ced99</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBJECT PROPERTY&quot;" target="&quot;APPRAISAL REPORTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The appraisal reports are focused on evaluating the subject property, including its dimensions and market value."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e98d878b21daedfefbf36b036612418f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
