</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNDERWRITER&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The underwriter evaluates the borrower's financial information as part of the underwriting process, ensuring that all documentation is accurate and complete."&lt;SEP&gt;"The underwriter is responsible for assessing the borrower's documentation and creditworthiness in the lending process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bf6a394b54c040882b94d8dd97b886e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a021e31a2283c93026e9b4e4159dcdf6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNDERWRITER&quot;" target="&quot;TITLE COMMITMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The UNDERWRITER must review TITLE COMMITMENTS to verify existing liens and ensure compliance with guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c6843059eea11d10d23493c39af4afd5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNDERWRITER&quot;" target="&quot;FINANCIAL RESOURCES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
