  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The redemption period can determine the implications of a deed-in-lieu of foreclosure on the property."&lt;SEP&gt;"The redemption period specifies the time frame before a deed-in-lieu of foreclosure option is pursued, interlinking these legal processes."</data>
