  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Federal Income Tax Returns are the fundamental documents that the IRS reviews for tax compliance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The IRS holds FEDERAL INCOME TAX RETURNS that must be provided by the BORROWER for income verification purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-023647e2d4d4ed50a6e5f501c055a8b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
