  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The IRS governs the application process for tax extensions using IRS Form 4868, establishing a direct regulatory relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The IRS provides the IRS FORM 4868 as part of their tax filing processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a173c08400538977a1dc5397bceda0a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddb3009468a2e7eaa9aab8998eae8ca6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
