  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The IRS manages IRS Form 4506 C, which is utilized to request transcripts of tax returns, thus linking these two entities closely."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a173c08400538977a1dc5397bceda0a6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IRS&quot;" target="&quot;TAX RETURNS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">19.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Tax Returns are filed with the IRS, a crucial step in individual and corporate taxation processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tax returns are submitted to the IRS, making the submission process essential for compliance with federal tax regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a173c08400538977a1dc5397bceda0a6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
