  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"REJECT CODE 10 is utilized by the IRS when there are possible identity theft concerns on a taxpayer's account."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1b8e57f220eeefd0215ac958c381bc47</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IRS&quot;" target="&quot;MAILED NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The IRS sends a MAILED NOTICE to inform taxpayers about the status of their tax transcripts or accounts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1b8e57f220eeefd0215ac958c381bc47</data>
