  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The rental housing payment must be verified directly through documentation, impacting the borrower's eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-61ba5485d92daa30adf4ee02bfab7d8a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MANAGEMENT COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECT VERIFICATION OF RENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Direct verification of rent often occurs through a management company, confirming rental agreements for borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-61ba5485d92daa30adf4ee02bfab7d8a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEASE AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;CANCELLED CHECKS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Cancelled checks may be used to document compliance with the lease agreement for rental payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-61ba5485d92daa30adf4ee02bfab7d8a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEASE AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;RENTAL INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A signed lease agreement is crucial for supporting the rental income claim in certain qualifying scenarios."&lt;SEP&gt;"LEASE AGREEMENTS are required to determine the gross rental income and potential income for borrower qualification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6b454650a6e8dde5a93325db30813c30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78e642bbbbe6e4f896abe6c8dfd4bab2</data>
