  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The lease agreement outlines the terms for the monthly net rental income, which impacts how income is calculated and reported."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d8864c52069485823a39babaa2b2005e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEASE AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;FORM 1007&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FORM 1007 is used to evaluate rental income and is applicable when supported by the terms of the LEASE AGREEMENT."&lt;SEP&gt;"The lease agreement provides necessary data for FORM 1007 to assess rental income and cash flow."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fb02bde5abfff1b16d83434416df7465&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8864c52069485823a39babaa2b2005e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEASE AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;FORM 1025&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FORM 1025 is also used for appraising rental properties and can be associated with the LEASE AGREEMENT’s financial assessments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The lease agreement is required for FORM 1025 to evaluate the current rental income situation of the property."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fb02bde5abfff1b16d83434416df7465&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8864c52069485823a39babaa2b2005e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEASE AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The BORROWER may need to present a current lease agreement to document their rental income for underwriting purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is involved in a Lease Agreement when acquiring Solar Panels, establishing a financial relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e2c659b65edef4a5e599f9445602b752&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb02bde5abfff1b16d83434416df7465</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
