  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Monthly Lease Payments are a direct consequence of the Lease Agreement related to the solar panels."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Monthly Lease Payments are related to the Lease Agreement under which the Borrower accesses the solar panels."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6434821b2faf91ece4b375276017b775</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
