  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A lease agreement may relate to the ownership and installation of solar panels, impacting financing and property rights."&lt;SEP&gt;"Solar Panels can be financed through a Lease Agreement, linking financial arrangements to their installation and use."</data>
