  <data key="d6">chunk-e2c659b65edef4a5e599f9445602b752</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEASE AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PPA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Power Purchase Agreement (PPA) functions similarly to a Lease Agreement, defining the financial terms of solar energy production and use."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e2c659b65edef4a5e599f9445602b752</data>
