  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both cancellation and discharge refer to processes that eliminate the borrower's debt obligations under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Discharge and cancellation refer to processes that can eliminate debt obligations for borrowers under specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-61ba5485d92daa30adf4ee02bfab7d8a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
