  <data key="d6">chunk-b9fd7a30043bf2ff61e50fbd6141d212</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SETTLOR&quot;" target="&quot;CO-BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The settlor must also occupy the property and sign loan documents as a borrower, indicating a direct connection to the co-borrower relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b9fd7a30043bf2ff61e50fbd6141d212</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SETTLOR&quot;" target="&quot;PRIMARY BENEFICIARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The settlor is typically the primary beneficiary of the trust, emphasizing their interconnected roles in trust dynamics."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b9fd7a30043bf2ff61e50fbd6141d212</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CO-BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;NON-OCCUPANT CO-BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Non-occupant co-borrowers are defined as individuals involved in principal transactions who do not occupy the property, thus related to co-borrower dynamics."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b9fd7a30043bf2ff61e50fbd6141d212</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CO-BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;CO-SIGNER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A co-signer can act as a co-borrower in a transaction but does not have an ownership interest in the security property, impacting the borrower dynamic."&lt;SEP&gt;"Co-signers can sometimes be co-borrowers, indicating a shared financial responsibility on a loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c3fe3f1cf3ad46c315af5250198974ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9fd7a30043bf2ff61e50fbd6141d212</data>
