  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"EAD CLASS A06 is issued to fiancées or dependents of K-1 visa holders, linking the two visa categories through familial connections."&lt;SEP&gt;"EAD CLASS A06 is issued to fiancés or dependents of K SERIES visa holders, directly linking the two categories in terms of family connections."</data>
