  <data key="d6">chunk-d0ff713c7eebcf293485e860ba8cc6a1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OWNER-OCCUPIED TRANSACTION&quot;" target="&quot;FANNIE MAE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Fannie Mae also stipulates guidelines related to owner-occupied transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0ff713c7eebcf293485e860ba8cc6a1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OWNER-OCCUPIED TRANSACTION&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPYING THE PROPERTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The classification of an owner-occupied transaction relies on the borrower's occupancy of the property."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0ff713c7eebcf293485e860ba8cc6a1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MILITARY SERVICE MEMBER&quot;" target="&quot;ACTIVE DUTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Military service members on active duty may be temporarily unable to occupy the home, yet still classify it as their principal residence."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0ff713c7eebcf293485e860ba8cc6a1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MILITARY SERVICE MEMBER&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Military service members are treated as borrowers under specific conditions regarding owner occupancy."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0ff713c7eebcf293485e860ba8cc6a1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISABLED CHILD&quot;" target="&quot;PARENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Parents can provide housing for their disabled children, affecting the classification of the property as a primary residence."&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial support provided by parents can affect the ability of a disabled child to qualify for home financing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0ff713c7eebcf293485e860ba8cc6a1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISABLED CHILD&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A disabled child can be classified as an owner-occupant if the borrower is their parent or legal guardian."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0ff713c7eebcf293485e860ba8cc6a1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARENT&quot;" target="&quot;ELDERLY PARENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Parents can assist in obtaining mortgage financing for their elderly parents, showing a familial relationship impacting residency status."&lt;SEP&gt;"Parents may seek loans to provide housing for their elderly parents, signifying a supportive familial relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0ff713c7eebcf293485e860ba8cc6a1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADDRESS OF RECORD&quot;" target="&quot;VOTER REGISTRATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The address of record is relevant for important activities like voter registration and federal income tax reporting."&lt;SEP&gt;"Voter registration must correspond with the address of record designated by the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0ff713c7eebcf293485e860ba8cc6a1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADDRESS OF RECORD&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPYING THE PROPERTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The address of record must match the property that the borrower intends to occupy as a primary residence."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0ff713c7eebcf293485e860ba8cc6a1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
