</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TAX RETURN&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">24.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower is responsible for submitting their tax return, which affects the underwriting process and loan eligibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower must provide 1-year tax return documentation to qualify for mortgage financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower's signed federal income tax return is necessary for verification of income sources and amounts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bf6a394b54c040882b94d8dd97b886e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95358b428c5f107947a116a0643878c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12708616563afb36a31ad3cf8523241b</data>
