</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TAX RETURN&quot;" target="&quot;TAX TRANSCRIPTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Tax transcripts are necessary documents that validate the information provided in tax returns for loan qualification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tax transcripts are required to be provided along with tax returns to document various income types."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-79943296a1fa68394820a29e269db689</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TAX RETURN&quot;" target="&quot;SELF-EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Self-employment income must be documented through tax returns when used for qualifying income."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-79943296a1fa68394820a29e269db689</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TAX RETURN&quot;" target="&quot;CONVENTIONAL UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Tax return requirements are stated within the conventional underwriting guidelines, which dictate documentation needed for loans."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-79943296a1fa68394820a29e269db689</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TAX RETURN&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN PROCESSING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Loan processing requires a thorough evaluation of tax returns to assess the borrower’s income documentation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-79943296a1fa68394820a29e269db689</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TAX RETURN&quot;" target="&quot;RENTAL INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
