  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"For borrowers converting their principal residence to an investment property, landlord education is required unless they have prior management experience."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6b454650a6e8dde5a93325db30813c30</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LANDLORD EDUCATION PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Borrowers must participate in a landlord education program as a requirement for certain transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-81edfb1496d26226dca5f3238aa461cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LANDLORD EDUCATION PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;INVESTMENT PROPERTY MANAGEMENT EXPERIENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Experience in investment property management can exempt a borrower from needing to complete a landlord education program."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-81edfb1496d26226dca5f3238aa461cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
