  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Participation in a landlord education program is required under certain conventional underwriting guidelines for borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-81edfb1496d26226dca5f3238aa461cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTINUITY OF OBLIGATION&quot;" target="&quot;FREDDIE MAC&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FREDDIE MAC requires a continuity of obligation for refinancing transactions, establishing a direct procedural relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9da80c7f63e32b0d7dc6df2ae9032546</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTINUITY OF OBLIGATION&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE PAYMENT HISTORY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A borrower's mortgage payment history is critical for establishing continuity of obligation during refinancing processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9da80c7f63e32b0d7dc6df2ae9032546</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTINUITY OF OBLIGATION&quot;" target="&quot;FIRST RESIDENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The requirement of maintaining residence ties into the continuity of obligation for refinancing, establishing relevance between both.".</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9da80c7f63e32b0d7dc6df2ae9032546</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTINUITY OF OBLIGATION&quot;" target="&quot;EQUITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Continuity of obligation is often evaluated in relation to the borrower's equity position, linking financial elements closely."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9da80c7f63e32b0d7dc6df2ae9032546</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
