  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Borrowers utilize their equity in the property to access funds through a cash-out refinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Equity contributed by the borrower in transactions affects the overall financing and value assessment of the land and manufactured home."</data>
