  <data key="d6">chunk-9da80c7f63e32b0d7dc6df2ae9032546</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBORDINATE MORTGAGE&quot;" target="&quot;CASH-OUT TRANSACTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subordinate mortgages are specifically addressed in cash-out transactions, highlighting their procedural connection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9da80c7f63e32b0d7dc6df2ae9032546</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBORDINATE MORTGAGE&quot;" target="&quot;FIRST MORTGAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A SUBORDINATE MORTGAGE is a secondary loan which is subordinate to the FIRST MORTGAGE in terms of lien priority."&lt;SEP&gt;"In refinancing scenarios, the FIRST MORTGAGE takes priority over any SUBORDINATE MORTGAGE, affecting the loan hierarchy."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-faa30e2538a6e107a9cdb96ee1067084</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBORDINATE MORTGAGE&quot;" target="&quot;OUTSTANDING LIENS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subordinate mortgages can be classified as outstanding liens that affect the financial standing of a manufactured home."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6c568dd7273250cbc578b2e15944d1bb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CASH-OUT TRANSACTION&quot;" target="&quot;HOME EQUITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Home equity is a key factor in cash-out transactions, connecting homeowners' financial status with refinancing options."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9da80c7f63e32b0d7dc6df2ae9032546</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
