  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An LLC can serve as a borrower if it has individual or joint ownership of the property, illustrating their connection in property acquisition."&lt;SEP&gt;"The BORROWER's income from an LLC can influence their cash flow, similar to how income from a PARTNERSHIP does."</data>
