  <data key="d5">"BORROWER(S) refers to the individual(s) involved as THE BORROWER in the financial context being discussed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term BORROWER(S) encompasses individuals who qualify as THE BORROWER in the context of the mortgage and financial requirements."</data>
