  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A history of receiving variable income may impact a borrower's perceived stability of income."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stable income is contrasted with variable income during income assessment for loan qualification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d1ab9735c2b386c1cf372b9ba4a34fe4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f91be92d53c1aed3b7126461f33e415</data>
