  <data key="d5">"Borrower reserves are assessed alongside the employment contract to ensure sufficient funds for loan payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0610be8f2c48d2ab9263a9d9aea08a29</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;ELIGIBLE LOAN PURPOSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The purpose of the loan must meet eligibility requirements in accordance with the employment contract provided."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0610be8f2c48d2ab9263a9d9aea08a29</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;FINANCIAL RESOURCES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Verification of financial resources is necessary when assessing an employment contract for loan qualifications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0610be8f2c48d2ab9263a9d9aea08a29</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;FREDDIE MAC&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FREDDIE MAC establishes the requirements for the Employment Contract for the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac specifies similar requirements for employment and income verification in relation to mortgages, indicating a direct connection to underwriting guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2eef4940eec1ef97062f77d3efe4074e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;VERIFICATION REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employment contract sets the framework for the verification requirements needed for mortgage applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2eef4940eec1ef97062f77d3efe4074e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower must have an Employment Contract that verifies their future employment and income."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must provide an Employment Contract to demonstrate future income and employment terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-843cd03316121e01909837126fbbe24c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;SALARY INCREASE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Employment Contract often includes terms regarding the future salary increase for the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The future salary increase must be documented in the Employment Contract to qualify for the mortgage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Employer is responsible for providing an Employment Contract as part of the verification process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;RESTRICTED STOCK (RS)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"RS can be included in the employee's compensation as outlined in the Employment Contract."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT&quot;" target="&quot;RESTRICTED STOCK UNITS (RSU)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
