  <data key="d6">chunk-0610be8f2c48d2ab9263a9d9aea08a29</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT OFFER&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower must provide an Employment Offer as part of the documentation needed for mortgage consideration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3f01d27887cb1edc56efdd9355e2cbba</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT OFFER&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYMENT START DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Employment Offer specifies the Employment Start Date which is crucial for aligning with the note date requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3f01d27887cb1edc56efdd9355e2cbba</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT OFFER&quot;" target="&quot;CURRENT INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The EMPLOYMENT OFFER influences the Borrower's CURRENT INCOME potential, which is a crucial factor in qualifying for a mortgage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3f01d27887cb1edc56efdd9355e2cbba</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT OFFER&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGED PREMISES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The conditions of the EMPLOYMENT OFFER can impact the eligibility of the MORTGAGED PREMISES based on income availability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3f01d27887cb1edc56efdd9355e2cbba</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER'S DEPOSITORY&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER RESERVES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Funds in the borrower's depository and reserves are verified for financial sufficiency to cover loan obligations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0610be8f2c48d2ab9263a9d9aea08a29</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACTIVE SERVICE&quot;" target="&quot;TAX-FREE INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Income from active service can contribute to tax-free income used for loan qualification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0610be8f2c48d2ab9263a9d9aea08a29</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINANCIAL RESOURCES&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower must demonstrate Financial Resources to cover mortgage liabilities, thus directly linking their financial standing with eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3f01d27887cb1edc56efdd9355e2cbba</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINANCIAL RESOURCES&quot;" target="&quot;CURRENT INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"CURRENT INCOME impacts the assessment of FINANCIAL RESOURCES for debt-to-income calculations during mortgage evaluation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The verification of FINANCIAL RESOURCES includes CURRENT INCOME, affecting overall mortgage qualification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3f01d27887cb1edc56efdd9355e2cbba</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINANCIAL RESOURCES&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The success of the MORTGAGE application depends significantly on the Borrower's Financial Resources verification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3f01d27887cb1edc56efdd9355e2cbba</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYMENT START DATE&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower must have an Employment Start Date that is compliant with the timeline specified in the mortgage requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Employment Start Date is crucial for verifying the Borrower's income qualifications as part of the loan process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3f01d27887cb1edc56efdd9355e2cbba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-843cd03316121e01909837126fbbe24c</data>
