</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REAL ESTATE TRANSACTION&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Real estate transactions are dependent on mortgage approvals, establishing a clear link between them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2eef4940eec1ef97062f77d3efe4074e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CURRENT PRIMARY EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;HOUSING EXPENSE CALCULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The housing expense calculation involves evaluating income from the current primary employer to assess the borrower's ability to pay."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2eef4940eec1ef97062f77d3efe4074e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
