  <data key="d6">chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;ADDITIONAL FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Employer's verification may also ascertain if the Borrower has Additional Funds available for closing costs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">25.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower is typically employed by an Employer whose details must be verified during the mortgage process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The employer is a key entity in income verification for the borrower, providing essential documents like paystubs and W-2s."&lt;SEP&gt;"The employer must provide documentation confirming the borrower's employment status and eligibility to return after a temporary leave."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-efc5b39715a3cc6b0751b8cfe29a66e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-444e5ed0aa3891f1dfc3371133a3be60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER-PROVIDED STATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Employer must provide a statement to confirm the Borrower's employment and earnings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d411e3f303846f3eb00356498af7761f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;VERIFICATION SERVICE PROVIDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer provides necessary employment verification to the verification service provider for the borrower's income evaluation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-95d0c65d8599d7d0f56b6359c8d77e68</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;SHARES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer typically issues shares as part of the RSU compensation package for the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-95d0c65d8599d7d0f56b6359c8d77e68</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;VERIFICATION OF BORROWER'S INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer is responsible for verifying the borrower's income before and after their temporary leave for loan approval purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-efc5b39715a3cc6b0751b8cfe29a66e7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;DOCUMENTATION FROM CURRENT EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Documentation from the current employer is essential to establish the borrower’s employment status, particularly relevant during leaves."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-efc5b39715a3cc6b0751b8cfe29a66e7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;CONFIRMATION DATE OF RETURN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer must provide confirmation of the return date for the borrower to ensure proper handling of mortgage qualifications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-efc5b39715a3cc6b0751b8cfe29a66e7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;SEVERANCE PACKAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The employer is responsible for providing documentation of a severance package as part of the asset requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADDITIONAL FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower may need to verify additional funds for expenses related to the mortgage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RS AND RSU INCOME&quot;" target="&quot;ADDITIONAL RESERVES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The analysis of RS and RSU Income affects the calculation of Additional Reserves required for loan approval."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-843cd03316121e01909837126fbbe24c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;STOCK&quot;" target="&quot;DOCUMENTATION OF ADDITIONAL FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The guidelines specify that Stock, especially unvested, cannot be used as reserves or for closing costs, hence requiring additional documentation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-843cd03316121e01909837126fbbe24c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;STOCK&quot;" target="&quot;CONVENTIONAL UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Stock is evaluated under Conventional Underwriting Guidelines to determine eligibility as a source of borrower funds."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-843cd03316121e01909837126fbbe24c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INCOME FLUCTUATION AND STABILITY&quot;" target="&quot;YTD EARNINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"YTD Earnings data is analyzed to assess Income Fluctuation and Stability for underwriting purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-843cd03316121e01909837126fbbe24c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INCOME FLUCTUATION AND STABILITY&quot;" target="&quot;CONVENTIONAL UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Income Fluctuation and Stability assessments are integral to Conventional Underwriting Guidelines for financial evaluation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-843cd03316121e01909837126fbbe24c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;YTD EARNINGS&quot;" target="&quot;10-DAY PRE-CLOSING VERBAL VERIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"YTD Earnings must be verified during the 10-Day Pre-Closing Verbal Verification process to confirm financial stability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-843cd03316121e01909837126fbbe24c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;YTD EARNINGS&quot;" target="&quot;CONVENTIONAL UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"YTD Earnings are essential for adherence to Conventional Underwriting Guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;YTD EARNINGS&quot;" target="&quot;W-2 FORMS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"W-2 Forms are required to document YTD Earnings for income verification purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;YTD EARNINGS&quot;" target="&quot;CALENDAR YEARS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Calendar Years are used as a timeframe to assess YTD Earnings for income verification purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;YTD EARNINGS&quot;" target="&quot;PERFORMANCE-BASED VESTING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"YTD Earnings are impacted by Performance-Based Vesting which dictates how and when payouts are managed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADDITIONAL RESERVES&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower's financial assessment includes a calculation of Additional Reserves required for securing the loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-843cd03316121e01909837126fbbe24c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADDITIONAL RESERVES&quot;" target="&quot;REDUCTION IN RESERVES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The guidelines link the Reduction in Reserves to the Additional Reserves necessary for meeting borrower income qualifications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-843cd03316121e01909837126fbbe24c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOCUMENTATION OF ADDITIONAL FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Documentation of Additional Funds is necessary to verify additional financial resources available to the borrower for mortgage qualification."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RS&quot;" target="&quot;VESTING SCHEDULE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"RS payouts are subject to a Vesting Schedule that details their distribution over time."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RS&quot;" target="&quot;PERFORMANCE-BASED VESTING PROVISIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"RS share distributions are contingent upon meeting Performance-Based Vesting Provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower receives RS, which represents an income form based on vested shares or cash equivalents."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-15bd1add6397f9fb7a5eda377f3403cf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RS&quot;" target="&quot;RSU&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"RS and RSU are related as both represent forms of income derived from shares or cash equivalents."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-15bd1add6397f9fb7a5eda377f3403cf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RSU&quot;" target="&quot;VESTING SCHEDULE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"RSU shares are also governed by a Vesting Schedule that determines when they become available to the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RSU&quot;" target="&quot;PERFORMANCE-BASED VESTING PROVISIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"RSU are part of the Performance-Based Vesting Provisions establishing conditions for their release."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RSU&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower receives RSU, which is also linked to income from vested shares or cash equivalents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The RSU is a form of compensation that the borrower may receive, impacting their income assessment for loan applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-15bd1add6397f9fb7a5eda377f3403cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95d0c65d8599d7d0f56b6359c8d77e68</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VESTING SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;PERFORMANCE-BASED VESTING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Performance-based vesting requires a specific Vesting Schedule that details past and future payouts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VESTING SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;PERFORMANCE-BASED VESTING PROVISIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Vesting Schedule is aligned with the terms set out in the Performance-Based Vesting Provisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VESTING SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;EQUITY COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Equity Compensation is linked to the Vesting Schedule that dictates when compensation becomes available."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VESTING SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLICLY TRADED STOCK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Vesting Schedule must detail the distribution of Publicly Traded Stock to ensure compliance with regulatory requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VESTING SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;VESTING PROVISIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The vesting schedule provides specific timelines for when shares become vested, which are guided by the vesting provisions established by the employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-95d0c65d8599d7d0f56b6359c8d77e68</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VESTING SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;STABLE MONTHLY INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The vesting schedule determines when the borrower can expect stable monthly income from their RSUs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-95d0c65d8599d7d0f56b6359c8d77e68</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
