  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Third-party verification services can provide the necessary employment verification to support loan applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THIRD-PARTY VERIFICATION SERVICE PROVIDER&quot;" target="&quot;INDEPENDENT VERIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Independent verification processes can be conducted through a third-party service provider to ensure authenticity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THIRD-PARTY VERIFICATION SERVICE PROVIDER&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER-PROVIDED STATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Third-party verification requires documentation to be paired with employer-provided statements for accuracy in income verification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d411e3f303846f3eb00356498af7761f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYOUTS OF RS OR RSU&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower needs documentation of payouts from RS or RSU for income verification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYOUTS OF RS OR RSU&quot;" target="&quot;BROKERAGE OR BANK STATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Brokerage or Bank Statements must show proof of payouts of RS or RSU for verification purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
