  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Brokerage or Bank Statements must be corroborated with W-2 Forms to verify income and payouts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;W-2 FORMS&quot;" target="&quot;YEAR-TO-DATE PAYSTUB&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both W-2 forms and YEAR-TO-DATE PAYSTUB are needed for verifying income documentation requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d411e3f303846f3eb00356498af7761f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;W-2 FORMS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower must submit W-2 forms to verify their income for loan application purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d411e3f303846f3eb00356498af7761f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VERBAL VERIFICATION OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;CURRENT EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Verification of employment from the Current Employer is necessary for loan processing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VERBAL VERIFICATION OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;10-DAY PRIOR VERIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A 10-Day Prior Verification of Employment establishes timely confirmation from the Borrower’s employer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VERBAL VERIFICATION OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;" target="&quot;10-DAY PRIOR TO CLOSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A 10-Day Prior to Close refers to the timing of Verbal Verification of Employment necessary for finalizing loans."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CURRENT EMPLOYER&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower is required to have received shares or payouts from their Current Employer, proving employment income."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is required to provide documentation from their Current Employer for employment verification purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d411e3f303846f3eb00356498af7761f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14fb0d3aaa293edfdf71f855df5bd9ce</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
