  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NET DOCUMENTED ASSETS&quot;" target="&quot;ACCESS TO FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Net Documented Assets are calculated based on the assets that a borrower has access to for funding purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NET DOCUMENTED ASSETS&quot;" target="&quot;CLOSING COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Closing costs affect the calculation of net documented assets by subtracting required reserves."&lt;SEP&gt;"Closing costs are deducted when calculating the Net Documented Assets available for a loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a9a7e59e34af57946c09cfa07672f92</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NET DOCUMENTED ASSETS&quot;" target="&quot;ASSET PARAMETERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Net Documented Assets must adhere to specific asset parameters that outline the eligibility and calculation requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NET DOCUMENTED ASSETS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower's net documented assets are crucial for determining eligibility for mortgage loans as per Fannie Mae guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NET DOCUMENTED ASSETS&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Net documented assets are used to determine the eligibility for a mortgage under Freddie Mac guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a9a7e59e34af57946c09cfa07672f92</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NET DOCUMENTED ASSETS&quot;" target="&quot;MONTHLY INCOME STREAM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Monthly income stream is calculated based on the net documented assets available to the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a9a7e59e34af57946c09cfa07672f92</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NET DOCUMENTED ASSETS&quot;" target="&quot;STOCKS, BONDS, MUTUAL FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The value of stocks, bonds, and mutual funds is factored into the calculation of net documented assets."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a9a7e59e34af57946c09cfa07672f92</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NET DOCUMENTED ASSETS&quot;" target="&quot;ASSETS AS A BASIS FOR REPAYMENT OF OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Net documented assets will influence the assessment of assets available for fulfilling the repayment of obligations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a9a7e59e34af57946c09cfa07672f92</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NET DOCUMENTED ASSETS&quot;" target="&quot;MONTHLY INCOME CALCULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Monthly Income Calculation is directly derived from the Net Documented Assets through asset-to-income ratios."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-446d02f0d6609ee8a932eea7a8d1302e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ELIGIBLE ASSETS&quot;" target="&quot;LIQUID ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Liquid assets must meet the eligible assets criteria to qualify for loan applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INELIGIBLE ASSETS&quot;" target="&quot;STOCK OPTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Stock options are categorized as ineligible assets, which cannot be used to qualify for loans."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INELIGIBLE ASSETS&quot;" target="&quot;LAWSUITS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Lawsuits are deemed ineligible assets and cannot contribute to net documented assets for loan purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INELIGIBLE ASSETS&quot;" target="&quot;LOTTERY WINNINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Lottery winnings are also classified as ineligible assets, impacting the assessment for loans."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INELIGIBLE ASSETS&quot;" target="&quot;INHERITANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Inheritance is considered an ineligible asset according to the guidelines and cannot be utilized for loan qualification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INELIGIBLE ASSETS&quot;" target="&quot;DIVORCE PROCEEDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Divorce proceeds are categorized as ineligible assets affecting the net assets assessment for loans."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INELIGIBLE ASSETS&quot;" target="&quot;CASH-OUT REFINANCE TRANSACTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Cash-out refinance transactions are also deemed ineligible as they cannot be used for qualifying the borrower's reserves."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a9a7e59e34af57946c09cfa07672f92</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INELIGIBLE ASSETS&quot;" target="&quot;INTEREST, DIVIDENDS, AND CAPITAL GAINS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Interest, dividends, and capital gains from other financial assets are classified as ineligible income for mortgage qualification purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a9a7e59e34af57946c09cfa07672f92</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INELIGIBLE ASSETS&quot;" target="&quot;PARAMETER TRANSACTION REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The parameter transaction requirements detail which assets are deemed ineligible for use in mortgage applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a9a7e59e34af57946c09cfa07672f92</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCESS TO FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;PENALTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The penalty applied to early distributions impacts the assessment of access to funds from retirement accounts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCESS TO FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;LIQUID ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Having liquid assets indicates availability of funds, impacting access for loan purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCESS TO FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;LUMP SUM RETIREMENT PACKAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Lump sum retirement packages must provide access to funds to be considered in calculations for loans."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCESS TO FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;SEVERANCE PACKAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A severance package must also provide access to be included in a borrower's financial analysis for loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"A severance package must be liquid and accessible for it to be considered in the asset calculations for loans."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCESS TO FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;LAWSUITS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Funds from lawsuits are not accessible and classified as ineligible assets impacting financial assessments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCESS TO FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;LOTTERY WINNINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Lottery winnings do not provide reliable access to funds and are thus ineligible for loan applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCESS TO FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;INHERITANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Inheritance might provide access to funds, but it is categorized as ineligible in the asset assessment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCESS TO FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;DIVORCE PROCEEDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Divorce proceeds can affect a borrower's financial situation but are ineligible as assets for loan qualification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCESS TO FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;CLOSING COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Closing costs must be deducted from the available funds that the borrower has access to for transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCESS TO FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;NET ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Net assets affect the availability of funds that a borrower has unrestricted access to for qualifying for a loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCESS TO FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;FANNIE MAE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Fannie Mae provides regulations that dictate the assessment of access to funds based on various asset types."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCESS TO FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower must have access to the funds in their accounts, indicating a clear relationship between them."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower's ability to access funds is critical for them in the context of mortgages, indicating a close relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f67964fc288da88f7bb3defef1f29177</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACCESS TO FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;LUMP-SUM DISTRIBUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Access to funds from a lump-sum distribution is crucial for the Borrower, linking them together."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f67964fc288da88f7bb3defef1f29177</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NET ASSETS&quot;" target="&quot;ASSET PARAMETERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Asset parameters define what constitutes net assets and the eligibility criteria for them in lending decisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AUS&quot;" target="&quot;UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"AUS is used to guide lenders based on underwriting guidelines for loan applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1b8e57f220eeefd0215ac958c381bc47</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SEVERANCE PACKAGE&quot;" target="&quot;LUMP SUM RETIREMENT PACKAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both severance and lump sum retirement packages are considered under employment-related asset guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SEVERANCE PACKAGE&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"Severance Packages can affect a borrower's financial resources, particularly if they are transitioning from one employment to another, which can influence loan applications."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LAWSUITS&quot;" target="&quot;NON-EMPLOYMENT-RELATED ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Lawsuits are categorized as non-employment-related assets and are hence ineligible for calculations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOTTERY WINNINGS&quot;" target="&quot;NON-EMPLOYMENT-RELATED ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Lottery winnings fall under non-employment-related assets, which cannot be used as eligible assets in calculations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INHERITANCE&quot;" target="&quot;NON-EMPLOYMENT-RELATED ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Inheritance is also classified as a non-employment-related asset and is not eligible for asset calculations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DIVORCE PROCEEDS&quot;" target="&quot;NON-EMPLOYMENT-RELATED ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Divorce proceeds are treated as non-employment-related assets, therefore they are ineligible for consideration when calculating assets."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NON-EMPLOYMENT-RELATED ASSETS&quot;" target="&quot;ASSET PARAMETERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Non-employment-related assets have specific asset parameters that exclude them from being considered in loan calculations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bc03d45e68c4df0463506aff2ba2a679</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ASSET PARAMETERS&quot;" target="&quot;ASSET REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Asset parameters define the requirements for what constitutes an eligible asset for borrowing purposes under Fannie Mae guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ASSET PARAMETERS&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIAL FEATURE CODE (SFC 579)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Special Feature Code (SFC 579) is necessary for certain asset parameters in the loan application process, guiding asset evaluations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN PARAMETERS&quot;" target="&quot;FANNIE MAE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Fannie Mae sets specific loan parameters for various types of loans, which influence the conditions under which funding is approved."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-49e500168a0590aef42a229f4ea93fe3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN PARAMETERS&quot;" target="&quot;RESERVE REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Reserve requirements are defined within the loan parameters that borrowers need to meet for qualifying."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-49e500168a0590aef42a229f4ea93fe3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN PARAMETERS&quot;" target="&quot;NET DOCUMENT ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Net document assets are assessed under the loan parameters to determine borrower eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-49e500168a0590aef42a229f4ea93fe3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN PARAMETERS&quot;" target="&quot;MONTHLY INCOME CALCULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Monthly income calculation is influenced by the loan parameters specified for different types of mortgages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-49e500168a0590aef42a229f4ea93fe3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN PARAMETERS&quot;" target="&quot;TRANSACTION REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Loan parameters outline the specifics required for transaction requirements under Fannie Mae guidelines, impacting loan approval."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RESERVE REQUIREMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Reserve Requirements refer to the necessary liquid assets that borrowers must have available to qualify for loans, ensuring coverage for future payments."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NET DOCUMENT ASSETS&quot;" target="&quot;MONTHLY INCOME CALCULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Monthly income calculation is based on net document assets divided by the loan term to determine qualifying income."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-49e500168a0590aef42a229f4ea93fe3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MONTHLY INCOME CALCULATION&quot;" target="&quot;INCOME CALCULATION/PAYOUT STREAM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Monthly Income Calculation is derived from the Income Calculation/Payout Stream based on the Net Documented Assets."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-446d02f0d6609ee8a932eea7a8d1302e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MONTHLY INCOME CALCULATION&quot;" target="&quot;APPLICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Application must include relevant details to support Monthly Income Calculation for loan qualifiers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-446d02f0d6609ee8a932eea7a8d1302e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AUS DU&quot;" target="&quot;SPECIAL FEATURE CODE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The application of a Special Feature Code is required for loans that are approved through the AUS DU system."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-49e500168a0590aef42a229f4ea93fe3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOANS&quot;" target="&quot;UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Mortgage loans must adhere to specific Underwriting Guidelines set forth by agencies like Fannie Mae for eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;STOCKS, BONDS, MUTUAL FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;CHECKING AND SAVINGS ACCOUNTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Stocks, bonds, mutual funds, and checking and savings accounts are considered financial assets with distinct implications on mortgage qualifying."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;STOCKS, BONDS, MUTUAL FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;APPLICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Investments such as stocks, bonds, and mutual funds must be reported in the application to assess the borrower's financial stability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a9a7e59e34af57946c09cfa07672f92</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ASSET REQUIREMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;DOCUMENTED FINANCIAL ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Documented financial assets must meet asset requirements to qualify as valid for mortgage application under Fannie Mae guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ASSET REQUIREMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"Asset Requirements specify the qualifications that a borrower must meet in their assets to be considered valid during the lending process."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MONTHLY INCOME STREAM&quot;" target="&quot;ASSETS AS A BASIS FOR REPAYMENT OF OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The monthly income stream calculation uses borrower assets to evaluate their capability to meet repayment obligations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a9a7e59e34af57946c09cfa07672f92</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MONTHLY INCOME STREAM&quot;" target="&quot;INTEREST, DIVIDENDS, AND CAPITAL GAINS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Income from interest, dividends, and capital gains may contribute to the monthly income stream calculation as long as they comply with eligibility guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a9a7e59e34af57946c09cfa07672f92</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MONTHLY INCOME STREAM&quot;" target="&quot;FREDDIE MAC&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Freddie Mac provides guidelines for the calculation of the Monthly Income Stream based on assets and other financial parameters."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-446d02f0d6609ee8a932eea7a8d1302e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
