  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Closing costs must be detailed in the application for mortgage approval."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a9a7e59e34af57946c09cfa07672f92</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICATION&quot;" target="&quot;NUMBER OF UNITS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The number of units must be included in the application to facilitate accurate mortgage qualification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a9a7e59e34af57946c09cfa07672f92</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICATION&quot;" target="&quot;CASH-OUT REFINANCE TRANSACTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Cash-out refinance transactions must be disclosed in the application as they affect the borrower’s overall financial picture."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a9a7e59e34af57946c09cfa07672f92</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICATION&quot;" target="&quot;INTEREST, DIVIDENDS, AND CAPITAL GAINS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Income from interest, dividends, and capital gains must be appropriately reported in the application to support income verification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a9a7e59e34af57946c09cfa07672f92</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICATION&quot;" target="&quot;ELIGIBILITY DOCUMENTATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
