</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MARKET VALUE&quot;" target="&quot;APPRAISAL REPORT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">25.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The appraisal report aims to establish the market value of the subject property based on multiple criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"The appraisal report assesses the market value of properties, including those with manufactured homes and accessory units."&lt;SEP&gt;"The appraisal report is intended to assess the market value, directly correlating with how properties are valued in transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6d048ce21946dbbaf2025fa9d108f909&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f562ac717c24b9fccfb1aab0164fb157&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42fe7768b333d42fc15f00fc4e0ba0d3</data>
