<edge source="&quot;MARKET VALUE&quot;" target="&quot;HAZARDOUS CONDITIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Hazardous conditions can significantly impact the market value of a property as assessed during appraisal."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-756642bc27ab7956732455451eb4ce71</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MARKET VALUE&quot;" target="&quot;RESIDENTIAL CHARACTERISTICS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The market value of mixed-use properties needs to be primarily based on their residential characteristics rather than business uses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c3e0ec6e1adaeb678f542089515e77ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MARKET VALUE&quot;" target="&quot;APPRAISAL REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Appraisal requirements are designed to determine the market value of properties, ensuring they meet lender criteria."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c3e0ec6e1adaeb678f542089515e77ac</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;STATE-REGULATED FINANCIAL INSTITUTION&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The BORROWER must provide documentation to the STATE-REGULATED FINANCIAL INSTITUTION for verification of their financial status and eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-023647e2d4d4ed50a6e5f501c055a8b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FOSTER CARE INCOME&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FOSTER CARE INCOME must be verified as stable income for the BORROWER in the mortgage application process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-023647e2d4d4ed50a6e5f501c055a8b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FOSTER CARE INCOME&quot;" target="&quot;LETTER FROM ORGANIZATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A LETTER FROM ORGANIZATION providing the FOSTER CARE INCOME is necessary for verification purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-023647e2d4d4ed50a6e5f501c055a8b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FOSTER CARE INCOME&quot;" target="&quot;PAY STUBS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"PAY STUBS may be required to support FOSTER CARE INCOME by verifying consistent income sources."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-023647e2d4d4ed50a6e5f501c055a8b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTEREST AND DIVIDENDS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"BORROWER's INTEREST AND DIVIDENDS can contribute to qualifying stable income for the mortgage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-023647e2d4d4ed50a6e5f501c055a8b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTEREST AND DIVIDENDS&quot;" target="&quot;ASSET ELIGIBILITY REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"INTEREST AND DIVIDENDS must be documented in accordance with ASSET ELIGIBILITY REQUIREMENTS for mortgage qualification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-023647e2d4d4ed50a6e5f501c055a8b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTEREST AND DIVIDENDS&quot;" target="&quot;SECURITIES ACCOUNT STATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECURITIES ACCOUNT STATEMENT must be provided to validate INTEREST AND DIVIDENDS for the BORROWER’s income verification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-023647e2d4d4ed50a6e5f501c055a8b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE CREDIT&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The BORROWER is evaluated based on MORTGAGE CREDIT criteria to qualify for a mortgage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-023647e2d4d4ed50a6e5f501c055a8b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MARKET ASSET VERIFICATION&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"MARKET ASSET VERIFICATION is necessary to determine the value of the BORROWER's assets for mortgage qualification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-023647e2d4d4ed50a6e5f501c055a8b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MARKET ASSET VERIFICATION&quot;" target="&quot;VERIFICATION OF ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"MARKET ASSET VERIFICATION is a part of the process used during the VERIFICATION OF ASSETS by the underwriter."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-023647e2d4d4ed50a6e5f501c055a8b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VERIFICATION OF ASSETS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"Verification of Assets entails confirming a borrower's ownership of financial resources which is pivotal in the lending approval process."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE CREDIT CERTIFICATES&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"MORTGAGE CREDIT CERTIFICATES enable eligible borrowers to secure market-rate mortgages while receiving tax credits for mortgage interest payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e28f33ddf3b335e19135327f9afb2b07</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE CREDIT CERTIFICATES&quot;" target="&quot;TAX CREDIT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The tax credit received from mortgage credit certificates supports borrowers by reducing mortgage interest payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e28f33ddf3b335e19135327f9afb2b07</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE CREDIT CERTIFICATES&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE REVENUE BONDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Mortgage credit certificates can be issued as part of the authority to issue mortgage revenue bonds, linking both financial instruments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e28f33ddf3b335e19135327f9afb2b07</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 8 VOUCHER PAYMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 8 voucher payments can be used by borrowers without prior receipt requirements for mortgage applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e28f33ddf3b335e19135327f9afb2b07</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 8 VOUCHER PAYMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC ASSISTANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 8 vouchers are a form of public assistance that can aid borrowers in securing housing benefits."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e28f33ddf3b335e19135327f9afb2b07</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC ASSISTANCE&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Income from public assistance can be considered stable income for borrowers applying for mortgages if it is expected to continue."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e28f33ddf3b335e19135327f9afb2b07</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROFESSIONAL GAMBLER&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Income from professional gambling must be reported as self-employed and documented to qualify for a mortgage as a borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e28f33ddf3b335e19135327f9afb2b07</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THREE-YEAR CONTINUANCE&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Income sources must show a three-year continuance to be considered stable for mortgage qualification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Three-Year Continuance is relevant for the Borrower’s income documentation to ensure that the benefits received are likely to continue for three years."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e28f33ddf3b335e19135327f9afb2b07</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THREE-YEAR CONTINUANCE&quot;" target="&quot;AWARD LETTER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An SSA Award Letter is crucial for confirming that benefits will continue for at least three years for loan qualification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3c5f3698bd3a35ae6c5127d81864d41d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THREE-YEAR CONTINUANCE&quot;" target="&quot;DEPENDENT PARENTS BENEFITS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Dependent parents benefits must likely continue for at least three years, affecting loan eligibility discussions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3c5f3698bd3a35ae6c5127d81864d41d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THREE-YEAR CONTINUANCE&quot;" target="&quot;AGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The age of the beneficiary is a determining factor in the three-year continuance for benefits to be verified by SSA."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THREE-YEAR CONTINUANCE&quot;" target="&quot;BENEFICIARY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The beneficiary's confirmation of age is essential for establishing the three-year continuance of their benefits."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THREE-YEAR CONTINUANCE&quot;" target="&quot;SUPPLEMENT SECURITY INCOME (SSI)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The requirement for a three-year continuance is specifically tied to eligibility for Supplement Security Income (SSI), illustrating their relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTEREST INCOME&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Interest income can contribute to a borrower's overall income assessment when applying for a mortgage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e28f33ddf3b335e19135327f9afb2b07</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DIVIDEND INCOME&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Dividend income needs to be documented and can be factored into the borrower's income for mortgage eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e28f33ddf3b335e19135327f9afb2b07</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOCUMENT EVIDENCE&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Borrowers must provide documented evidence to support claims about their assets and income during the mortgage application process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e28f33ddf3b335e19135327f9afb2b07</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SELF-EMPLOYED INCOME&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Borrowers claiming self-employed income must provide documentation, such as tax returns, to verify their income for mortgage applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e28f33ddf3b335e19135327f9afb2b07</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PENSION INCOME&quot;" target="&quot;IRS W-2&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"IRS W-2 forms are used to document income, including pension income, for verification purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60ae7a36306412ca14db54586048b8bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RETIREMENT INCOME&quot;" target="&quot;IRS 1099&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"IRS 1099 forms are used to verify retirement income received by individuals."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60ae7a36306412ca14db54586048b8bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RETIREMENT INCOME&quot;" target="&quot;401(K) RETIREMENT ACCOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Distribution from a 401(K) retirement account provides a source of retirement income that needs to be verified."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60ae7a36306412ca14db54586048b8bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RETIREMENT INCOME&quot;" target="&quot;KEOGH RETIREMENT ACCOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Keogh retirement accounts also contribute to retirement income, subject to similar documentation requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60ae7a36306412ca14db54586048b8bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RETIREMENT INCOME&quot;" target="&quot;GOVERNMENT ANNUITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A GOVERNMENT ANNUITY can serve as a source of retirement income that must be verified."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60ae7a36306412ca14db54586048b8bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IRS 1099&quot;" target="&quot;DOCUMENTED TERMS OF INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"IRS 1099 forms are used to establish DOCUMENTED TERMS OF INCOME from various sources for verification purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60ae7a36306412ca14db54586048b8bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EFFECTIVE DATE OF INCOME COMMENCEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT FREQUENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both the EFFECTIVE DATE OF INCOME COMMENCEMENT and PAYMENT FREQUENCY are critical to establish the stability of income for underwriting purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60ae7a36306412ca14db54586048b8bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EFFECTIVE DATE OF INCOME COMMENCEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;GOVERNMENT ANNUITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The EFFECTIVE DATE OF INCOME COMMENCEMENT is crucial for assessing the timing of income from a GOVERNMENT ANNUITY."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60ae7a36306412ca14db54586048b8bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT FREQUENCY&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE PAYMENT DUE DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Understanding the PAYMENT FREQUENCY is essential for determining the MORTGAGE PAYMENT DUE DATE compliance in relation to income commencement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60ae7a36306412ca14db54586048b8bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT FREQUENCY&quot;" target="&quot;DISTRIBUTION AMOUNTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"PAYMENT FREQUENCY dictates how DISTRIBUTION AMOUNTS are scheduled and reported for income verification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60ae7a36306412ca14db54586048b8bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT FREQUENCY&quot;" target="&quot;FIXED AMOUNTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The frequency of payments impacts how fixed amounts are assessed in terms of economic stability for the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-95358b428c5f107947a116a0643878c1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT FREQUENCY&quot;" target="&quot;FLUCTUATING AMOUNTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Payment frequency evaluations help determine the impact of fluctuating amounts on the borrower's qualification status."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-95358b428c5f107947a116a0643878c1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT AMOUNT&quot;" target="&quot;CURRENT RECEIPT OF INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"PAYMENT AMOUNT needs to be documented alongside CURRENT RECEIPT OF INCOME to ensure it meets underwriting criteria."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60ae7a36306412ca14db54586048b8bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT AMOUNT&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT DOCUMENTATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"PAYMENT DOCUMENTATION is necessary to validate the PAYMENT AMOUNT for a loan application."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60ae7a36306412ca14db54586048b8bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINANCIAL OR BANK ACCOUNT STATEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;DISTRIBUTION AMOUNTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A FINANCIAL OR BANK ACCOUNT STATEMENT may be used to verify DISTRIBUTION AMOUNTS received from retirement accounts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60ae7a36306412ca14db54586048b8bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DISTRIBUTION AMOUNTS&quot;" target="&quot;HISTORY OF RECEIPT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"HISTORY OF RECEIPT documents may be required to validate the consistency of DISTRIBUTION AMOUNTS to show income stability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60ae7a36306412ca14db54586048b8bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RETIREMENT INCOME GUIDELINES&quot;" target="&quot;RETIREMENT DISTRIBUTION OPTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"RETIREMENT DISTRIBUTION OPTIONS must align with RETIREMENT INCOME GUIDELINES for verification purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60ae7a36306412ca14db54586048b8bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BENEFICIARY VERIFICATION LETTER&quot;" target="&quot;NATURAL PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A NATURAL PERSON often requires a BENEFICIARY VERIFICATION LETTER to confirm their eligibility for certain income sources."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60ae7a36306412ca14db54586048b8bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXCISE TAX PENALTY&quot;" target="&quot;WITHDRAWAL PENALTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both EXCISE TAX PENALTY and WITHDRAWAL PENALTY are associated with premature withdrawals from retirement accounts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60ae7a36306412ca14db54586048b8bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXCISE TAX PENALTY&quot;" target="&quot;RETIREMENT DISTRIBUTION OPTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"EXCISE TAX PENALTY applies to particular RETIREMENT DISTRIBUTION OPTIONS that do not comply with IRS rules."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60ae7a36306412ca14db54586048b8bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUFFICIENT ASSETS&quot;" target="&quot;INCOME SOURCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SUFFICIENT ASSETS must be evaluated against the INCOME SOURCE to ensure financial stability for the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60ae7a36306412ca14db54586048b8bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CURRENT RECEIPT OF INCOME&quot;" target="&quot;DOCUMENTED HISTORY OF RECEIPT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"DOCUMENTED HISTORY OF RECEIPT is necessary to validate CURRENT RECEIPT OF INCOME for consistent income verification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60ae7a36306412ca14db54586048b8bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CURRENT RECEIPT OF INCOME&quot;" target="&quot;FIXED PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Fixed payments must show current receipt to be recognized as stable income."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d3719c6acb29bd52b7e1e409b90cedc6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INCOME SOURCE&quot;" target="&quot;ACCOUNT/WORK RECORD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The account/work record is critical in determining an Income Source for the Borrower, clearly linking these aspects together."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INCOME SOURCE&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC ASSISTANCE PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public Assistance Payments are considered a valid Income Source for the Borrower, connecting these two elements in financial assessments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RETIREMENT ACCOUNT STATEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;WITHDRAWAL PENALTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A WITHDRAWAL PENALTY is relevant when assessing the impact of withdrawals shown on a RETIREMENT ACCOUNT STATEMENT."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-60ae7a36306412ca14db54586048b8bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SOCIAL SECURITY INCOME&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">30.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"Social Security Income can serve as a financial resource to support a borrower's mortgage applications, requiring verification of legitimacy."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower may utilize Social Security Income as a source of income for loan qualification and must provide documentation to verify it."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower can submit Social Security income as part of their financial resources, requiring certain documentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower's qualification can include Social Security income, which must be documented for stability."</data>
  <data key="d6">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bd9610961bbb8effa4b39adbc65bddc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95358b428c5f107947a116a0643878c1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
