  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The executed SSA-3288 is required for the borrower to run verification related to Social Security income."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-95358b428c5f107947a116a0643878c1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SOCIAL SECURITY INCOME&quot;" target="&quot;SSA AWARD LETTER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SSA Award Letter serves as documentation confirming the amount and stability of Social Security income for the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-95358b428c5f107947a116a0643878c1</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
