  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Beneficiary receives Social Security Income, establishing a direct link between the two entities in terms of benefits received."&lt;SEP&gt;"The beneficiary is directly related to the receipt of Social Security Income, linking them in terms of eligibility and benefit verification."</data>
