  <data key="d4">25.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ADUs are highlighted in the rental income calculation process and must be supported by comparable rentals for market rent analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rental income can be generated from an ADU, impacting mortgage qualifications and financial assessments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The ADU generates rental income, which is subject to specific underwriting guidelines and appraisal requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7a01c4d224477788cf5c6bfd6ccc84e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cea98d6086733276bdd5c19993c4deb7</data>
