  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Vacancy losses are factored into the calculation of monthly net rental income which reduces the overall income reported."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d8864c52069485823a39babaa2b2005e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
