  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SCHEDULE 1 is part of the federal income tax return that may include additional income which is relevant for qualifying income calculations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fb02bde5abfff1b16d83434416df7465</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE 1&quot;" target="&quot;ALLOWABLE QUALIFYING INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SCHEDULE 1 may contribute to the ALLOWABLE QUALIFYING INCOME calculations for the BORROWER when reporting income."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fb02bde5abfff1b16d83434416df7465</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE E&quot;" target="&quot;FAIR RENTAL DAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Fair Rental Days are reported on Schedule E to indicate the rental utilization of a property."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule E must reflect Fair Rental Days as part of the documentation for rental income reporting."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1578b8b51044019bfff38a69eecab0be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81edfb1496d26226dca5f3238aa461cd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE E&quot;" target="&quot;FEDERAL INCOME TAX RETURN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">34.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SCHEDULE E is included in the federal income tax return to report rental income and expenses."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule E is a component of the federal income tax return that reports rental income and related expenses."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule E is included in the federal income tax return to substantiate rental income received homeowners."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule E is used to report rental income on the federal income tax return."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1578b8b51044019bfff38a69eecab0be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81edfb1496d26226dca5f3238aa461cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb02bde5abfff1b16d83434416df7465</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE E&quot;" target="&quot;REPAIR EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"REPAIR EXPENSES are reported on SCHEDULE E of the federal income tax return, impacting rental income calculations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Repair expenses must be reported in Schedule E to reflect costs related to the rental property and its management."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1578b8b51044019bfff38a69eecab0be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb02bde5abfff1b16d83434416df7465</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE E&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower needs to include Schedule E in their federal income tax return to report rental income, which plays a role in their financial assessment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-48dc06181f6c67399f82ff0110257532</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE E&quot;" target="&quot;CONVENTIONAL UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SCHEDULE E serves as a foundational document under CONVENTIONAL UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES to verify rental income."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fb02bde5abfff1b16d83434416df7465</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE E&quot;" target="&quot;TAX FILING YEAR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The tax filing year must correspond with Schedule E to affirm rental income and expenses were reported accurately for the property."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-10ce55972cf12e21fd77796ab69a96ca</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE E&quot;" target="&quot;NET RENTAL INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Schedule E is used to reflect income and supports the determination of net rental income."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-151a292558f7e1fe4b393da7f73632a9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE E&quot;" target="&quot;REPAIR COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Schedule E reflects repair costs, which are relevant in determining net rental income showcased in the lease."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-151a292558f7e1fe4b393da7f73632a9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE E&quot;" target="&quot;DAYS IN USE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Schedule E must support the reduced number of days in use when determining income for the ADU rental analysis."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-151a292558f7e1fe4b393da7f73632a9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE E&quot;" target="&quot;VACANCIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Vacancies directly impact the financial reporting and calculations presented on Schedule E for rental income analysis."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cea98d6086733276bdd5c19993c4deb7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
