  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The history of receiving rental income can impact the evaluation of the current lease agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f7c7059ebd575d1369f6649db3e25ee4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HISTORY OF RECEIVING RENTAL INCOME&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower's history of receiving rental income is important for understanding their financial stability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f7c7059ebd575d1369f6649db3e25ee4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NET RENTAL INCOME&quot;" target="&quot;VACANCY LOSSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"VACANCY LOSSES are factored into calculating NET RENTAL INCOME impacting the overall cash flow from the rental property."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vacancy losses affect the calculation of net rental income, as they reduce the overall income stream from rental properties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f7c7059ebd575d1369f6649db3e25ee4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb02bde5abfff1b16d83434416df7465</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NET RENTAL INCOME&quot;" target="&quot;ONGOING MAINTENANCE EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ONGOING MAINTENANCE EXPENSES are deducted when calculating the NET RENTAL INCOME, affecting profitability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ongoing maintenance expenses reduce the net rental income by being deducted from gross income."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f7c7059ebd575d1369f6649db3e25ee4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb02bde5abfff1b16d83434416df7465</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
