  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Documented property management experience can be supported by a current lease agreement showing active rental arrangements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-48dc06181f6c67399f82ff0110257532</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VACANCY LOSSES&quot;" target="&quot;GROSS RENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Gross rent is affected by vacancy losses, representing a deduction from the total rental income."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d1fc933db1bd6fd3476c94d029ad8540</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VACANCY LOSSES&quot;" target="&quot;MAINTENANCE EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both maintenance expenses and vacancy losses are factors that affect the net rental income by reducing the gross rental income."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vacancy losses impact the net cash flow from the rental property and must be accounted for alongside maintenance expenses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d1fc933db1bd6fd3476c94d029ad8540&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48dc06181f6c67399f82ff0110257532</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VACANCY LOSSES&quot;" target="&quot;EXTENDED PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Extended periods of vacancy directly impact the financial assessment of rent and contribute to losses in rental income."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-48dc06181f6c67399f82ff0110257532</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VACANCY LOSSES&quot;" target="&quot;ONGOING MAINTENANCE EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both vacancy losses and ongoing maintenance expenses are deducted from gross rental income to determine net rental income."&lt;SEP&gt;"VACANCY LOSSES and ONGOING MAINTENANCE EXPENSES are both considered in the financial assessment of rental properties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fb02bde5abfff1b16d83434416df7465&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8864c52069485823a39babaa2b2005e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VACANCY LOSSES&quot;" target="&quot;VACANCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Vacancy refers to unoccupied rental spaces which directly contribute to the calculation of vacancy losses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d8864c52069485823a39babaa2b2005e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
