  <data key="d4">11.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Maintenance expenses may include costs related to renovations that are necessary for the upkeep of the rental property."&lt;SEP&gt;"Renovation costs can be categorized as maintenance expenses if they support the ongoing condition of the rental property."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d1fc933db1bd6fd3476c94d029ad8540</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN EXCEPTION&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
