  <data key="d6">chunk-7a01c4d224477788cf5c6bfd6ccc84e2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTINGENT WORKER&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRACTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Contingent workers may be classified similarly to contractors, both providing services under different employment conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cea98d6086733276bdd5c19993c4deb7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTINGENT WORKER&quot;" target="&quot;SCHEDULE C&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Contingent workers may report their income on Schedule C if they are classified as self-employed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cea98d6086733276bdd5c19993c4deb7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ZONING&quot;" target="&quot;WETLANDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Zoning regulations related to wetlands affect land use and property development, impacting property value."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bd684789b748cb20186f7859db539838</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ZONING&quot;" target="&quot;HIGHEST AND BEST USE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Zoning regulations impact the HIGHEST AND BEST USE analysis for determining the value of a property."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bd684789b748cb20186f7859db539838</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ZONING&quot;" target="&quot;TYPE F PUD PROJECT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Type F PUD projects must adhere to zoning laws, which outline permissible uses and density for new developments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5e26a3be3838ff40fb61edfe66e0268a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE C&quot;" target="&quot;GROSS RECEIPTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Schedule C requires gross receipts to be equal to amounts reported on IRS Form 1099, ensuring consistency in income reporting."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cea98d6086733276bdd5c19993c4deb7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE C&quot;" target="&quot;EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Expenses reported on Schedule C directly affect the income calculation from the borrower's gross receipts reported on the IRS Form 1099."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0ed1a879d48c49b16f42ce89ae56d954</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE C&quot;" target="&quot;SOLE PROPRIETORSHIP&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A sole proprietorship's income is documented using Schedule C, which is integral for verifying the borrower's income for mortgage approval."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-332ea40a8706fdd85456078cf47232fe</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE C&quot;" target="&quot;SOLE PROPRIETORSHIPS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sole proprietorships report their income and expenses on Schedule C of the federal individual income tax return."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d14191b10a7b641a859301abcf2d9873</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
