  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower must provide YTD paystubs as documentation to verify stable monthly income received for mortgage applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cea98d6086733276bdd5c19993c4deb7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;YTD PAYSTUBS&quot;" target="&quot;GROSS RECEIPTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"YTD paystubs can be used to establish gross receipts for the borrower in conjunction with IRS Form 1099 documentation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cea98d6086733276bdd5c19993c4deb7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CALCULATION EXAMPLE&quot;" target="&quot;CONVENTIONAL UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Calculation examples illustrate how to apply the conventional underwriting guidelines in practical scenarios."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cea98d6086733276bdd5c19993c4deb7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;YTD INCOME&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"YTD income reflects the borrower's current earnings, verified for the most recent months, which is crucial for underwriting decisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0ed1a879d48c49b16f42ce89ae56d954</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
