  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"YTD paystubs provide a real-time view of the borrower's income, supporting the year-to-date income evaluation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0ed1a879d48c49b16f42ce89ae56d954</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;W-2&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"W-2 forms provide verification of income from employment, necessary for assessing the borrower's financial stability alongside self-employment income."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-332ea40a8706fdd85456078cf47232fe</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
