  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"K-1 forms are generated from IRS Form 1065, indicating each partner's income and their potential eligibility for mortgage approval."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-332ea40a8706fdd85456078cf47232fe</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IRS FORM 1065&quot;" target="&quot;PARTNERSHIPS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Partnerships use IRS Form 1065 to report their income and losses to the IRS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d14191b10a7b641a859301abcf2d9873</data>
