  <data key="d4">24.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"IRS Form 1065 generates Schedule K-1 which reports each partner's share of income or loss."&lt;SEP&gt;"Partnerships must report individual partner income on Schedule K-1, which is associated with IRS Form 1065."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule K-1 is generated from IRS Form 1065 to report income, deductions, and credits from a partnership for the partners' tax returns."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d14191b10a7b641a859301abcf2d9873&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-398938dbff78b05d0c3830d36e6918b6</data>
