  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both forms are used to report business income and are relevant for determining qualification criteria based on ownership shares in a business."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-398938dbff78b05d0c3830d36e6918b6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IRS FORM 1120S&quot;" target="&quot;S CORPORATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
