  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Conventional underwriting guidelines determine the criteria for mortgage approval, including evaluations of the borrower's self-employment income stability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-332ea40a8706fdd85456078cf47232fe</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEMAND FOR PRODUCT&quot;" target="&quot;NATURE OF BUSINESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The demand for the product relates closely to the nature of the business, influencing the income potential for the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-332ea40a8706fdd85456078cf47232fe</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUSINESS CASH FLOW ADJUSTMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;ORDINARY BUSINESS INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Adjustments to business cash flow may affect the amount of ordinary business income considered for mortgage qualification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d14191b10a7b641a859301abcf2d9873</data>
