<edge source="&quot;LOAN TARGETING&quot;" target="&quot;FREDDIE MAC&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Freddie Mac utilizes specific loan targeting criteria to determine eligible properties for mortgage financing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-137c762b3ac588b243786790757dd239</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPARABLE SALE&quot;" target="&quot;FINAL APPRAISAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Comparable sales are used to assess value in the final appraisal process, ensuring market relevance in property evaluations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-137c762b3ac588b243786790757dd239</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPARABLE SALE&quot;" target="&quot;ASSESSMENT CRITERIA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Comparable sales are essential in forming assessment criteria to establish property values that reflect the market accurately."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-137c762b3ac588b243786790757dd239</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROPERTY ALTERATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;FINAL APPRAISAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Property alterations must be assessed prior to final appraisal to ensure compliance with eligibility criteria set by lenders."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-137c762b3ac588b243786790757dd239</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINAL APPRAISAL&quot;" target="&quot;ASSESSMENT CRITERIA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Assessment criteria guide the determination of the final appraisal value, establishing standards for property assessments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-137c762b3ac588b243786790757dd239</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINAL APPRAISAL&quot;" target="&quot;APPRAISAL COMPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Appraisal compliance ensures that the final appraisal adheres to necessary guidelines and regulations before loan closing is finalized."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-137c762b3ac588b243786790757dd239</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINAL APPRAISAL&quot;" target="&quot;FINAL CONDITIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Final conditions are necessary and must be verified before the final appraisal is rendered, affecting the property’s eligibility and valuation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-137c762b3ac588b243786790757dd239</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINAL APPRAISAL&quot;" target="&quot;INSPECTION OF THE PROPERTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The final appraisal is contingent on an inspection of the property, ensuring that the appraisal reflects true conditions and compliance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-137c762b3ac588b243786790757dd239</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NATIONAL APPRAISAL STANDARDS&quot;" target="&quot;APPRAISAL GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Appraisal guidelines are developed in accordance with national appraisal standards to ensure consistency and compliance in property evaluations."&lt;SEP&gt;"National appraisal standards inform appraisal guidelines, ensuring compliance with industry norms in property valuation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-137c762b3ac588b243786790757dd239</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NATIONAL APPRAISAL STANDARDS&quot;" target="&quot;APPRAISAL COMPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Appraisal compliance is measured against national appraisal standards to ensure quality and adherence to industry practices."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-137c762b3ac588b243786790757dd239</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONDITION C5 AND C6&quot;" target="&quot;FREDDIE MAC&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Properties rated C5 and C6 are ineligible under Freddie Mac's guidelines, highlighting the importance of condition ratings in loan eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-137c762b3ac588b243786790757dd239</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPRAISER'S QUALIFICATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;APPRAISAL GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The qualifications of the appraiser are part of the appraisal guidelines, ensuring only qualified professionals conduct appraisals."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-137c762b3ac588b243786790757dd239</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPRAISAL GUIDELINES&quot;" target="&quot;UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
