  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The INCOME APPROACH is considered alongside the market approach in the final VALUATION RECONCILIATION, reflecting their interdependence in appraising properties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-24638398312c4aec93c00e795739cbf9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INCOME APPROACH&quot;" target="&quot;RENTAL MARKET&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The INCOME APPROACH assesses the potential of the RENTAL MARKET for valuing income-generating properties, highlighting their relationship in real estate evaluation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-24638398312c4aec93c00e795739cbf9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPARABLE SALES&quot;" target="&quot;COMPARABLE RENT SCHEDULE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"COMPARABLE SALES are used to support valuations derived from the COMPARABLE RENT SCHEDULE, indicating their relationship in the appraisal process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-24638398312c4aec93c00e795739cbf9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPARABLE SALES&quot;" target="&quot;DECLINING MARKET&quot;">
  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"In a DECLINING MARKET, the appraiser must select COMPARABLE SALES carefully to ensure accurate valuation, highlighting their critical relationship in appraisal accuracy."&lt;SEP&gt;"In a declining market, the choice of comparables is particularly critical, as the appraiser must select recent sales for accurate assessment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-24638398312c4aec93c00e795739cbf9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea0854aedb400acc54c26d78db5065c4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPARABLE SALES&quot;" target="&quot;RURAL PROPERTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Rural properties may present unique challenges in finding comparable sales, affecting the appraisal process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ea0854aedb400acc54c26d78db5065c4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPARABLE SALES&quot;" target="&quot;COMPARABLE PROJECTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Comparable sales can be compared to comparable projects to assess the value and market trends."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-42fe7768b333d42fc15f00fc4e0ba0d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
