<edge source="&quot;CONTAMINATED SITE&quot;" target="&quot;HAZARDOUS SUBSTANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">37.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A contaminated site is directly associated with the presence of hazardous substances, impacting property evaluations."&lt;SEP&gt;"A contaminated site often indicates the presence of hazardous substances, establishing a direct relationship regarding property assessments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Properties located in a contaminated site are assessed for hazardous substances, linking these two concepts in property evaluation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Properties located on contaminated sites may have hazardous substances, directly connecting these terms in property condition assessments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4de71275bc933c2c228984f601d0e0a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91cf1d5ee6d1d8b224c54c5417b6eaee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f443d70c1b97ab92c6f9f441ec9ced99</data>
