</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MINOR CLERICAL ERRORS&quot;" target="&quot;AMENDMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Amendments to contracts can involve corrections of minor clerical errors, connecting the two processes in documentation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f443d70c1b97ab92c6f9f441ec9ced99</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROPERTY LEASES&quot;" target="&quot;FINANCIAL EVALUATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Property leases are often included in financial evaluations, linking income potential to evaluations of property worth."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f443d70c1b97ab92c6f9f441ec9ced99</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
