  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FANNIE MAE requires appraisals to comply with the standards set by the AMERICAN NATIONAL STANDARDS INSTITUTE (ANSI) for measuring gross living area."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c1eb0558635c4f1b731b5f38c1ed9bb7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AMERICAN NATIONAL STANDARDS INSTITUTE&quot;" target="&quot;ANSI STANDARDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The AMERICAN NATIONAL STANDARDS INSTITUTE establishes ANSI STANDARDS for measuring square footage in appraisals."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c1eb0558635c4f1b731b5f38c1ed9bb7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ANSI STANDARDS&quot;" target="&quot;SQUARE FOOTAGE-METHOD FOR CALCULATING ANSI STANDARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SQUARE FOOTAGE-METHOD is a specific calculation method based on ANSI STANDARDS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c1eb0558635c4f1b731b5f38c1ed9bb7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUILDING SKETCHES OR FLOOR PLANS&quot;" target="&quot;FLOOR PLANS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FLOOR PLANS are part of BUILDING SKETCHES or FLOOR PLANS required for appraisals."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c1eb0558635c4f1b731b5f38c1ed9bb7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUILDING SKETCHES OR FLOOR PLANS&quot;" target="&quot;DIMENSIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"BUILDING SKETCHES OR FLOOR PLANS must include DIMENSIONS to derive gross living area."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c1eb0558635c4f1b731b5f38c1ed9bb7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUILDING SKETCHES OR FLOOR PLANS&quot;" target="&quot;LABELS FOR EACH ROOM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"LABELS FOR EACH ROOM must be included in BUILDING SKETCHES OR FLOOR PLANS to provide clarity on space usage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c1eb0558635c4f1b731b5f38c1ed9bb7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
