  <data key="d6">chunk-c1eb0558635c4f1b731b5f38c1ed9bb7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FLOOR PLANS&quot;" target="&quot;CONDO OR CO-OP PROJECT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Floor plans for condo or co-op projects are specifically addressed in the guidelines to ensure accurate valuation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e98d878b21daedfefbf36b036612418f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FLOOR PLANS&quot;" target="&quot;SQUARE FEET&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Square feet measurements are included in floor plans to assess the size of the subject property accurately."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e98d878b21daedfefbf36b036612418f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FLOOR PLANS&quot;" target="&quot;VALUATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Accurate floor plans are necessary for proper valuation of the subject property."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e98d878b21daedfefbf36b036612418f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DIMENSIONS&quot;" target="&quot;EXTERIOR WALLS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"DIMENSIONS of the property includes measurements of EXTERIOR WALLS as part of the appraisal requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c1eb0558635c4f1b731b5f38c1ed9bb7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
