  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ADJUSTMENTS FOR BELOW-GRADE AREAS may relate to the asessment of EXTERIOR WALLS for their contribution to property value."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c1eb0558635c4f1b731b5f38c1ed9bb7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPRAISAL REPORTS&quot;" target="&quot;CONVENTIONAL UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The guidelines set standards for what must be included and considered in appraisal reports."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e98d878b21daedfefbf36b036612418f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPRAISAL REPORTS&quot;" target="&quot;APPRAISERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Appraisers are responsible for preparing the appraisal reports which analyze the subject property."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e98d878b21daedfefbf36b036612418f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPRAISAL REPORTS&quot;" target="&quot;GBA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Appraisal reports require calculations of the Gross Building Area (GBA) to assess the subject property accurately."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e98d878b21daedfefbf36b036612418f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPRAISAL REPORTS&quot;" target="&quot;FREDDIE MAC&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Freddie Mac sets the standards and guidelines that govern the content and requirements of appraisal reports."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e98d878b21daedfefbf36b036612418f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPRAISAL REPORTS&quot;" target="&quot;PERSONAL INSPECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Appraisal reports require a personal inspection to provide an accurate evaluation of the property."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e98d878b21daedfefbf36b036612418f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPRAISAL REPORTS&quot;" target="&quot;ADVERSE INFLUENCES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Appraisal reports must comment on any adverse influences affecting the subject property."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e98d878b21daedfefbf36b036612418f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;VALUATION&quot;" target="&quot;PROTECTED CLASS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Valuation must not be influenced by any protected class, ensuring fairness and compliance with anti-discrimination laws."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e98d878b21daedfefbf36b036612418f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPRAISERS&quot;" target="&quot;PERSONAL INSPECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Appraisers are required to conduct personal inspections to accurately evaluate the properties in their reports."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e98d878b21daedfefbf36b036612418f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPRAISERS&quot;" target="&quot;CONVENTIONAL UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Appraisers must follow the conventional underwriting guidelines when conducting appraisals."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e98d878b21daedfefbf36b036612418f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPRAISERS&quot;" target="&quot;SALES COMPARABLES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Appraisers use sales comparables to support their conclusions about the value of the subject property."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e98d878b21daedfefbf36b036612418f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPRAISERS&quot;" target="&quot;ADVERSE INFLUENCES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Appraisers must consider adverse influences when making a valuation judgment on the subject property."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e98d878b21daedfefbf36b036612418f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROTECTED CLASS&quot;" target="&quot;GBA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Gross Building Area (GBA) must be assessed without discrimination related to any protected class when evaluating properties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e98d878b21daedfefbf36b036612418f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PROTECTED CLASS&quot;" target="&quot;FREDDIE MAC&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Freddie Mac's guidelines specifically prohibit discrimination based on protected classes during the appraisal process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e98d878b21daedfefbf36b036612418f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPETITIVE PROPERTIES&quot;" target="&quot; NEIGHBORHOOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The neighborhood context is essential in assessing the value and competitiveness of the properties in appraisals."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e98d878b21daedfefbf36b036612418f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WETLANDS&quot;" target="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL HAZARDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The presence of ENVIRONMENTAL HAZARDS can complicate considerations related to WETLANDS during property evaluations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bd684789b748cb20186f7859db539838</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SITE/VIEW ADJUSTMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;ADJUSTED VALUE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Site/view adjustments significantly influence the final ADJUSTED VALUE of the property in an appraisal."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bd684789b748cb20186f7859db539838</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WELL AND SEPTIC&quot;" target="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL HAZARDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Concerns regarding wells and septic systems are heightened in areas with ENVIRONMENTAL HAZARDS, affecting appraisal evaluations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bd684789b748cb20186f7859db539838</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SOLAR PANELS&quot;" target="&quot;UCC-1 FINANCING STATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The UCC-1 Financing Statement is associated with the solar panels, indicating a financial interest or lien on them."&lt;SEP&gt;"The UCC-1 Financing Statement is related to the solar panels, indicating a legal claim on them as collateral."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-37ec0ad59b15ed4e4c83850695f40593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6434821b2faf91ece4b375276017b775</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SOLAR PANELS&quot;" target="&quot;POWER PURCHASE AGREEMENT (PPA)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Solar panels can be financed through a Power Purchase Agreement, indicating a direct funding mechanism for their installation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The PPA indicates that the Borrower purchases power produced by the solar panels, illustrating a transaction relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6434821b2faf91ece4b375276017b775&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3eb9a9047b04f55e775ab1675823f162</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SOLAR PANELS&quot;" target="&quot;SOLAR POWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">27.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Solar Power is generated by Solar Panels, making them inherently related as components of solar energy systems."&lt;SEP&gt;"Solar Power is generated through the use of Solar Panels, which are essential for capturing solar energy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Solar Power is produced by the Solar Panels, indicating a functional relationship where one depends on the other."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-645973893eaf0e8d2eb4a7822c3fe6eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2c659b65edef4a5e599f9445602b752&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6434821b2faf91ece4b375276017b775</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SOLAR PANELS&quot;" target="&quot;PPA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Solar panels can be financed under a Power Purchase Agreement (PPA), indicating a financial relationship between the two."&lt;SEP&gt;"The PPA outlines payment structures for solar panels based on energy production, affecting financial metrics related to them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-37ec0ad59b15ed4e4c83850695f40593</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SOLAR PANELS&quot;" target="&quot;TOTAL LOAN-TO-VALUE RATIO&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Solar Panels might be included or excluded in the Total Loan-to-Value Ratio calculations depending on financing conditions "</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e2c659b65edef4a5e599f9445602b752</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SOLAR PANELS&quot;" target="&quot;HOMEOWNER'S INSURANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Homeowner's insurance policies must account for the presence of solar panels and stipulate the liability of the panel owner."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-645973893eaf0e8d2eb4a7822c3fe6eb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NON-CONFORMING PROPERTY USE&quot;" target="&quot;ADVERSE EFFECT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The analysis of NON-CONFORMING PROPERTY USE must reflect any ADVERSE EFFECT it has on property value and marketability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bd684789b748cb20186f7859db539838</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HIGHEST AND BEST USE&quot;" target="&quot;ADVERSE EFFECT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Any ADVERSE EFFECT from non-conforming uses must be considered in establishing the HIGHEST AND BEST USE of a property."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bd684789b748cb20186f7859db539838</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADJUSTED VALUE&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN-TO-VALUE CALCULATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ADJUSTED VALUE is critical in determining the LOAN-TO-VALUE CALCULATIONS for financing decisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bd684789b748cb20186f7859db539838</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPENSATION&quot;" target="&quot;FINANCIAL INTEREST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Developing appraisals must avoid conflicts of interest related to FINANCIAL INTEREST to prevent biased COMPENSATION decisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bd684789b748cb20186f7859db539838</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINANCIAL INTEREST&quot;" target="&quot;SALES DATA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SALES DATA sourced from parties with a FINANCIAL INTEREST must be verified to ensure neutrality in appraisals."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bd684789b748cb20186f7859db539838</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COLLATERAL&quot;" target="&quot;FINANCING STATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Financing Statement indicates that the collateral includes the Solar Panels, highlighting a financial security relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6434821b2faf91ece4b375276017b775</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LAND RECORDS&quot;" target="&quot;DEED OF TRUST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A deed of trust must be recorded in land records to evidence the purchase and financing of manufactured homes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cf0031128e81eed5883f39146514f546</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SOLAR POWER&quot;" target="&quot;APPRAISAL COLLATERAL EVALUATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The evaluation of solar power systems is considered in the appraisal collateral evaluation process for properties with solar panels."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-645973893eaf0e8d2eb4a7822c3fe6eb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SOLAR POWER&quot;" target="&quot;UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Solar Power guidelines are included within the broader underwriting guidelines, particularly regarding the eligibility of financing solar panel installations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-645973893eaf0e8d2eb4a7822c3fe6eb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;POWER PURCHASE AGREEMENT (PPA)&quot;" target="&quot;INSTALLATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Power Purchase Agreement is required to facilitate the installation of solar panels on a real property."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3eb9a9047b04f55e775ab1675823f162</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEBT PAYMENT-TO-INCOME RATIO&quot;" target="&quot;DEBT PAYMENT-TO-INCOME RATIO&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The DTI ratio is essential in evaluating a borrower's ability to repay a loan, with specific provisions for solar panel payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-37ec0ad59b15ed4e4c83850695f40593</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENERGY PRODUCTION GUARANTEE&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower is typically guaranteed compensation under the Energy Production Guarantee if Solar Panels fail to meet expected energy output levels."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e2c659b65edef4a5e599f9445602b752</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOMEOWNER’S INSURANCE&quot;" target="&quot;DAMAGE RESPONSIBILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The homeowner must manage damage responsibility regarding solar panels, which influences their homeowner's insurance policy."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3eb9a9047b04f55e775ab1675823f162</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ELIGIBILITY FOR USE OF AN APPRAISAL WAIVER&quot;" target="&quot;APPRAISAL COLLATERAL EVALUATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Eligibility for use of an appraisal waiver is contingent upon fulfilling the conditions set by appraisal collateral evaluations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3eb9a9047b04f55e775ab1675823f162</data>
