  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Liability insurance is commonly required for the homeowners association to cover risks associated with communal property areas."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3455e52007c02e364a735d4c4a7efa70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOMEOWNERS ASSOCIATION&quot;" target="&quot;VOTING RIGHTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The lease provides for the BORROWER to retain VOTING RIGHTS in the HOMEOWNERS ASSOCIATION, establishing a decision-making connection."&lt;SEP&gt;"VOTING RIGHTS are fundamental for participation in the governance of the HOMEOWNERS ASSOCIATION, promoting engagement among members."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3ca2c4d1778a11943201b4e917c15322</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOMEOWNERS ASSOCIATION&quot;" target="&quot;PLANNED UNIT DEVELOPMENT (PUD)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A planned unit development is administered by a homeowners association, which is essential for maintenance and property oversight."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5e26a3be3838ff40fb61edfe66e0268a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOMEOWNERS ASSOCIATION&quot;" target="&quot;TYPE E PUD PROJECT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Type E PUD projects require strong homeowners association management for effective administration and maintenance of common areas."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5e26a3be3838ff40fb61edfe66e0268a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONDOMINIUM PROJECT&quot;" target="&quot;DETACHED UNITS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Detached units can be part of a condominium project, defining their relationship within property classifications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3455e52007c02e364a735d4c4a7efa70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONDOMINIUM PROJECT&quot;" target="&quot;SEGMENTED OWNERSHIP&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Segmented ownership is a concept that can affect various condominium projects, particularly those with differing ownership structures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3455e52007c02e364a735d4c4a7efa70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONDOMINIUM PROJECT&quot;" target="&quot;PLANNED UNIT DEVELOPMENT (PUD)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Condominium Projects and Planned Unit Developments (PUDs) are eligible property types for financing within the affordable housing program framework."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-787de407af176e62ce6eb517b2dd1d21</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DETACHED UNITS&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Mortgages can be specifically secured for detached units within a condominium project, highlighting their financial relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3455e52007c02e364a735d4c4a7efa70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TITLE INSURANCE POLICY&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A title insurance policy is often required to ensure the validity of ownership in relation to the mortgage for detached condominiums."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3455e52007c02e364a735d4c4a7efa70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDY PROVIDER&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The subsidy provider sets specific eligibility criteria that borrowers must satisfy for affordability-related deed restrictions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8cfec8ddeaba989b347c8cc9daa583b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDY PROVIDER&quot;" target="&quot;ELIGIBLE SUBSIDY PROVIDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Eligible subsidy providers are the organizations approved to issue subsidies and administer related programs required for borrower support."&lt;SEP&gt;"The subsidy provider includes various organizations such as nonprofits and municipalities that can administer subsidy programs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8cfec8ddeaba989b347c8cc9daa583b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDY PROVIDER&quot;" target="&quot;DEFAULT OR REFINANCING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The subsidy provider retains rights related to properties in default or foreclosure, impacting borrower options for refinancing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8cfec8ddeaba989b347c8cc9daa583b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDY PROVIDER&quot;" target="&quot;UNIVERSITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Universities may act as eligible subsidy providers, contributing to the range of organizations that offer assistance to borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8cfec8ddeaba989b347c8cc9daa583b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDY PROVIDER&quot;" target="&quot;HOUSING AGENCIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Housing agencies are a primary type of eligible subsidy provider involved in administering government-subsidized programs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8cfec8ddeaba989b347c8cc9daa583b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDY PROVIDER&quot;" target="&quot;AGE-RELATED DEED RESTRICTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The subsidy provider establishes age-related deed restrictions that impact both borrower qualifications and property occupancy."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8cfec8ddeaba989b347c8cc9daa583b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDY PROVIDER&quot;" target="&quot;ENABLING AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The subsidy provider may have a right of first refusal granted by an enabling authority, as per resale restrictions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d635e8ee0ac48c5c8906a09d9d6759ba</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDY PROVIDER&quot;" target="&quot;AFFORDABLE HOUSING PROGRAMS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subsidy providers play a key role in affordable housing programs by offering financial assistance to lower housing costs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d635e8ee0ac48c5c8906a09d9d6759ba</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDY PROVIDER&quot;" target="&quot;AFFORDABLE SECOND&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Affordable Second is a financial product that requires a subsidy provider to offer assistance in the form of subsidizing property sales prices."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-787de407af176e62ce6eb517b2dd1d21</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDY PROVIDER&quot;" target="&quot;ELIGIBLE BUYERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The subsidy provider has the option to transfer their purchase option to eligible buyers, linking both entities in housing transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-787de407af176e62ce6eb517b2dd1d21</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDY PROVIDER&quot;" target="&quot;THIRD-PARTY NON-PROFIT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A third-party non-profit can act as a program administrator for subsidy providers, managing the distribution of financial assistance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-787de407af176e62ce6eb517b2dd1d21</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGE-RELATED DEED RESTRICTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Age-related deed restrictions impose specific conditions that borrowers must adhere to regarding the age of unit occupants."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8cfec8ddeaba989b347c8cc9daa583b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGE-RELATED DEED RESTRICTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;HOMEREADY MORTGAGE LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Age-related deed restrictions can influence the eligibility criteria for borrowers qualified for HomeReady mortgage loans."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8cfec8ddeaba989b347c8cc9daa583b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
