  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Closing costs/prepaids are a component of the overall total cost to borrower, linking their financial implications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6d048ce21946dbbaf2025fa9d108f909</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TOTAL COST TO BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;CLOSING COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Closing costs are part of the total cost to the borrower, making them inherently connected in financial calculations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6d048ce21946dbbaf2025fa9d108f909</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
