  <data key="d4">11.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"In cases of REO, excess proceeds may be discussed, but are restricted based on guidelines after foreclosure."&lt;SEP&gt;"REO properties could lead to excess proceeds after sale, which is subject to restrictions for subsidy providers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d635e8ee0ac48c5c8906a09d9d6759ba</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
