<edge source="&quot;APPRAISAL REQUIREMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;FLAGSTAR BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.1</data>
  <data key="d5">"Flagstar Bank adheres to specific appraisal requirements outlined for various property types to facilitate financing."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MARKET SALE PRICE&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSIDIZED SALES PRICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The subsidized sales price is determined based on the market sale price after applying certain restrictions and subsidies."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-787de407af176e62ce6eb517b2dd1d21</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INCOME-BASED RESALE RESTRICTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSIDY PROVIDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subsidy providers may impose income-based resale restrictions that affect the financial structuring of transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-756642bc27ab7956732455451eb4ce71</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REAL ESTATE OWNED (REO)&quot;" target="&quot;FREDDIE MAC&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Freddie Mac acquires title to properties that become Real Estate Owned (REO) when they are not sold at foreclosure, affecting their resale restrictions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-787de407af176e62ce6eb517b2dd1d21</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CAPITAL IMPROVEMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;SCREENING PROCEDURES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"There are procedures in place for approving capital improvements, closely tied to the screening procedures for applicants."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-787de407af176e62ce6eb517b2dd1d21</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CAPITAL IMPROVEMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower can receive credits for costs associated with capital improvements, impacting their financial obligations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-756642bc27ab7956732455451eb4ce71</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL HAZARD&quot;" target="&quot;HAZARDOUS CONDITIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Environmental hazards contribute to the classification of hazardous conditions affecting property decisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hazardous conditions can represent environmental hazards that affect property values and loan eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-756642bc27ab7956732455451eb4ce71</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL HAZARD&quot;" target="&quot;INELIGIBLE PROPERTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Ineligible properties include those affected by environmental hazards that disqualify them for certain loans."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cefb0ad4148eab93b794bfdc3eb3eac7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL RISK EXPOSURE&quot;" target="&quot;CONTAMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Environmental risk exposure often entails the possibility or occurrence of contamination, affecting property conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-756642bc27ab7956732455451eb4ce71</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SFC 630&quot;" target="&quot;SFC 631&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both codes relate to different conditions under which resale restrictions apply to properties, influencing underwriting decisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"These special feature codes outline different treatment for properties with income-based resale restrictions, facilitating compliance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-756642bc27ab7956732455451eb4ce71</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTAMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;HAZARDOUS SUBSTANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Contamination typically involves hazardous substances that pose a risk and must be disclosed in transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-756642bc27ab7956732455451eb4ce71</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HAZARDOUS SITE DISCLOSURE&quot;" target="&quot;HAZARDOUS SUBSTANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Hazardous substances must be disclosed at hazardous sites according to legal guidelines, affecting property transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-756642bc27ab7956732455451eb4ce71</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL RISK&quot;" target="&quot;MOLD REMEDIATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Mold remediation is a necessary procedure when environmental risks are present, impacting property safety and marketability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-756642bc27ab7956732455451eb4ce71</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL RISK&quot;" target="&quot;RADON TESTING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Radon testing is part of assessing environmental risk in properties, ensuring safety for potential buyers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-756642bc27ab7956732455451eb4ce71</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL RISK&quot;" target="&quot;CONTAMINATION EVENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Environmental risks can arise from contamination events, directly impacting property assessments and market value."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-756642bc27ab7956732455451eb4ce71</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HAZARDOUS SUBSTANCES&quot;" target="&quot;WASTE TREATMENT FACILITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Proximity to hazardous substances often correlates with nearby waste treatment facilities, impacting property safety."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cefb0ad4148eab93b794bfdc3eb3eac7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HAZARDOUS SUBSTANCES&quot;" target="&quot;INDUSTRIAL SITES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Hazardous substances can be linked to industrial sites, which may pose risks to nearby properties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cefb0ad4148eab93b794bfdc3eb3eac7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PURCHASES&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower is directly involved in the purchasing process, as they need to fulfil specific financial criteria for purchases."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-756642bc27ab7956732455451eb4ce71</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
