  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The LEASEHOLD ESTATE can be a subject secured by a MORTGAGE, connecting real estate interests and financing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3ca2c4d1778a11943201b4e917c15322</data>
