  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Consumer Price Index (CPI) may serve as an external index involved in the adjustment of lease payments, indicating a relationship between them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b81be5b6336b17987b5cd27bc0cf519d</data>
