<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">104.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The BORROWER is obligated on the MORTGAGE, which indicates a financial relationship centered around repayment and terms of the mortgage."&lt;SEP&gt;"The BORROWER is the individual or entity taking a MORTGAGE to secure financing for property acquisition."&lt;SEP&gt;"The BORROWER is the individual or entity that receives a MORTGAGE from the LENDER, establishing a fundamental relationship in the lending process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is directly involved in securing a mortgage, establishing a fundamental relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The MORTGAGE is a financial instrument that directly involves the BORROWER as a debtor securing loans against property."&lt;SEP&gt;"The MORTGAGE is contingent on the Borrower meeting all outlined criteria including employment and financial verification."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower is directly linked to the mortgage as they are responsible for repaying the debt associated with it."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower is the entity applying for the mortgage, thus their financial details are crucial to the mortgage process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower is the individual applying for a mortgage, thus directly linked to mortgage eligibility requirements including stable income conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower seeks a mortgage to purchase property, linking their financial need to the mortgage process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The mortgage directly involves the borrower, as they must be obligated under the agreement to secure funding for properties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b58c2a47b041d2502022392c611f405c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f01d27887cb1edc56efdd9355e2cbba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f67964fc288da88f7bb3defef1f29177&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-144555be48c11828e99c3a7c623170fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31dff4bfbf6291a2db9c4969e0f5cbe0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9004bef6d0a745fff75d973c6b90ef4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-105c313a28b49198d2d2b78db6e7529b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7705559d232d0e6b4978eff8d1e8b137&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ca2c4d1778a11943201b4e917c15322&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2eef4940eec1ef97062f77d3efe4074e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
