  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Conventional underwriting guidelines dictate the standards for mortgage eligibility and insurance requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conventional underwriting guidelines provide criteria for processing various mortgage applications including those for detached condominium units."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6261b628a88157f5bd4a959ee8fdb8f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3455e52007c02e364a735d4c4a7efa70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE&quot;" target="&quot;UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">25.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES dictate how properties encumbered by a MORTGAGE with the primary dwelling are handled during the financing process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Underwriting guidelines dictate the requirements necessary for the Mortgage approval process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Underwriting guidelines dictate the requirements that the Borrower must meet to qualify for the mortgage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-98fca990e6b71624308defbc9fca0285&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-452a34dee684e3a93929cc44930deb38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
