  <data key="d5">"FREDDIE MAC provides guidelines regarding contributions that influence CLOSING COSTS in borrowing arrangements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac has specific guidelines regarding the handling of closing costs in transactions, linking them in the lending process."</data>
