  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FANNIE MAE outlines regulations concerning lender contributions to CLOSING COSTS for borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Similar to Freddie Mac, Fannie Mae also has provisions regarding closing costs that borrowers must adhere to."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-66bee43127ef8c394af00a30febd1833&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9640138f8accaa3b0962e60c94ddc9b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLOSING COSTS&quot;" target="&quot;MATCHING FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Matching funds can be applied to cover some or all of the borrower's closing costs, depending on the nonprofit agency's rules."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-23ec06f9f4a15f1cb40e52e628766be9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLOSING COSTS&quot;" target="&quot;UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Underwriting guidelines dictate the assessment of closing costs, ensuring they are appropriately covered by the borrower's funds."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-164ff18d322608d7342cc1d0619c9f0f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLOSING COSTS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">30.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Funds for closing costs must be accurately accounted for in the borrower's overall financial assessment."&lt;SEP&gt;"The BORROWER must cover CLOSING COSTS as part of the finalization of the mortgage."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is required to pay Closing Costs as part of the mortgage transaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower is responsible for covering closing costs, which are critical in the mortgage approval process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-756818f22cafd11009f520745a0306df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-909c805f10bec3b9745cd64c1852b1fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e28f33ddf3b335e19135327f9afb2b07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-023647e2d4d4ed50a6e5f501c055a8b5</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
