<edge source="&quot;CONVENTIONAL UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;" target="&quot;FREDDIE MAC&quot;">
  <data key="d4">136.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FREDDIE MAC also establishes conventional underwriting guidelines that must be followed in the mortgage process, similar to FANNIE MAE."&lt;SEP&gt;"FREDDIE MAC operates under the framework of CONVENTIONAL UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES, showing the structured approach in property financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"FREDDIE MAC provides specific guidelines for conventional underwriting practices in refinancing scenarios, showing procedural clarity."&lt;SEP&gt;"FREDDIE MAC's policies are a key component of CONVENTIONAL UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES that lenders follow."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac also follows conventional underwriting guidelines to determine borrower eligibility and mortgage terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac establishes Conventional Underwriting Guidelines that dictate the terms and conditions for loan approvals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac follows conventional underwriting guidelines that dictate how loans are processed and assessed for eligibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac outlines conventional underwriting guidelines that affect how loans are assessed and approved."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac provides guidelines for the appraisal process that must be followed by appraisers in their reports."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac references conventional underwriting guidelines as part of their appraisal framework, aligning with Fannie Mae's guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac transactions must adhere to Conventional Underwriting Guidelines, which govern financed property transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac's guidelines are a type of conventional underwriting that incorporates specific rules for solar panel financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac's guidelines include specific conventional underwriting guidelines for properties with ADUs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac's guidelines influence the conventional underwriting practices that must be adhered to during loan approvals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac's guidelines set the standards for conventional underwriting in mortgage processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac's practices adhere to Conventional Underwriting Guidelines, illustrating its regulatory framework for transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac's stipulations and guidelines impact conventional underwriting processes similarly to Fannie Mae."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a021e31a2283c93026e9b4e4159dcdf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b58c2a47b041d2502022392c611f405c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24638398312c4aec93c00e795739cbf9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05495faf7d0cd92781a907bc384d2f21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10ce55972cf12e21fd77796ab69a96ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-446d02f0d6609ee8a932eea7a8d1302e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31dff4bfbf6291a2db9c4969e0f5cbe0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d83092219c6a0be0948a52ad38b945a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e98d878b21daedfefbf36b036612418f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37ec0ad59b15ed4e4c83850695f40593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1cb7303f4ec7884e602c27628160dc28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d77c56c7ef7f25742c687f6ad137c8f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81edfb1496d26226dca5f3238aa461cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61ba5485d92daa30adf4ee02bfab7d8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7705559d232d0e6b4978eff8d1e8b137&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9da80c7f63e32b0d7dc6df2ae9032546&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3455e52007c02e364a735d4c4a7efa70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONVENTIONAL UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">54.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Borrowers must meet conventional underwriting guidelines set by lenders for loan approval."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conventional Underwriting Guidelines must be followed to assess a Borrower's eligibility for a loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Guidelines impact how borrowers qualify for loans based on their financial status and asset verification."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must comply with Conventional Underwriting Guidelines for loan application assessment."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower's eligibility and process are shaped by the conventional underwriting guidelines, indicating a strong relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower's application must meet the conventional underwriting guidelines to ensure eligibility for a mortgage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f67964fc288da88f7bb3defef1f29177&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05495faf7d0cd92781a907bc384d2f21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e28f33ddf3b335e19135327f9afb2b07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e857c204b7048098a278905f60d5302&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ae330f51f478e78f1b91957f17dcdec</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONVENTIONAL UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;" target="&quot;UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">76.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"CONVENTIONAL UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES set the standards and expectations for evaluating borrowers as part of broader UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conventional Underwriting Guidelines are a part of the broader Underwriting Guidelines set for transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conventional Underwriting Guidelines are a specific set of standards within the broader Underwriting Guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conventional Underwriting Guidelines are a subset of broader underwriting guidelines that govern real estate transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conventional Underwriting Guidelines serve as a framework within the broader Underwriting Guidelines for assessing borrower eligibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conventional underwriting guidelines are a set of rules that shape overall underwriting guidelines for loans and financial evaluations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conventional underwriting guidelines are a subset of broader underwriting guidelines applied in mortgage processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conventional underwriting guidelines encompass rules for evaluating loans including those affected by derogatory events like bankruptcy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conventional underwriting guidelines often detail the assessment and evaluation processes similar to other underwriting guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conventional underwriting guidelines provide the framework for evaluating loans related to manufactured and modular homes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b58c2a47b041d2502022392c611f405c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53373dd554a175653540f360348f32eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-843cd03316121e01909837126fbbe24c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7482b9f302a8cac2d717810389222b99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf0031128e81eed5883f39146514f546&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-341a8217a86a20f7b3a1712ac24de48f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1cb7303f4ec7884e602c27628160dc28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9640138f8accaa3b0962e60c94ddc9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a01c4d224477788cf5c6bfd6ccc84e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f443d70c1b97ab92c6f9f441ec9ced99</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONVENTIONAL UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;" target="&quot;FANNIE MAE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">145.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Conventional underwriting guidelines must align with requirements set by Fannie Mae regarding homeownership education."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"FANNIE MAE establishes the CONVENTIONAL UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES that dictate mortgage eligibility and processing."&lt;SEP&gt;"FANNIE MAE outlines guidelines for appraisals as part of CONVENTIONAL UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES."&lt;SEP&gt;"FANNIE MAE provides guidelines that specify conventional underwriting processes for various mortgage scenarios, including for condominiums."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae adheres to conventional underwriting guidelines similar to those of Freddie Mac, guiding mortgage loan evaluations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae also establishes conventional underwriting guidelines, impacting borrowers and lenders alike."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae establishes conventional underwriting guidelines for mortgage transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae establishes conventional underwriting guidelines that set standards for mortgage lending."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae establishes the Conventional Underwriting Guidelines that govern mortgage loan applications and approvals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae follows conventional underwriting guidelines for mortgage assessments and loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae guidelines require compliance with conventional underwriting processes, linking underwriting to Fannie Mae standards."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae is responsible for establishing conventional underwriting guidelines that impact loan applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae provides guidelines for borrowing, which include conditions under conventional underwriting guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae provides specific conventional underwriting guidelines for mortgage evaluation and approval processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae provides the framework for conventional underwriting guidelines that must be followed in transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae sets conventional underwriting guidelines that govern how property appraisals should be conducted."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae's requirements and guidelines influence the underwriting process for conventional loans."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a021e31a2283c93026e9b4e4159dcdf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b58c2a47b041d2502022392c611f405c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f01d27887cb1edc56efdd9355e2cbba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05495faf7d0cd92781a907bc384d2f21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1eb0558635c4f1b731b5f38c1ed9bb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f443d70c1b97ab92c6f9f441ec9ced99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f76dd878d76d1e8bdf5fb1cac46447ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c392c46c8ab1fb7407628dd97c6f2c74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d1c3e36c841bdc1a7ede120ae160e58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12708616563afb36a31ad3cf8523241b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3455e52007c02e364a735d4c4a7efa70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1fc933db1bd6fd3476c94d029ad8540&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe6ee5848653e2ade85b8c44b7433dac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61ba5485d92daa30adf4ee02bfab7d8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d83092219c6a0be0948a52ad38b945a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9d7483a0c4012d30e50767206255bda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8241f9b00004d342f0da796cabf2a5f2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">60.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower's eligibility and financial profile must adhere to the established underwriting guidelines for loan approval."&lt;SEP&gt;"The underwriter must evaluate the borrower's income stability according to the underwriting guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Underwriting Guidelines dictate how a Borrower's application is evaluated for loan eligibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Underwriting Guidelines dictate the criteria borrowers must meet in securing loans, directly impacting loan approvals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Underwriting Guidelines dictate the standards and procedures utilized to evaluate borrower applications using sound financial practices."&lt;SEP&gt;"Underwriting guidelines dictate the evaluation criteria for the borrower's financial situation and eligibility for loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Underwriting guidelines specify the financial criteria that the borrower must meet to qualify for the mortgage."</data>
  <data key="d6">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e912b60195be8ca87a44127ef55d282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9004bef6d0a745fff75d973c6b90ef4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8864c52069485823a39babaa2b2005e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ae330f51f478e78f1b91957f17dcdec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95358b428c5f107947a116a0643878c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7705559d232d0e6b4978eff8d1e8b137</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;" target="&quot;FREDDIE MAC&quot;">
  <data key="d4">94.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FREDDIE MAC also has its own UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES that apply to the loans it securitizes."&lt;SEP&gt;"FREDDIE MAC has specific underwriting guidelines that relate to the treatment of properties with ADUs."&lt;SEP&gt;"FREDDIE MAC provides specific underwriting guidelines that dictate how appraisals are to be performed."&lt;SEP&gt;"FREDDIE MAC's loan products are also governed by their own set of underwriting guidelines, similar to FANNIE MAE's."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac also provides underwriting guidelines that are essential for the mortgage lending process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac defines specific Underwriting Guidelines that must be adhered to in the lending process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac establishes its own underwriting guidelines that dictate loan eligibility and processing practices."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac outlines specific underwriting guidelines that mortgage applications must meet to qualify for funding."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac sets the underwriting guidelines that dictate the procedures and requirements for mortgage lending."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac’s underwriting guidelines provide the framework for assessing the borrower's financial qualifications."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Underwriting Guidelines set forth by Freddie Mac govern all mortgage transactions, affecting borrowers significantly."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2e912b60195be8ca87a44127ef55d282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-843cd03316121e01909837126fbbe24c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b8e57f220eeefd0215ac958c381bc47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf6a394b54c040882b94d8dd97b886e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e252311920cec13b843fb034a4a69e94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-faa30e2538a6e107a9cdb96ee1067084&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0ff713c7eebcf293485e860ba8cc6a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7705559d232d0e6b4978eff8d1e8b137&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ed1a879d48c49b16f42ce89ae56d954&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9fd7a30043bf2ff61e50fbd6141d212&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42fe7768b333d42fc15f00fc4e0ba0d3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;" target="&quot;FANNIE MAE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">94.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FANNIE MAE establishes specific UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES that must be followed for mortgage loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"FANNIE MAE provides underwriting guidelines that are essential for the assessment of loan applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae establishes underwriting guidelines that dictate the approval process for potential borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae provides specific underwriting guidelines that must be followed during the mortgage qualification process, particularly concerning temporary leaves."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae sets the underwriting guidelines that dictate how rental income should be analyzed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae sets underwriting guidelines that lenders must follow when evaluating borrowers for mortgage loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae's HomePath program adheres to specific underwriting guidelines to ensure compliance for mortgage approval."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae's policies influence underwriting guidelines, shaping how loans are processed under their framework."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae's policies may include distinct Underwriting Guidelines that operate differently from Freddie Mac's guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae's underwriting guidelines dictate how loans for owner-occupied transactions should be processed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Underwriting guidelines set by Fannie Mae dictate eligibility criteria for properties, affecting lease-related transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2e912b60195be8ca87a44127ef55d282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-144555be48c11828e99c3a7c623170fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e252311920cec13b843fb034a4a69e94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7c7059ebd575d1369f6649db3e25ee4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a008bee56d46d46fc9de7e014d26695&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1cb7303f4ec7884e602c27628160dc28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49e500168a0590aef42a229f4ea93fe3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0ff713c7eebcf293485e860ba8cc6a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-faa30e2538a6e107a9cdb96ee1067084&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9fd7a30043bf2ff61e50fbd6141d212&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efc5b39715a3cc6b0751b8cfe29a66e7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;" target="&quot;FLAGSTAR BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Flagstar Bank has specific underwriting guidelines that must be followed for loan processing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-3ae330f51f478e78f1b91957f17dcdec</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FREDDIE MAC&quot;" target="&quot;FLAGSTAR BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">75.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"FLAGSTAR BANK must review the terms and conditions of the resale restrictions as part of the underwriting process outlined by FREDDIE MAC."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar Bank adheres to guidelines that must align with Freddie Mac's specific lending requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar Bank collaborates with Freddie Mac in purchasing loans and adhering to refinancing guidelines laid out by this organization."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar Bank does not accept Freddie Mac's ACE offering, indicating a competitive or regulatory relationship between the two entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar Bank excludes various Freddie Mac products from its offerings, affecting its mortgage solutions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar Bank must comply with Freddie Mac's selling guidelines for exception reviews."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar Bank utilizes Freddie Mac's automated underwriting systems, such as Desktop Underwriter, for conforming loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac and Flagstar Bank are connected through their guidelines on mortgage loans and related financial policies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac and Flagstar Bank have differing guidelines regarding the use of Power of Attorney in loan transactions, particularly concerning e-signed POA."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac outlines the conditions under which Flagstar Bank may not qualify borrowers based on variable pay from financially troubled companies."</data>
  <data key="d6">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d864e2754e1d5a70d89033bc8babcdcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4d4f9535ffe4c256b83a381ed8c6791&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-388d67b329a7c9987f1aa1ce87dad2a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c0b7f4552e556318a58e96c9230e51e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f91be92d53c1aed3b7126461f33e415&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-756818f22cafd11009f520745a0306df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a0d9684317720eb42eaa206a9f3cc5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-241759937af28f9856986aac2ee15cb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3455e52007c02e364a735d4c4a7efa70</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FREDDIE MAC&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">51.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FREDDIE MAC guidelines influence how the BORROWER's ownership stakes and income are assessed, especially for partnerships or LLCs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac guidelines also impose restrictions on the number of properties a borrower can own across financing, influencing borrower eligibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac has specific guidelines that borrowers must follow when applying for loans, including the acceptable use of Power of Attorney."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac sets the requirement for the Borrower to start employment within a specified timeframe before closing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac's guidelines dictate the income documentation process that the borrower must follow."&lt;SEP&gt;"Freddie Mac's underwriting guidelines require documentation from the borrower to assess tax return statuses and tax filing deadlines."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-843cd03316121e01909837126fbbe24c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a173c08400538977a1dc5397bceda0a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a0d9684317720eb42eaa206a9f3cc5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7705559d232d0e6b4978eff8d1e8b137&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27c5b5517eef234cf0db585936ec28f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31a563a8507e131e7544819dbd9373b4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
