<edge source="&quot;FREDDIE MAC&quot;" target="&quot;LEADER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Freddie Mac's guidelines affect the financing of properties with solar panels, emphasizing compliance with community standards."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-37ec0ad59b15ed4e4c83850695f40593</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FREDDIE MAC&quot;" target="&quot;FANNIE MAE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">374.0</data>
  <data key="d5">FANNIE MAE and FREDDIE MAC are both key players in the mortgage industry, operating in the secondary mortgage market and providing guidelines for loan underwriting, borrower obligations, employment verification, rental income calculations, and refinancing scenarios. They have specific guidelines for various mortgage transactions, including Texas Home Equity loans and share similar guidelines for underwriting, funding options, and lender requirements. Both entities play pivotal roles in the secondary mortgage market, influencing each other's policies and collaborating on appraisal processes, loan eligibility, and underwriting practices. While they have overlapping guidelines, they may differ in policies like the use of Power of Attorney. In summary, FANNIE MAE and FREDDIE MAC have significant impacts on the mortgage financing market, providing guidelines and regulations that affect various aspects of mortgage transactions and property financing processes.</data>
  <data key="d6">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-137c762b3ac588b243786790757dd239&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a021e31a2283c93026e9b4e4159dcdf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e912b60195be8ca87a44127ef55d282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53373dd554a175653540f360348f32eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f76dd878d76d1e8bdf5fb1cac46447ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e252311920cec13b843fb034a4a69e94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8eefd188642258e1fb627891c7c2dbb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-756818f22cafd11009f520745a0306df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3e0ec6e1adaeb678f542089515e77ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4de71275bc933c2c228984f601d0e0a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05020d8707d581b6c2d0c1b184d17f01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61ba5485d92daa30adf4ee02bfab7d8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-645973893eaf0e8d2eb4a7822c3fe6eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f443d70c1b97ab92c6f9f441ec9ced99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3455e52007c02e364a735d4c4a7efa70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b58c2a47b041d2502022392c611f405c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e857c204b7048098a278905f60d5302&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48dc06181f6c67399f82ff0110257532&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66bee43127ef8c394af00a30febd1833&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d10b21d56993c3c6bc0aa80dd4168911&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-444e5ed0aa3891f1dfc3371133a3be60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1578b8b51044019bfff38a69eecab0be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d77c56c7ef7f25742c687f6ad137c8f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1cb7303f4ec7884e602c27628160dc28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-164ff18d322608d7342cc1d0619c9f0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91cf1d5ee6d1d8b224c54c5417b6eaee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b41d8874999d184a44ade7d9217e24a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f066acdedf5a2cb0d5c7abb401d7c950&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31dff4bfbf6291a2db9c4969e0f5cbe0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b4494b2a290a96f3ee6a9d358a812a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-341a8217a86a20f7b3a1712ac24de48f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-388d67b329a7c9987f1aa1ce87dad2a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9ffcad15481c83b74cda33a0148728&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cefb0ad4148eab93b794bfdc3eb3eac7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60ae7a36306412ca14db54586048b8bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-398938dbff78b05d0c3830d36e6918b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a01c4d224477788cf5c6bfd6ccc84e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d83092219c6a0be0948a52ad38b945a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24638398312c4aec93c00e795739cbf9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f359b1edc6f123eca67b08265c9b89e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed0db69e97fa62c70a7cb29c5e75fe07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00440a55cc64896de959c80a8727fbfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dd59acfc6b78474b4cbf40ec7d05399&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-458b7b4c2fb6c14a263231eb6f3f6192&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46cceddf672b67421d8f87a3665f1ddf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c315a6b793aa073b8f6cb2ffb42e4f97</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
