  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;OPTION TO PURCHASE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Option to Purchase is a contractual agreement that can affect the financial evaluations relevant to the borrower's commitments during loan processes."</data>
