  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;SPEED OF LENDING PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Speed of Lending Process can impact the borrower’s overall financial outcome by streamlining or complicating loan applications based on documentation submitted."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;ACCEPTABLE SOURCES FOR FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Acceptable Sources for Funds are critically examined in the context of validating potential income contributions during loan applications by the borrower."</data>
